[
  {
    "Id": "023835C4-2FCE-4412-9659-34BE3D5EACD8",
    "Title": "Tort de morcovi",
    "Description": "Un desert delicios care combin\u0103 savoarea unic\u0103 a ingredientelor \u00eentr-o re\u021bet\u0103 rafinat\u0103. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Tort_de_morcovi.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "Desert",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"dfdd8a36-333e-4a75-aec3-5ea3ef26b093\",\"Name\":\"nuca\",\"Amount\":100,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"ab02248e-76c6-4652-b99d-3c1e5a552027\",\"Name\":\"morcovi ra\\u0219i\",\"Amount\":300,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"82632c5c-434a-4e69-a885-fff42b8a5b22\",\"Name\":\"faina\",\"Amount\":260,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"263066e4-474d-4e2c-a578-7fdfc5bac017\",\"Name\":\"1/ 2 lingurita bicarbonat de sodiu\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"e91fedf5-53c8-4f13-a1a5-3334967785a5\",\"Name\":\"praf de copt\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"tsp\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"65f6204c-4628-421a-bee1-a6b0f45105dd\",\"Name\":\"un praf de sare\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"14ff7da7-1472-4741-8df5-fe989f69f608\",\"Name\":\"1-1/2 lingurita scortisoara\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"de5e104c-c116-41fd-bf5e-497203131ac4\",\"Name\":\"optional ( ghimbir\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":8},{\"Id\":\"b8376a93-d463-423c-9147-904bb1e281c7\",\"Name\":\"cuisoare\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":9},{\"Id\":\"094e5528-5293-4a08-8b28-d425fb3c2390\",\"Name\":\"cardamon ..... )\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":10},{\"Id\":\"b223401f-bec1-4c83-bf10-e6313b6b335f\",\"Name\":\"oua\",\"Amount\":4,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":11},{\"Id\":\"f52a8218-ea21-4d0c-8cb7-3a13f393ccbe\",\"Name\":\"zahar brun\",\"Amount\":200,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":12},{\"Id\":\"874bd93d-4c85-4e8d-af8a-371011409b7e\",\"Name\":\"ulei\",\"Amount\":160,\"Unit\":\"ml\",\"Order\":13},{\"Id\":\"6ac59676-fa29-4715-acfd-a061d1adeb86\",\"Name\":\"extract de vanilie sau zahar vanilat\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"tsp\",\"Order\":14},{\"Id\":\"f087e8d0-715e-47bb-bf9f-7b37eab26c7c\",\"Name\":\"coaja de portocala\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":15},{\"Id\":\"61da4923-f6f6-4343-a947-eec038d30599\",\"Name\":\"suc proaspat de portocale sau piure de mere .\",\"Amount\":50,\"Unit\":\"ml\",\"Order\":16}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"ef9974bb-cfd1-42ac-bcf8-3dc78b611108\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"\\u00CEncingem cuptorul la 180 de grade si tapetam cu foaie de copt 2 tavi cu diametrul de 20 - 24 cm sau una singura\"},{\"Id\":\"c6864e88-f4ab-4a08-a0b9-a849a330b5fe\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Intr un bol punem faina , praful de copt , bicarbonatul de sodiu , sarea si scortisoara ( puteti adauga si mix pt turta dulce sau nucsoara , anason etc ) - rez\"},{\"Id\":\"4123c775-a643-405c-8a56-1358eef4697a\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Pulverizam zaharul , coaja de portocale si cuisoarele 40 sec vit progresiva pana la 10 - se rezerva\"},{\"Id\":\"ac27535a-6aee-4635-99b9-d42f59858ec3\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Morcovii curatati si taiati in rondele 5 sec / vit cf5 - se rezerva\"},{\"Id\":\"f6470de6-80f3-43f8-a001-58ca2f3c6683\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"Adaugam uleiul , ouale , sucul sau piureul , vanilie si zaharul rezervat 1 min / vit 5 -6 , se pune paharul de masurare pe capac\"},{\"Id\":\"ba5c604d-dd3a-47a5-a3aa-b113e4299bb1\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"Se adauga faina rezervata 20 sec / vit 4 - 5.\"},{\"Id\":\"ff2fc43b-a039-4f82-968d-664deaf77080\",\"StepNumber\":7,\"Text\":\"Adaugam morcovii si nucile 10 sec / vit 3 / 4 sau mai mult daca este necesar\"},{\"Id\":\"a122bec8-a7de-4f2b-8ca5-13d400eff303\",\"StepNumber\":8,\"Text\":\"Eu am pus in plus o mana de stafide si putina ciocolata rasa deasupra aluatului , in forma si am amestecat usor la suprafata.\"},{\"Id\":\"38a2d281-598e-4809-ac06-c92f4fd71d31\",\"StepNumber\":9,\"Text\":\"Forma a fost de 24 cm ( cam mare )\"},{\"Id\":\"f6a6b8d5-539e-44e6-8fbf-813ca1cc904d\",\"StepNumber\":10,\"Text\":\"Am copt 50 min 180 \\u00B0 dar totul depinde de cuptor , au fost fost cazuri cand a ramas crud, asa ca va cunoasteti cuptorul puneti la 170 \\u00B0 60 min - aici am editat\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2075943",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2075943"
  },
  {
    "Id": "0239FA36-C6BA-4EBB-ABC1-F0E0A1E22889",
    "Title": "Napolitane cu caramel si nuca",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Napolitane_cu_caramel_si_nuca.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 1,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"4ff01526-80d3-4266-ad06-12ed5ac64a22\",\"Name\":\"nuca maruntita\",\"Amount\":250,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"28a32de9-786e-4ad8-a377-2f6be41339c7\",\"Name\":\"zahar tos\",\"Amount\":250,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"a94369c2-604d-45cd-bcc7-c61e2fa8f207\",\"Name\":\"unt la temperatura camerei\",\"Amount\":200,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"dbcff223-4f64-474d-b243-7fcb9894e452\",\"Name\":\"zahar pudra\",\"Amount\":150,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"4955c96c-2fd3-48d6-9145-ead4805a4972\",\"Name\":\"oua\",\"Amount\":4,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"4007edab-688f-4520-b073-3b95d7da50f6\",\"Name\":\"napolitana mici\",\"Amount\":3,\"Unit\":\"foi\",\"Order\":6}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"2649fce3-958e-43ee-b14f-c74536d1df5c\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"250 g nuca maruntita * 250 g zahar tos * 200 g unt la temperatura camerei * 150 g zahar pudra * 4 oua * 3 foi napolitana mici\"},{\"Id\":\"9179a2bd-d753-4977-a4ee-16a88f097b52\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Untul si ouale trebuie sa fie la temperatura camerei. Se spumeaza untul cu zaharul pudra. Dupa ce s-a obtinnut o crema fina se adauga ouale rand pe rand.\"},{\"Id\":\"aba2d14a-3799-49ef-9b90-6ab9c52fb967\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Intr-o cratita se pune zaharul tos si se da pe foc fara a se arde. Dupa ce s-a topit se adauga nuca. Apoi se toarna compozitia cu unt si oua si se amesteca bine pana se obtine o crema caramel.\"},{\"Id\":\"85c87816-508d-4a3b-94c1-56dc1a7ccb89\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Compozitia se toarna asa calda intre foile de napolitana. Se da la rece dupa ce se raceste.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2097582",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2097582"
  },
  {
    "Id": "06120F9B-A73C-4E8B-9268-B84436BACCF6",
    "Title": "Covrigei, saratele",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Covrigei,_saratele.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"38344625-acd1-4ad8-b6dd-606a979cde76\",\"Name\":\"ou\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"9974e6b1-8485-416e-9da5-6809d082534e\",\"Name\":\"1lg\\u021B drojdie uscat\\u0103 (jum\\u0103tate plic de 7g) diluat\\u0103 \\u00EEn 15ml ap\\u0103 c\\u0103ldu\\u021B\\u0103 - eu am pus un plic de 10gr\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"d43a65e4-2b92-438b-9d2a-10840308c91c\",\"Name\":\"F\\u0103in\\u0103 tip 650\",\"Amount\":600,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"c1ff3b43-f598-4f2e-9d51-ac093875d3f5\",\"Name\":\"untur\\u0103 (de ra\\u021B\\u0103 am pus)\",\"Amount\":200,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"36c8309c-cbda-48f1-a8bc-e3414a68d247\",\"Name\":\"sm\\u00E2nt\\u00E2n\\u0103 fermentata de 35%\",\"Amount\":200,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"e0d02432-2c50-4426-89bf-7e8f544e54c7\",\"Name\":\"telemea\",\"Amount\":200,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"49976a41-16ae-496b-bde1-8fa4a2d053ec\",\"Name\":\"Ou pt uns \\u0219i Susan, Mac, ca\\u0219caval pt pres\\u0103rat\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":7}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"d8de7b0b-d48d-4b88-989d-2d1c997f60b4\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"1 ou 1lg\\u021B drojdie uscat\\u0103 (jum\\u0103tate plic de 7g) diluat\\u0103 \\u00EEn 15ml ap\\u0103 c\\u0103ldu\\u021B\\u0103 - eu am pus un plic de 10gr 600g F\\u0103in\\u0103 tip 650 200g untur\\u0103 (de ra\\u021B\\u0103 am pus) 200g sm\\u00E2nt\\u00E2n\\u0103 fermentata de 35% 200g telemea Ou pt uns \\u0219i Susan, Mac, ca\\u0219caval pt pres\\u0103rat\"},{\"Id\":\"39261b2c-4db7-4fcc-88c8-3e351c9cf4c5\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Cu cat st\\u0103 compozi\\u021Bia mai mult la frigider cu at\\u00E2t ies mai fragede. L\\u0103sat\\u0103 \\u0219i foaia un pic mai gr\\u0103su\\u021B\\u0103, nu \\u00EEntins\\u0103 maxim.\"},{\"Id\":\"0b675e38-eb14-4129-aca3-4962bb16a3d9\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Toate ingredientele se adaug\\u0103 \\u00EEntr-un bol \\u0219i se fr\\u0103m\\u00E2nt\\u0103 un aluat nelipicios dar totu\\u0219i moale. P\\u0103stra\\u021Bi 100g f\\u0103in\\u0103 \\u0219i o Ad\\u0103uga\\u021Bi doar la nevoie dac\\u0103 aluatul este \\u00EEnc\\u0103 prea lipicios. \\u00CEn func\\u021Bie de tipul de f\\u0103in\\u0103 folosit sau br\\u00E2nza folosit\\u0103 dac\\u0103 nu folosi\\u021Bi tot de monor, aluatul se va comporta diferit.\"},{\"Id\":\"9fcc3e3e-9212-4007-8685-11fe939bf519\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Se \\u00EEnvele\\u0219te \\u00EEn folie \\u0219i se mut\\u0103 \\u00EEn frigider pt **24** ore sau minim peste noapte.\"},{\"Id\":\"bba0e626-40df-4ac0-a285-dfe0b177f174\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"A doua zi se scoate aluatul din frigider \\u0219i se \\u00EEmparte \\u00EEn 4. Se \\u00EEntinde pe suprafa\\u021Ba pudrat\\u0103 cu f\\u0103in\\u0103 o foaie de aprox 3-5mm \\u0219i se decupeaz\\u0103 covrigei sau s\\u0103ratele. Se ung cu ou \\u0219i se presar\\u0103 Susan, Mac sau ca\\u0219caval.\"},{\"Id\":\"f60a4b20-3c38-4f64-b6f2-7c83fbe8f29b\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"Se coc \\u00EEn cuptorul \\u00EEncins pe **180C** timp de **15-16(20)** minute.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2099942",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2099942"
  },
  {
    "Id": "06B615BA-1584-43E5-A525-81307C5A5B90",
    "Title": "Turta dulce cu pasta de fructe uscate",
    "Description": "Un desert delicios care combin\u0103 savoarea unic\u0103 a ingredientelor \u00eentr-o re\u021bet\u0103 rafinat\u0103. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Turta_dulce_cu_pasta_de_fructe_uscate.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "Desert",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"10aaa7af-9791-42c4-b7da-06eb2ba9a0b1\",\"Name\":\"Pasta fructe:\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"104a0bef-f66c-453c-9c30-c93e20e752ed\",\"Name\":\"curmale\",\"Amount\":16,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"96cc4084-446c-4487-8c99-de2dc6ec311e\",\"Name\":\"stafide\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"tbsp\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"e2fda0ff-817f-4acb-b4da-9c5537b5878e\",\"Name\":\"merisoare\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"tbsp\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"5c8654ee-0692-4840-b329-e257ef389dab\",\"Name\":\"lapte cat sa le acopere (pana in 300ml)\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"b1d7f67b-38ba-4556-91ed-27b7a44023d2\",\"Name\":\"Turta:\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"c056f41a-051a-44c8-9f8e-4ceca0400423\",\"Name\":\"faina (integrala cernuta)\",\"Amount\":320,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"7ca7c375-b27e-4314-9961-a9f90a16cc97\",\"Name\":\"unt\",\"Amount\":100,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":8},{\"Id\":\"bcc51513-0723-4645-b01b-afc984b15791\",\"Name\":\"ou\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":9},{\"Id\":\"daa56c52-4b84-436c-9f46-1a022b5ec8a1\",\"Name\":\"pasta fructe\",\"Amount\":160,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":10},{\"Id\":\"d6ad9001-58cd-4905-a12d-3b15bda3e9fd\",\"Name\":\"condimente turta dulce\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"tsp\",\"Order\":11},{\"Id\":\"301c5687-69b5-410f-a6f8-8a19e0434672\",\"Name\":\"1/2 lingurite ghimbir\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":12},{\"Id\":\"b09a986c-4731-41b3-b88e-c635efda762d\",\"Name\":\"scortisoara\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"tsp\",\"Order\":13}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"254a436e-f232-4d60-a05f-9d4ae3b0e0f4\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"Pasta fructe: * 16 curmale * 2 linguri stafide * 2 linguri merisoare * lapte cat sa le acopere (pana in 300ml) Turta: * 320g faina (integrala cernuta) * 100g unt * 1 ou * 160g pasta fructe * 2 lingurite condimente turta dulce * 1/2 lingurite ghimbir * 2 lingurite scortisoara\"},{\"Id\":\"fadef969-f035-4d66-82ae-b98c030930b6\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Fructele uscate se lasa la hidratat, apoi se blendeaza cu o parte din laptele de pe ele, pana se obtine o pasta.\"},{\"Id\":\"ca944cd0-7330-4215-862d-182ecf8c95ac\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Untul se topeste. Se adauga restul ingredientelor si se mixeaza (la tmx 1 min, apoi framantare 3 min).\"},{\"Id\":\"d81f8aad-09ed-442b-beb8-fdcb287b257d\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Se pune compozitia la frigider macar 4 ore.\"},{\"Id\":\"61d573f9-7399-492e-b34a-e4744c29226f\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"Se scoate cu jumatate de ora inainte de a lucra cu ea. Se intinde foaie de 5-6mm. Se decupeaza si se da la cuptor la 180grade pentru 9-10 min.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2099942",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2099942"
  },
  {
