  },
  {
    "Id": "0C0AB52A-0B47-43E8-BA34-5A217996F0A1",
    "Title": "Painici naan umplute cu branza",
    "Description": "Un mic dejun hr\u0103nitor \u0219i s\u0103n\u0103tos, ideal pentru a \u00eencepe ziua. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Painici_naan_umplute_cu_branza.png",
