  {
    "Id": "0F0BEDA2-A76A-4DE4-9DBA-FE0968A200F4",
    "Title": "Biscuiti cu mascarpone si nuci",
    "Description": "Un desert delicios care combin\u0103 savoarea unic\u0103 a ingredientelor \u00eentr-o re\u021bet\u0103 rafinat\u0103. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Biscuiti_cu_mascarpone_si_nuci.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "Desert",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"f6d7844e-498c-4878-a335-17d14b485050\",\"Name\":\"f\\u0103in\\u0103 de gr\\u00E2u tip 650\",\"Amount\":150,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"74ef51ee-7824-41e7-be9a-10b0d55e47ce\",\"Name\":\"unt rece de la frigider\",\"Amount\":75,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"a8979a70-23a4-4272-9759-e9c30a2ab18f\",\"Name\":\"mascarpone rece\",\"Amount\":120,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"3b07610f-853b-4d6a-8e55-6130750bda3d\",\"Name\":\"linguri\\u021B\\u0103 scor\\u021Bi\\u0219oar\\u0103 ceylon\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"279787d4-51f5-41d6-9907-eeb532dee011\",\"Name\":\"1/4 linguri\\u021B\\u0103 nuc\\u0219oar\\u0103\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"4b85101e-9627-42ba-a76b-9d260e5f4fc5\",\"Name\":\"m\\u00E2ini de nuci m\\u0103cinate\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"5de8a009-7952-41ba-bba9-63ca7d559102\",\"Name\":\"optional indulcitor (atunci mai trebuie faina)\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":7}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"2fc1c29a-fdee-4b43-bf4d-03a723ecf3a7\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"150g f\\u0103in\\u0103 de gr\\u00E2u tip 650 * 75g unt rece de la frigider * 120g mascarpone rece * 1 linguri\\u021B\\u0103 scor\\u021Bi\\u0219oar\\u0103 ceylon * 1/4 linguri\\u021B\\u0103 nuc\\u0219oar\\u0103 * 2 m\\u00E2ini de nuci m\\u0103cinate * optional indulcitor (atunci mai trebuie faina)\"},{\"Id\":\"2de158a9-e501-4564-bef6-b0a049a778cd\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"\\u00CEntr-un bol amesteca\\u021Bi f\\u0103ina cu scor\\u021Bi\\u0219oara, nuc\\u0219oara \\u0219i untul rece p\\u00E2n\\u0103 ce ob\\u021Bine\\u021Bi o textur\\u0103 nisipoas\\u0103, apoi \\u00EEncorpora\\u021Bi br\\u00E2nza mascarpone.\"},{\"Id\":\"e9fd12ec-39cf-4466-8f21-7940a459c1ad\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Introduce\\u021Bi aluatul la frigider 5-10 minute.\"},{\"Id\":\"e89f88d6-446c-4666-9a16-0ccfcdb657e4\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Pre\\u00EEnc\\u0103lzi\\u021Bi cuptorul la 180 grade cu ventila\\u021Bie.\"},{\"Id\":\"b8df390d-c9b2-4f6b-b6be-b7163a0ad7f8\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"Pe blatul de lucru pudrat cu f\\u0103in\\u0103 \\u00EEntinde\\u021Bi o foaie dreptunghiular\\u0103 de aluat, de aproximativ 2-3mm grosime.\"},{\"Id\":\"e51b5a28-fa4b-43b9-801d-a85e575424d4\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"Distribui\\u021Bi nucile m\\u0103cinate pe suprafa\\u021Ba foii de aluat, l\\u0103s\\u00E2nd goal\\u0103 o margine de aproximativ 2 degete.\"},{\"Id\":\"06021184-79e8-417a-af3a-965ae06ae51a\",\"StepNumber\":7,\"Text\":\"Ap\\u0103sa\\u021Bi pu\\u021Bin cu sucitorul pentru a se prinde nucile \\u00EEn aluat.\"},{\"Id\":\"22e93f25-16dd-4f6a-a969-a41eda2d5651\",\"StepNumber\":8,\"Text\":\"Rula\\u021Bi str\\u00E2ns, apoi t\\u0103ia\\u021Bi ruloul \\u00EEn felii de aproximativ 8-10mm.\"},{\"Id\":\"c781f08d-19bc-4b0d-8123-30545271d16f\",\"StepNumber\":9,\"Text\":\"A\\u0219eza\\u021Bi feliile \\u00EEntr-o tav\\u0103 tapetat\\u0103 cu h\\u00E2rtie de copt, l\\u0103s\\u00E2nd c\\u00E2\\u021Biva cm distan\\u021B\\u0103 \\u00EEntre ele, apoi aplatiza\\u021Bi-le cu m\\u00E2na, p\\u00E2n\\u0103 ajung la aproximativ 5mm grosime.\"},{\"Id\":\"384a934a-7211-42a2-b6c8-9c11ab459203\",\"StepNumber\":10,\"Text\":\"Introduce\\u021Bi tava \\u00EEn cuptorul pre\\u00EEnc\\u0103lzit \\u0219i coace\\u021Bi timp de 15-17 minute.\"},{\"Id\":\"5d3c79a3-7140-419a-ab45-3a467234d25e\",\"StepNumber\":11,\"Text\":\"C\\u00E2nd sunt gata l\\u0103sa\\u021Bi-i la r\\u0103cit pe un gr\\u0103tar metalic.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2112863",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2112863"
  },
  {
    "Id": "1018DA7C-0472-494F-8155-C083DCF5AB21",
    "Title": "Biscuiti cu unt fara zahar",
    "Description": "Un desert delicios care combin\u0103 savoarea unic\u0103 a ingredientelor \u00eentr-o re\u021bet\u0103 rafinat\u0103. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Biscuiti_cu_unt_fara_zahar.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 0,
    "CuisineType": "Desert",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"cb2db0e6-1777-4d35-9d9d-8c946db68dda\",\"Name\":\"unt light la temp camerei\",\"Amount\":90,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"d7b10c49-9242-4b27-a3c3-0f3ddfe69f7c\",\"Name\":\"un galbenus\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"7f0666e5-b261-4e6b-9206-f05abab510ce\",\"Name\":\"esenta de vanilie\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"74d7abfe-bc32-4603-b19f-a0a73760bc96\",\"Name\":\"faina\",\"Amount\":140,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"2519db50-e3d3-472d-9973-df91051f3b4d\",\"Name\":\"miere pentru uns\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":5}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"68c33184-86ad-45e0-bdb1-bdb10ba889c9\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"90 gr unt light la temp camerei * un galbenus * esenta de vanilie * 140 gr faina * miere pentru uns\"},{\"Id\":\"bd4b2eaa-0eb6-441c-ab20-32cc76d45ccb\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Se amesteca toate bine si se formeaza bilute de 20gr din aluatul obtinut. Se pun pe tava si se aplatizeaza cu un pahar. In mijloc se pun bucatele de ciocolata sau orice altceva.\"},{\"Id\":\"288e53e1-4d3c-41de-a80f-105466ff05e6\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Se dau la cuptor pentru 15-20 min. Dupa ce s-au racit s-au uns cu putina miere\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2113515",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2113515"
  },
  {
    "Id": "106265C6-40B4-4D56-B7F1-98562BB32F3E",
    "Title": "Paste cu ciuperci la cuptor",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Paste_cu_ciuperci_la_cuptor.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 1,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"34b0dca8-748d-42a6-9229-bc19f0392276\",\"Name\":\"ciuperci\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"38b00913-62ae-4751-b4fd-f8beecdb2bab\",\"Name\":\"ceapa rosie\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"4e4bd5ac-3c7b-4f18-803e-3aaa46a9758d\",\"Name\":\"cimbru\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"8f6cd76b-a9fe-4143-ba34-c6ff643b8b66\",\"Name\":\"sare, pier\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"8ea0b101-05b1-450c-9b7d-33822cd5b1e8\",\"Name\":\"ulei de masline\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"784035ab-c6b3-44cf-b6cc-c0b42ce2eaf8\",\"Name\":\"crema de branza\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"a455dd12-c9ae-4217-9b53-a4e50f5d555c\",\"Name\":\"un usturoi intreg taiata coada\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"d48ec48d-50f3-4706-8f75-126a0158b911\",\"Name\":\"_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":8},{\"Id\":\"e232d336-6fdc-4a3d-8734-b7165896257c\",\"Name\":\"paste\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":9},{\"Id\":\"7f9aeaa7-80bc-42b7-8289-94399a3e7ae2\",\"Name\":\"spanac\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":10}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"450a4dea-fd71-4cea-8d49-0c24ce5e506b\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"ciuperci * ceapa rosie * cimbru * sare, pier * ulei de masline * crema de branza * un usturoi intreg taiata coada _ _ _ _ * paste * spanac\"},{\"Id\":\"1d7cb18f-5c2b-46e5-bbde-18d8e35dbed0\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Se dau la cuptor, cand sunt facute se scot, se scoate usturoiul din caciulii si se pune inapoi. Peste se pun pastele fierte si spanac. Se amesteca si se servesc calde.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.211672",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.211672"
  },
  {
    "Id": "144C418B-44BB-4DF6-905F-9AD731916E93",
    "Title": "Limbi de pisica - biscuiti din albusuri",
    "Description": "Un desert delicios care combin\u0103 savoarea unic\u0103 a ingredientelor \u00eentr-o re\u021bet\u0103 rafinat\u0103. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Limbi_de_pisica_-_biscuiti_din_albusuri.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 1,
    "CuisineType": "Desert",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"e1f4e41e-3ee5-4128-9c40-aca72fb0b9f7\",\"Name\":\"de ou\",\"Amount\":3,\"Unit\":\"albusuri\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"0397238d-1ffc-4b1d-a540-e9516f24fa1b\",\"Name\":\"zahar pudra\",\"Amount\":100,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"10c5803c-edac-4497-8636-b2c1864622bf\",\"Name\":\"unt\",\"Amount\":100,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"f012e196-699a-401b-a897-51488e79e9c8\",\"Name\":\"faina\",\"Amount\":100,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"b9e10d24-1977-4a95-9c47-48064038ac4c\",\"Name\":\"vanilie\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":5}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"4baa0307-a893-4182-9462-99fd0f0dc135\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"3 albusuri de ou * 100 g zahar pudra * 100 g unt * 100 g faina * vanilie\"},{\"Id\":\"0c5dc91a-3585-418c-baeb-455a16c0b9d0\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Untul si albusurile trebuie sa fie la temperatura camerei.\"},{\"Id\":\"956c7099-98b9-4456-8468-cae6600aa89a\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Se spumeaza untul cu zaharul si vanilia. Apoi se adauga rand pe rand cate o lingura de faina, se asteapta sa se incorporeze bine si se continua pana ramanem fara faina. Se adauga si albusurile si se da viteza mai mare. Daca trebuie se curata din cand in cand peretii bolului. Ar trebui sa iasa o compozitie vascoasa si aerata.\"},{\"Id\":\"627dd4d9-5c53-44e7-899d-8601e7eb99da\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Se pune intr-un pos si se intinde pe tava, lasand distanta intre ele pentru ca se vor latii in cuptor. Se dau in cuptor la 180 grade pentru 15-20 de minute sau pana se rumenesc.\"},{\"Id\":\"9f8db249-ee40-4f82-a6dc-a5e03963d42c\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"Se scot si se pun pe gratar. Sunt foarte moi cand sunt calde, dar se vor intari imediat ce se racesc.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2119453",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2119453"
  },
  {
    "Id": "15A509B0-BEFB-4983-93DB-9D1B15C0EE3B",
    "Title": "Ciorba de macris",
    "Description": "O sup\u0103 aromat\u0103 \u0219i reconfortant\u0103, perfect\u0103 pentru orice mas\u0103. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Ciorba_de_macris.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 1,
    "CuisineType": "Sup\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"3ba4b52b-ef72-4397-bb37-3846f3fec85c\",\"Name\":\"Ciorba de macris (reteta bunicii)\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"9a8f8aff-494e-4478-95b8-e571adc82751\",\"Name\":\"macris\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"b9b5107e-32c5-437d-bd7e-5a59bceba93b\",\"Name\":\"morcov\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"1d13c6ce-d96f-4589-99b3-7f12fdc8d60e\",\"Name\":\"orez\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"ef0c8f3f-b7cb-434d-9381-aa1fac6fd2b0\",\"Name\":\"galbenus\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"5f46744c-d37e-42a9-ac2e-fc869a677f7b\",\"Name\":\"smantana\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"7e00cd14-f63c-4cbb-ac73-61f82c5d2bb0\",\"Name\":\"marar\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"78c60eb6-f2fb-4662-b8d0-a7935f018390\",\"Name\":\"l\\u0103m\\u00E2ie\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":8},{\"Id\":\"8b8e7aef-5fe0-4f05-a9fa-8b2c84176d39\",\"Name\":\"piper\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":9},{\"Id\":\"535fd2e0-2fb3-4b7f-bc7c-70c320979a05\",\"Name\":\"usturoi\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":10}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"2330acaf-1fe0-445b-8d52-b96ae452742c\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Am \\u0022c\\u0103lit\\u0022 morcovul ras \\u00EEntr-o lingura apa si un strop de ulei. Am ad\\u0103ugat apoi macrisul (spalat, curatat) \\u002B orezul\\u002B usturoiul\\u002Bpiper\\u002B marar\\u002B apa.\"},{\"Id\":\"74442510-b83e-45c3-8c9e-5f2967fe5bc3\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Cand a fiert totul am dres cu smantana amestecat\\u0103 cu galbenusul de ou. Am mai l\\u0103sat sa dea un clocot. La final am acrit cu lamaie.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2120184",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2120184"
  },
  {
    "Id": "16E20488-7F27-4C2E-AE14-4BDBE3F717C5",
    "Title": "Ciocolata de casa (lapte condensat)",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Ciocolata_de_casa_(lapte_condensat",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 1,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"956f5872-57af-4fa2-87d9-b0f77c96a000\",\"Name\":\"lapte condensat\",\"Amount\":395,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"f16aec6d-c0a6-4566-8942-3250dd834547\",\"Name\":\"unt t\\u0103iat buc\\u0103\\u021Bi\",\"Amount\":120,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"1c86c2b3-5b83-4468-b137-110c88fe87b3\",\"Name\":\"zah\\u0103r\",\"Amount\":250,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"ffad0e7f-4827-4771-ae88-7825cb11dd7c\",\"Name\":\"nuc\\u0103 coapt\\u0103 t\\u0103iat\\u0103 grosier\",\"Amount\":40,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"6e07bae9-5ba0-46ad-8f04-2fe6fb7e4a30\",\"Name\":\"sirop de glucoz\\u0103( sirop de zah\\u0103r invertit)\",\"Amount\":20,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"43eaa3cf-11e7-4255-b8e9-63bd50c47d90\",\"Name\":\"linguri\\u021B\\u0103 esen\\u021B\\u0103 de vanilie\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"cb245b68-4901-4b3c-82ed-b16e91e65fb7\",\"Name\":\"ciocolat\\u0103 neagra( min 70 % cacao), rupt\\u0103 buc\\u0103\\u021Bi\",\"Amount\":200,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":7}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"48889355-84fc-4bbc-8d0c-1595c0455d6b\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"Tapeta\\u021Bi o form\\u0103 p\\u0103trat\\u0103 de 20 cm cu h\\u00E2rtie de copt \\u0219i da\\u021Bi-o deoparte.\"},{\"Id\":\"88731eff-3f47-48a1-8ea1-b69e085cebcc\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Pune\\u021Bi laptele condensat, untul, zah\\u0103rul \\u0219i siropul de glucoz\\u0103 \\u00EEn bolul de mixare \\u0219i g\\u0103ti\\u021Bi 30 min/ 100\\u00B0C/ vit.3, a\\u0219ez\\u00E2nd co\\u0219ul de \\u00EEn\\u0103bu\\u0219ire \\u00EEn locul capacului de m\\u0103surare.\"},{\"Id\":\"9522a30b-ce7d-4313-90c0-0debf8380106\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Ad\\u0103uga\\u021Bi esen\\u021Ba de vanilie \\u0219i cioco lata \\u0219i mixa\\u021Bi 20 sec/ vit 4 sau p\\u00E2n\\u0103 c\\u00E2nd ciocolata se tope\\u0219te complet. Lucr\\u00E2nd rapid, transfera\\u021Bi amestecul \\u00EEn tava preg\\u0103tit\\u0103 anterior \\u0219i nivela\\u021Bi suprafa\\u021Ba. Ad\\u0103uga\\u021Bi nuca t\\u0103iat\\u0103.\"},{\"Id\":\"a3160426-a5c8-4267-8795-e1870a528617\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"L\\u0103sa\\u021Bi s\\u0103 se r\\u0103ceasc\\u0103 la temperatura camerei( aproximativ 30 minute). Odat\\u0103 r\\u0103cit\\u0103 transfera\\u021Bi la figider pentru cel pu\\u021Bin 2 ore.\"},{\"Id\":\"ff5ad3fd-8bde-4d34-933d-fdd8edea38c9\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"Odat\\u0103 r\\u0103cit\\u0103 scoate\\u021Bi ciocolata din tav\\u0103 \\u0219i t\\u0103ia\\u021Bi in buc\\u0103ti( aprox. 2/3 cm). Tranfera\\u021Bi \\u00EEn borcane \\u00EEnchise ermetic \\u0219i p\\u0103stra\\u021Bi ciocolata la frigider p\\u00E2na la 2 s\\u0103pt\\u0103mani.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2123411",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2123411"
  },
  {
    "Id": "17FC69DF-7C0A-43DD-AA91-FC8B177D3F1C",
    "Title": "Salata cu cartofi",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Salata_cu_cartofi.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 1,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"226feb87-5660-43a6-b81c-ccba8d14feb1\",\"Name\":\"3-4 cartofi\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"6661f94a-ce3d-4fc1-983b-9702dca65f27\",\"Name\":\"iaurt\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"1dd66fec-5635-432b-97ee-c0d5baa0f7b7\",\"Name\":\"maioneza\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"d47cef50-486d-45d5-9002-bc9195e00756\",\"Name\":\"suc de la jumatate de lamaie\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"fa1eb6fb-26b5-453f-9873-081dfd8faa3a\",\"Name\":\"marar, patrunjel, chives\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"552cb642-63d6-4c5d-852d-a0cd10b641c6\",\"Name\":\"ceapa rosie\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"39615174-f6d9-40ba-b44c-c114c901e14d\",\"Name\":\"castravete\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"15922fa6-db95-48f7-a496-37c28857caff\",\"Name\":\"usturoi\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":8},{\"Id\":\"e1d7c5fc-426e-4112-a87a-2b8fe2145f6f\",\"Name\":\"sare, piper\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":9}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"bb39e2c7-f5d8-4cad-bec4-529df0221151\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"3-4 cartofi * iaurt * maioneza * suc de la jumatate de lamaie * marar, patrunjel, chives * ceapa rosie * castravete * usturoi * sare, piper\"},{\"Id\":\"5922e6e9-8c75-490f-9731-d60c06656549\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Cartofii se fierb, dupa care se taseaza si se pun intr-o tava, se presara ulei, sare si piper si se dau la cuptor pana se rumesc bine si devin crocanti.\"},{\"Id\":\"00291c2d-b255-4feb-aa32-192fc2fa3b18\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Legumele se taie si se pun in maioneza. Se adauga si cartofii taiati si se serveste.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.212473",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.212473"
  },
  {
    "Id": "1A03BB3F-A720-495C-B7B6-AFCAFF2471F1",
    "Title": "Prajitura cu budinca si biscuiti",
    "Description": "Un desert delicios care combin\u0103 savoarea unic\u0103 a ingredientelor \u00eentr-o re\u021bet\u0103 rafinat\u0103. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Prajitura_cu_budinca_si_biscuiti.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "Desert",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"28c25671-bcb0-4871-9ee4-95d975d757a4\",\"Name\":\"Blat 1:\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"e3d0303e-6b41-4856-aee6-8fc6ea7859f6\",\"Name\":\"albusuri\",\"Amount\":5,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"19169ad6-5353-4e93-b5e0-5590d8c2cdcc\",\"Name\":\"zahar\",\"Amount\":6,\"Unit\":\"tbsp\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"f61a34a6-3596-4beb-91bb-e106fe1ee1ae\",\"Name\":\"faina\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"tbsp\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"c924cef0-373c-4e38-bb0d-7bdcd6200ca0\",\"Name\":\"nuca cocos\",\"Amount\":75,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"68777c73-ae47-4a5a-9501-a929f8f7c0e7\",\"Name\":\"1/2 plic praf copt\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"d96d12e1-c5dd-43ce-978e-3f4104e452e9\",\"Name\":\"sare\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"7bc7ba15-ac91-4bc5-8ff3-5dd03091b374\",\"Name\":\"Blat 2\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":8},{\"Id\":\"759169fd-2702-4954-a8a1-1ae3f4f1767e\",\"Name\":\"albusuri\",\"Amount\":5,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":9},{\"Id\":\"74095ec9-b265-4dc5-92bc-122484882bf9\",\"Name\":\"zahar\",\"Amount\":6,\"Unit\":\"tbsp\",\"Order\":10},{\"Id\":\"2bf4b386-6c5f-4ca1-a4da-b67855c07687\",\"Name\":\"faina\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"tbsp\",\"Order\":11},{\"Id\":\"c4bb95f2-1180-4d07-8bcb-ed4addf87fa9\",\"Name\":\"nuca macinata\",\"Amount\":75,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":12},{\"Id\":\"121f892d-53a1-463c-a73d-07c2c017b148\",\"Name\":\"esenta portocale\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"lgt\",\"Order\":13},{\"Id\":\"17daf0ee-dd23-47d8-8a69-1a486aa84a79\",\"Name\":\"1/2 plic praf copt\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":14},{\"Id\":\"b726fd71-5ace-4374-a48e-1a825bdbeaf9\",\"Name\":\"Sirop 1:\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":15},{\"Id\":\"01b90540-e20d-441a-87d2-20e077a9ab93\",\"Name\":\"apa\",\"Amount\":250,\"Unit\":\"ml\",\"Order\":16},{\"Id\":\"5de07fe4-3a4a-4970-be56-428a062c1dbd\",\"Name\":\"zahar\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"tbsp\",\"Order\":17},{\"Id\":\"11fa177d-a88e-4a4c-82e3-7a61f492b597\",\"Name\":\"esenta vanilie\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":18},{\"Id\":\"25cc3a8a-713f-4964-bd82-411061916938\",\"Name\":\"coaja rasa de lamaie\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":19},{\"Id\":\"377a2214-3303-4e11-833a-eb8f341f9ad1\",\"Name\":\"Sirop 2:\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":20}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"25e5f8c1-30e8-4a19-ab4d-149cb11f4147\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"Blat 1: * 5 albusuri * 6 linguri zahar * 2 lg faina * 75gr nuca cocos * 1/2 plic praf copt * sare Blat 2 * 5 albusuri * 6 lg zahar * 2 lg faina * 75 gr nuca macinata * 1lgt esenta portocale * 1/2 plic praf copt Sirop 1: * 250ml apa * 1 lg zahar * esenta vanilie * coaja rasa de lamaie Sirop 2: * 250 ml apa * 1 lg zahar * esenta portocale * coaja de portocala Blat 3 * 21 biscuiti simpli * 300gr ciocolata amaruie * 2 lg lapte * 2 lg ulei Crema: * 10 galbenusuri * 10 lg zahar * 5 lg lapte * 200gr...\"},{\"Id\":\"2df49d95-24f1-44f1-8c49-d7fff8281f15\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Pentru blaturi(separat pentru fiecare), batem albusurile spuma cu un varf de sare, apoi adaugam treptat zaharul, esenta si coaja rasa, faina amestecata cu praful de copt si la final nuca, respectiv nuca de cocos.\"},{\"Id\":\"8d953618-dc9f-44d7-98e6-3fe4361715fe\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Tapetam tava cu hartie de copt( eu am folosit o tava de 22/36 cm), intindem compozitia de blat in ea, o nivelam frumos cu dosul unei linguri si dam tava la cuptorul preincalzit, pentru 25-30 de minute la 180 de grade.\"},{\"Id\":\"512982b8-83ab-4cd7-94d2-65dcc93f23e6\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Nu vom uita nici de testul cu scobitoarea pentru siguranta.\"},{\"Id\":\"19e637b7-7a31-41ef-9135-74c9632267fc\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"La mine blatul cu nuca de cocos s-a copt dupa 25 de minute, iar cel cu nuca dupa 30 de minute.\"},{\"Id\":\"84b850ea-992d-4e46-9c57-c4d43368953c\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"Pentru crema, frecam intr-un vas galbenusurile cu zaharul si putina sare pana devin spumoase, apoi le diluam cu lapte fierbinte si punem vasul la foc pe baie de aburi.\"},{\"Id\":\"4c748dce-dd04-438a-a8fb-f7d3144ddbab\",\"StepNumber\":7,\"Text\":\"Fierbem astfel crema, mestecand continuu pana cand se va ingrosa ca o smantana.\"},{\"Id\":\"69e8b023-5285-4ff8-af5f-ae3e15932232\",\"StepNumber\":8,\"Text\":\"Lasam crema astfel formata sa se raceasca.\"},{\"Id\":\"666cb315-19d2-4cb8-a50a-6d697a790add\",\"StepNumber\":9,\"Text\":\"Separat, in alt vas, mixam untul tinut la temperatura camerei, pana devine spumos, apoi incepem sa incorporam treptat crema racita, punand cate putina crema in unt si picurand esenta in acelasi timp. La final adaugam si mascarponele si omogenizam.\"},{\"Id\":\"85caca0f-587e-4d23-845b-6889f257f256\",\"StepNumber\":10,\"Text\":\"Dam crema la rece pentru 15-20 de minute.\"},{\"Id\":\"68b50bd3-b411-4e10-bc26-2025b02e4913\",\"StepNumber\":11,\"Text\":\"Pentru sirop, fierbem toate ingredientele(separat pentru fiecare tip de sirop) si vom insiropa blaturile, mai ales pe margini.\"},{\"Id\":\"040092da-5865-406b-b6c4-831d4840fe95\",\"StepNumber\":12,\"Text\":\"Nu trebuie sa fie decat usor insiropate pentru a se putea portiona mai bine.\"},{\"Id\":\"dd71d566-ca0d-4e9f-a183-90b41af375ab\",\"StepNumber\":13,\"Text\":\"Nu vom folosi toata cantitatea de sirop la blaturi ci vom insiropa si biscuitii cu aceste siropuri.\"},{\"Id\":\"7faa6706-c7de-4b0f-95a4-d7855cb654fa\",\"StepNumber\":14,\"Text\":\"Ciocolata o vom marunti si o vom pune intr-un vas impreuna cu laptele si uleiul si o vom topi pe baie de aburi, mestecand continuu.\"},{\"Id\":\"44d4fde1-877e-4ce5-92e2-f33daed6050c\",\"StepNumber\":15,\"Text\":\"Cum asamblam: asezam in tava blatul cu nuca de cocos, intindem peste el 1/2 din crema, asezam biscuitii insiropati, alternand unul cu sirop de lamaie, unul cu sirop de portocale, turnam peste ei ciocolata topita, calda, apoi asezam celalalt blat, intindem restul de crema si radem ciocolata deasupra.\"},{\"Id\":\"1e9c3aa7-97b5-40b4-a83b-7e16351af58d\",\"StepNumber\":16,\"Text\":\"Dam prajitura astfel asamblata la rece cateva ore, apoi o vom portiona.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2128394",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2128394"
  },
  {
    "Id": "1AA5D2BD-8BFB-4D51-8417-DE18AC2F39BD",
    "Title": "Tarta cu mere si pere in aluat de nuci",
    "Description": "Un desert delicios care combin\u0103 savoarea unic\u0103 a ingredientelor \u00eentr-o re\u021bet\u0103 rafinat\u0103. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Tarta_cu_mere_si_pere_in_aluat_de_nuci.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "Desert",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"388e9490-41ba-418e-9034-2800898444ac\",\"Name\":\"Aluat:\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"440ff84a-308e-4c03-b335-9f886f7b9d01\",\"Name\":\"faina\",\"Amount\":200,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"60719b63-771d-46e5-a5d7-61e0f7a8a16c\",\"Name\":\"nuci coapte si macinate\",\"Amount\":60,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"872f27a1-93d2-48e4-b329-3e46dbaa4c25\",\"Name\":\"zahar\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"tbsp\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"87398129-583a-483e-be3f-711a1061b606\",\"Name\":\"sare\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"tsp\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"4edec0cf-2f7d-48ec-ad3c-f731449012e5\",\"Name\":\"unt rece, taiat cubulete\",\"Amount\":225,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"0ef21255-cad7-4774-9e77-807e6a9a92bb\",\"Name\":\"4-6 linguri apa rece\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"f69bdff8-26bc-4241-8342-5f37cc230f00\",\"Name\":\"Umplutura:\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":8},{\"Id\":\"f56361c0-8bde-4f3e-a457-1964b9ecb782\",\"Name\":\"-6 mere\",\"Amount\":5,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":9},{\"Id\":\"a88ee5cc-8f02-4fce-91d6-c3a233db847d\",\"Name\":\"coapte, dar ferme\",\"Amount\":3,\"Unit\":\"pere\",\"Order\":10},{\"Id\":\"81d203ca-b1c7-449e-90e9-00c28ea3a457\",\"Name\":\"\\u00BC lingurita sare\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":11},{\"Id\":\"f0f8f6f7-3392-4e79-9229-4b9da7d43cb5\",\"Name\":\"zahar\",\"Amount\":120,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":12},{\"Id\":\"8096ed8a-de41-458b-8f6d-1e0ac9c928fb\",\"Name\":\"de vanilie\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"pastaie\",\"Order\":13},{\"Id\":\"60f28214-19b1-4f6f-b312-00bbfed0a6f7\",\"Name\":\"sucul de la \\u00BD lamaie\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":14},{\"Id\":\"7c91749c-5086-4734-962e-c17c5a4c54e7\",\"Name\":\"unt\",\"Amount\":50,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":15},{\"Id\":\"59384744-6b0b-4ebf-8f3e-2aa761c206fd\",\"Name\":\"faina\",\"Amount\":3,\"Unit\":\"tbsp\",\"Order\":16},{\"Id\":\"fa776275-a061-47a1-970b-c27da010107e\",\"Name\":\"batut\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"ou\",\"Order\":17},{\"Id\":\"e45cfaa5-1659-46d3-9797-afe79d883fa5\",\"Name\":\"zahar fin\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"tbsp\",\"Order\":18}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"514fcec7-89e0-487b-addf-e6e0c56076bb\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"Aluat: * 200g faina * 60g nuci coapte si macinate * 1 lingura zahar * 1 lingurita sare * 225g unt rece, taiat cubulete * 4-6 linguri apa rece Umplutura: * 5 -6 mere * 3 pere coapte, dar ferme * \\u00BC lingurita sare * 120g zahar * 1 pastaie de vanilie * sucul de la \\u00BD lamaie * 50g unt * 3 linguri faina * 1 ou batut * 1 lingura zahar fin\"},{\"Id\":\"8587cb38-ccc9-4cc2-8168-6c4cc6f8763f\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Amesteca faina, nucile macinate, zaharul si sarea. Adauga cubuletele de unt si amesteca cu mana, pana cand amestecul devine granulos. Pune cateva linguri de apa rece (nu pe toata) pana cand aluatul incepe sa se lege. Framanta-l de cateva ori cu palmele si imparte-l in doua parti egale. Inveleste-le in folie de plastic si aplatizeaza-le intr-un disc. Pune-le la frigider timp de cel putin 45 de minute. Inainte sa le folosesti scoate-le la temperatura camerei 5-10 minute.\"},{\"Id\":\"217858b6-f5e9-469c-84c6-b526f12aaf48\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Sau la tmx framantare 1 min\"},{\"Id\":\"eb6a2c9d-96df-4d90-bba4-c11d0b907add\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Merele si perele se curata si se taie cubulete. Se amesteca cu zahar, vanilie si sucul de lamaie. Se calesc pe foc 10 min, dupa care se adauga 3 lg de faina si se mai lasa 5 minute sa se gateasca. Se lasa la racit.\"},{\"Id\":\"160911a1-8d0d-45fc-85c1-1b56f4fcc97e\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"Se fac doua foi, una mai mare si una mai mica. Cea mare se pune in forma, apoi se adauga compozitia racita. Din cea mica se fac fasii ce se impletesc de-asupra compozitiei.\"},{\"Id\":\"2f08bee6-5178-4a61-88e5-a85f071ec2a9\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"Se da la cuptor, 15 min la 220, dupa care se reduce temperatura la 190 si se lasa aproximativ o ora.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2131272",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2131272"
  },
  {
    "Id": "1B50947D-412E-41A9-B578-D06607D6AAF7",
    "Title": "Empanadas",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Empanadas.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 1,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"7a74d811-8147-4601-b27d-42fd7b50ba31\",\"Name\":\"82% grasime\",\"Amount\":110,\"Unit\":\"unt\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"8b330737-5644-420c-8a2a-fadcbbee4f9a\",\"Name\":\"faina\",\"Amount\":150,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"3f61a5a4-b105-4925-8f63-4d2b5d348746\",\"Name\":\"smantana\",\"Amount\":90,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":3}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"5cadaabc-cfe0-4132-9d8b-b06572106df3\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"110 unt 82% grasime * 150 faina * 90 smantana\"},{\"Id\":\"37468dc1-dd4c-4003-91f3-bcb4137e9b5d\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Se amesteca untul rece cu faina, dupa care se adauga si smantana. Se formeaza o bila care se acopera cu folie si se da la frigider pentru 2 ore.\"},{\"Id\":\"7786d0be-16ac-4a65-a1ee-63c5279f884e\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Se intinde aluatul pe o suprafata tapetata cu faina cam la 3-4 mm grosime. Se decupeaza si se umple cu ce doriti.\"},{\"Id\":\"d5d53010-a0b4-4e6c-bba0-2fe892bd9a12\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Se impacheteaza, marginile se preseaza cu o furculita. Se ung pe deasupra cu galbenus batut si se presara seminte (chimen, susuan, mac)\"},{\"Id\":\"224e53c4-9fe9-45d2-971f-1b4616cca944\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"Se dau la cuptor la 200grade pentru 20-30 de minute.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2134565",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2134565"
  },
  {
    "Id": "1CBAE97F-0998-439B-8367-60B28E3AEFD6",
    "Title": "Orez mexican",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Orez_mexican.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 1,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"6d08d5cf-0734-4755-ba75-4d62b82eb5d2\",\"Name\":\"orez spalat\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"cana\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"e38321e8-b9d5-4512-8c0e-8fecd870ce68\",\"Name\":\"rosie\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"ceapa\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"4ecf293d-4907-4988-bc5b-2cfdcd721782\",\"Name\":\"morcov\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"76eb996a-1f0e-440a-b358-c1cef2330543\",\"Name\":\"kapia\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"ardei\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"057335ab-ac2f-4676-8b96-64a4241c7a21\",\"Name\":\"usturoi\",\"Amount\":3.4,\"Unit\":\"catei\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"b0fb6911-148f-42f4-9303-92811ec8b662\",\"Name\":\"apa\",\"Amount\":4,\"Unit\":\"cesti\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"2c4c718d-2548-42a2-b52c-ea10f82c7a55\",\"Name\":\"legume congelate\",\"Amount\":450,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"53ae11da-da51-4ebf-b90e-4041ac6bc42f\",\"Name\":\"curry, 1lgt boia dulce, sare, piper, turmeric, garam-masala, sumac, tandori masala\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"lgt\",\"Order\":8}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"4839c660-e281-4ac7-adcc-4f95fed63dab\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"1 cana orez spalat * 1 ceapa rosie * 1 morcov * 1 ardei kapia * 3.4 catei usturoi * 4 cesti apa * 450gr legume congelate * 1lgt curry, 1lgt boia dulce, sare, piper, turmeric, garam-masala, sumac, tandori masala\"},{\"Id\":\"5fae44bf-85ce-4e39-bd82-73e17d9d3546\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Se caleste usturoiul, ceapa, ardeiul si morcovul impreuna cu orezul. Se adauga condimentele. Apoi legumele congelate.\"},{\"Id\":\"b913251b-fe59-49a9-ba00-25f7c2f8f010\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Se adauga apa rand pe rand in functie de cat e nevoie (legumele congelate lasa si ele apa)\"},{\"Id\":\"cfb9fd74-80d7-4682-ad4e-35baa92dbbff\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Lasam sa scada pana se absoarbe tot lichidul.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2138012",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2138012"
  },
  {
    "Id": "22F9DD80-34D8-4657-B448-25EE874D4A4A",
    "Title": "Budinca de tapioca de toamna",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Budinca_de_tapioca_de_toamna.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 1,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"62ac32dc-c362-44a8-8702-bcd3e8adfb6a\",\"Name\":\"tapioca\",\"Amount\":50,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"371ea3a5-eeb6-411a-aa6b-5db9c642ee67\",\"Name\":\"lapte\",\"Amount\":200,\"Unit\":\"ml\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"36fded6f-3435-4e81-8aa4-88d824ada935\",\"Name\":\"mici\",\"Amount\":3,\"Unit\":\"prune\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"4292b216-77d4-4ec1-8413-3b92970531d1\",\"Name\":\"dulce\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"mar\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"808e5f7a-942d-4626-9b74-920eead017c5\",\"Name\":\"gutui\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"felii\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"3561b1fd-c4d7-49da-902b-4a133f8d8096\",\"Name\":\"cartof dulce/dovleac placintar\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"felii\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"bca05bcc-b381-4f0d-ac94-69a6158a07a4\",\"Name\":\"vanilie\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"ff3f31b2-898a-4a01-813d-0e32137728e9\",\"Name\":\"scortisoara\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":8},{\"Id\":\"c6ad1684-623b-4653-9ca0-89b25f34c0a9\",\"Name\":\"nuca\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":9},{\"Id\":\"5571e0c4-9158-42b7-98f1-fab0c51b88f9\",\"Name\":\"unt pentru uns\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":10}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"49478c1c-5f93-4e6d-9569-d950a5685b53\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"50gr tapioca * 200ml lapte * 3 prune mici * 1 mar dulce * 2 felii gutui * 2 felii cartof dulce/dovleac placintar * vanilie * scortisoara * nuca * unt pentru uns\"},{\"Id\":\"0ce87876-d857-45b0-8d27-659368ed708e\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Se fierbe tapioca in lapte cu vanilia\"},{\"Id\":\"a6739f20-699d-4350-aff7-8baefd292027\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Fructele se taie marunte.\"},{\"Id\":\"f0c62abc-77e6-4def-94ac-ac1625a3646a\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Se amesteca toate si se pun intr0un vas tapetat cu unt.\"},{\"Id\":\"22618e1b-4e4f-4847-8685-4587efefb526\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"Se da la cuptor pentru 30 de minute la 180 de grade.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2139166",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2139166"
  },
  {
    "Id": "231209E4-3E5B-4782-8E12-513B42A8129B",
    "Title": "Pate de fasole cu nuci si ceapa",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Pate_de_fasole_cu_nuci_si_ceapa.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"7d2a1179-b5f3-4619-93b2-bdb9645d6d4e\",\"Name\":\"1/2 ceapa rosie\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"0a372242-35ef-4e57-9e80-2d85c6516572\",\"Name\":\"morcov\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"b92a21c6-60e0-4bbb-9f79-67d7a4c367e1\",\"Name\":\"o rosie\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"48680f9e-0c92-42ad-84b1-74ca8888740d\",\"Name\":\"2-3 catei de usturoi\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"139bedba-7c69-44d8-864a-8b5d79699b9d\",\"Name\":\"sare, piper\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"f9224871-752d-4777-a2e0-95975eeeba2e\",\"Name\":\"fasole alba\",\"Amount\":340,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"e9f98911-70d6-41b8-a8f5-f331a9a31d59\",\"Name\":\"rosii\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"cepe\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"3955383e-e97f-4bfa-b7ad-fe81b26a2eae\",\"Name\":\"ulei\",\"Amount\":30,\"Unit\":\"ml\",\"Order\":8},{\"Id\":\"ca1a5000-f226-4d78-a951-c6f28270d2fa\",\"Name\":\"crema de otet balsamic\",\"Amount\":30,\"Unit\":\"ml\",\"Order\":9}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"ec297de7-89d0-4a75-83a6-d241eeecce83\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"1/2 ceapa rosie * 1 morcov * o rosie * 2-3 catei de usturoi * sare, piper * 340g fasole alba * 2 cepe rosii * 30ml ulei * 30ml crema de otet balsamic\"},{\"Id\":\"d365281c-5851-4fa7-a409-c8951bcafd71\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"1. Scurgem bine fasolea din conserva si o trecem de mai multe ori pe sub jet de apa rece.\"},{\"Id\":\"26f38cb1-76ff-4d0c-91a8-afcd5e16aa27\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"2. Intr-o tigaie incapatoare incingem putin ulei, adaugam ceapa tocata marunt si morcovul dat pe razatoare.\"},{\"Id\":\"63280dfc-7eba-43b0-aa09-09fee4dc7e79\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"3. Le calim pana ceapa devine translucida.\"},{\"Id\":\"994f3d8c-d3aa-4a91-a1fc-810d5e1cd326\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"4. Adaugam usturoiul trecut prin presa si rosia taiata cubulete. Putem folosi si rosii cherry, pe care le taiem in jum\\u0103t\\u0103\\u021Bi. In functie de cat de zemoasa este rosia, putem adauga si 50-70ml apa.\"},{\"Id\":\"a5953afa-c57e-44ae-804e-db9ca4db4967\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"5. Calim legumele pana rosia devine moale \\u0219i lasa suc. Lasam sa fiarba 2-3 minute.\"},{\"Id\":\"46eff842-1a7c-4279-a44c-d779e4eb9ea6\",\"StepNumber\":7,\"Text\":\"6. Adaugam fasolea alba, amestecam, condimentem dupa gust cu sare si piper si lasam pe foc alte 1-2 minute. Dam totul prin blender, apoi mutam intr-un bol.\"},{\"Id\":\"47adf27e-a681-4508-9c88-132a531542b9\",\"StepNumber\":8,\"Text\":\"7. Prajim nuca taiata grosier in tigaia incinsa, fara adaod de ulei, amestecand des pentru a nu se arde. Adaugam nuca rumenita peste pateul de fasole si amestecam.\"},{\"Id\":\"d8934709-8d29-4640-b2cd-9607a4c2a46e\",\"StepNumber\":9,\"Text\":\"8. Intr-o tigaie incingem 30ml ulei si calim ceapa taiata felii (pe\\u0219ti\\u0219ori), la foc domol, pana ceapa e moale.\"},{\"Id\":\"9a5f1576-e8e4-4f33-952b-10c06cb8b196\",\"StepNumber\":10,\"Text\":\"9. Ad\\u0103ug\\u0103m reductia de otet balsamic, amestecam foarte bine \\u0219i lasam la foc mic 3-4 minute, amestecand in continuu.\"},{\"Id\":\"ff1d1db1-44ff-4963-a874-3ac0946329f2\",\"StepNumber\":11,\"Text\":\"10. Daca folosim otet balsamic si nu crema, adaugam si o lingur\\u0103 cu varf de zahar si tinem pe foc pana zaharul e topit si avem un sos cremos.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2140208",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2140208"
  },
  {
    "Id": "231E8EC5-0F18-487A-9979-6453330C4C8A",
    "Title": "Ciuperci cremoase",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Ciuperci_cremoase.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 1,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"026b779b-1ad4-49f1-8fea-c0d1a8e0527f\",\"Name\":\"Jumatate de dovlecel\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"06cbbd16-8bbe-4626-b53c-2263846a3894\",\"Name\":\"Ciuperci\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"d4feca00-2c74-4262-a753-ca70964584b3\",\"Name\":\"Usturoi\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"62313e52-34ab-47a9-bde0-36d9f8a2adce\",\"Name\":\"Patrunjel\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"f89e4526-a2bf-46dc-8132-a219ebf1136d\",\"Name\":\"Sare\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"bbd3660f-bed7-4f4e-bd10-615d3ec1b40f\",\"Name\":\"Smantana de gatit\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":6}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"24a2a996-f0e0-4e6c-a6fd-3cbd615de987\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"Jumatate de dovlecel * Ciuperci * Usturoi * Patrunjel * Sare * Smantana de gatit\"},{\"Id\":\"b955cd9d-5747-4fb7-a542-aed7ada5f13a\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Se feliaza dovleceii si ciupercile. Se pun dovleceii in tigaia incinsa si se calesc pana se inmoaie. Se scot si se pun ciupercile. Se lasa pana scot apa dupa care se sareaza.\"},{\"Id\":\"3a2f5662-a5e6-4bd3-b604-725af7b2cd5b\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Se adauga si dovleceii, ustuoiul pisat si smantana de gatit. La final se presara patrunjel.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2141187",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2141187"
  },
  {
    "Id": "2440432B-D717-4490-9988-152337674D7D",
    "Title": "Inghetata de capsuni",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Inghetata_de_capsuni.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 0,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"c0beda54-61e6-456d-a979-37e683ac2874\",\"Name\":\"banane congelate\",\"Amount\":80,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"d8daaacf-c430-470c-88ef-aefff6c41938\",\"Name\":\"capsuni congelate\",\"Amount\":80,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"f1d137d2-ed35-422b-b0f2-6ecc665c2366\",\"Name\":\"mascarpone\",\"Amount\":50,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"f4e2ad37-e95f-4533-8a36-9104ee617d0a\",\"Name\":\"sirop de artar\",\"Amount\":10,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"ccbbc34d-38f2-4415-9b1f-1681d3c665ca\",\"Name\":\"Se pun toate in blender si se amesteca pana cand se omogenizeaza\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":5}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"c1a66729-1d6a-4c89-a930-5ef0c1c2b1a7\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"80 g banane congelate * 80 g capsuni congelate * 50 g mascarpone * 10 g sirop de artar Se pun toate in blender si se amesteca pana cand se omogenizeaza\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2144463",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2144463"
  },
  {
    "Id": "260B7386-8AF3-4FAF-A215-D88A9A88C4C2",
    "Title": "Rulada de bezea",
    "Description": "Un desert delicios care combin\u0103 savoarea unic\u0103 a ingredientelor \u00eentr-o re\u021bet\u0103 rafinat\u0103. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Rulada_de_bezea.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "Desert",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"a0555980-758e-4c67-bc09-c6badd41cc07\",\"Name\":\"mascarpone\",\"Amount\":250,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"52543e27-0b2c-4781-bb76-ba101d9f6d34\",\"Name\":\"smantana pentru frisca\",\"Amount\":200,\"Unit\":\"ml\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"e9eb970a-0a46-404f-a077-35271d2a5dac\",\"Name\":\"albusuri\",\"Amount\":6,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"7e277d7d-2914-42b3-a27b-722f8029dee9\",\"Name\":\"zahar tos\",\"Amount\":200,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"4ba6d629-ebb2-4871-acbe-8830becc3d3d\",\"Name\":\"zahar pudra\",\"Amount\":50,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"6134f680-c77c-4eff-a405-ecd86fcceae7\",\"Name\":\"capsuni\",\"Amount\":200,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"1a23a3f0-2862-4c17-9fa9-d7c416baea48\",\"Name\":\"migdale maruntite\",\"Amount\":50,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"9c2dae36-80ed-44f7-8f5a-294c65d14bbe\",\"Name\":\"esenta vanilie\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"tsp\",\"Order\":8},{\"Id\":\"94d5302b-849d-425f-9f0f-cd3c2d707b38\",\"Name\":\"putina sare\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":9}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"0da47979-8af4-4d0b-ae10-e922889e6971\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"250 g mascarpone * 200 ml smantana pentru frisca * 6 albusuri * 200 g zahar tos * 50 g zahar pudra * 200 g capsuni * 50 g migdale maruntite * 1 lingurita esenta vanilie * putina sare\"},{\"Id\":\"72a7f580-57a0-462b-ad25-e69d3c3c0243\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Se bat albusurile spuna, dupa care se adauga zaharul si se bate pana obtinem o bezea tare.\"},{\"Id\":\"dc9e9898-e134-4b2e-be03-6f910860701c\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Asezam bezeaua in tava pe o foaie de copt si se niveleaza cu atentie. Se pun deasupra migdale maruntite sau fulgi de migdale.\"},{\"Id\":\"801a9b23-c8ac-417e-b380-6f18b58ebede\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Se da la cuptor la 140 grade pentru 30 de minute.\"},{\"Id\":\"a90bdcda-7e91-4159-a452-3449e1a5d781\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"Dupa ce se scoate se lasa 5 minute si apoi se scoate din tava cat este inca calda. Se pune pe deasupra o foaie de copt si se intoarce. Se lasa sa se raceaasca complet\"},{\"Id\":\"6b0ff246-4290-4752-869d-dfd81d3f0345\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"Pentru crema se mixeaza mascarpone cu frisca si zaharul. Se bat pana se obtine o crema consistenta. Crema se intinde pe foaia de bezea. Se adauga si capsunii taiati felii si se ruleaza bezeaua.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2145518",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2145518"
  },
  {
    "Id": "261CCF50-76C0-4950-B00C-97C3113C7549",
    "Title": "Tarta de mere si pere",
    "Description": "Un desert delicios care combin\u0103 savoarea unic\u0103 a ingredientelor \u00eentr-o re\u021bet\u0103 rafinat\u0103. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Tarta_de_mere_si_pere.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 1,
    "CuisineType": "Desert",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"e13639fc-b663-4bea-83fa-5b448ad96b32\",\"Name\":\"oua\",\"Amount\":3,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"8e8f0d7e-bcdc-49f3-b70e-222ead8586a6\",\"Name\":\"unt\",\"Amount\":60,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"be5432c3-0bc3-4c09-83a5-7f2a4d709585\",\"Name\":\"faina pt prajituri\",\"Amount\":100,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"db50023e-40ec-4be7-a180-0f41d925117c\",\"Name\":\"O ligurita de zahar vanilat sau esenta de vanilie\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"829f28a7-7146-49ce-bbec-e9272dd11a83\",\"Name\":\"zahar\",\"Amount\":150,\"Unit\":\"de\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"57f27432-cf8b-4594-a0a3-544596423c00\",\"Name\":\"mere\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"3f8dc496-aa7a-4d91-b2ea-513df33d2dad\",\"Name\":\"pere\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"4d7d40e8-1898-40b8-953e-ea8b9e7113d9\",\"Name\":\"Zahar pudra\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":8},{\"Id\":\"96cef302-41a6-4080-ad73-ffc6f002a2dc\",\"Name\":\"Un praf de sare\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":9}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"e1b3b61e-8927-4111-891c-86892f24c443\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"3 oua 60g unt 100g faina pt prajituri O ligurita de zahar vanilat sau esenta de vanilie 150 de zahar 2 mere 2 pere Zahar pudra Un praf de sare\"},{\"Id\":\"0a0d0c6e-8dcd-4b84-9201-2346d595eacb\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Se incalzeste cuptorul 180\\u00B0\"},{\"Id\":\"6eda1924-7de9-4658-b13a-60fa0c47f82e\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Se pune oualele,zaharul si zaharul vanilat 3min 50\\u00B0vit 3 si 3 min vit3\"},{\"Id\":\"6e8392cb-86d7-4051-8a05-b10d52a10a9b\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Se adauga untul ,faina si sarea10 sec vit3 se scoate fluturasul si se amesteca cu spatula\"},{\"Id\":\"d39ce99c-8625-4f1e-a0b3-0939f10c9fb4\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"Se unge o tava 20\\u00D730 cu unt se pune un rand de feli subtiri de mar fara coaja si seminte si se adauga jumate din compozitie,peste se pune un rand de feli de para fara coaja peste se adauga comp ramasa se baga la cuptor 30 _35 de min 180\\u00B0 dupa ce se raceste se orneaza cu zahar pudra\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2146505",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2146505"
  },
  {
