    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"a8873a08-18fd-419d-94a2-f99c8d75f6f3\",\"Name\":\"un file de salau\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"2263aae6-1ae6-4503-bd71-c742dafb9616\",\"Name\":\"unt\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"1f87da64-6a4a-4cfb-956e-cd044ddfe495\",\"Name\":\"de gatit\",\"Amount\":200,\"Unit\":\"smantana\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"58e99cbf-72b9-44a3-b4a6-5ab81df42337\",\"Name\":\"o lamaie\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":4}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"8106c1db-1fa9-47cc-99ec-23ae77be1b52\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"un file de salau * unt * 200 smantana de gatit * o lamaie\"},{\"Id\":\"0b6abefb-d490-48d6-b0ce-b233a8800a6a\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Condimentam fileul cu sare si piper.\"},{\"Id\":\"02fc054c-595a-49ac-93fe-b1c3b025a232\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Punem untul in tigaie. Dupa ce s-a topit gatim fileul de salau 4-5 minute pe fiecare parte.\"},{\"Id\":\"d4a6c131-4666-405b-8796-ebe0782f95ae\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Il scoatem si il punem in farfurie.\"},{\"Id\":\"de23f906-0fbf-4084-8d94-ae3ff0955e1e\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"Punem smantana in tigaie si o gatim 2-3 minute. La final adaugam zeama de lamaie. Turnam sosul peste peste.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2147525",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2147525"
  },
  {
    "Id": "2BAFF3CC-3844-42A1-BE30-EF1094BE840B",
    "Title": "Tiramisu de portocale",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Tiramisu_de_portocale.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 1,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"75a5fd7c-592b-43f4-81a3-fb6a3e45f79f\",\"Name\":\"portocale curatate\",\"Amount\":250,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"9320fbec-4b32-48ad-8d64-6e27acd0aeed\",\"Name\":\"frisca naturala (smantana dulce pt frisca cu min 30% grasime)\",\"Amount\":200,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"8bd51869-2094-4e93-b79c-d6fbf3fe4deb\",\"Name\":\"mascarpone\",\"Amount\":200,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"756e0d42-33ba-4bc3-a6d6-f38bfdbbaae6\",\"Name\":\"zahar\",\"Amount\":100,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"2e4fdbc4-4789-46d5-9570-5ec900ebbd05\",\"Name\":\"coaja rasa de la 1 portocala mica\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"30e79aee-dee9-4ec7-b23d-4b5c797b4b4c\",\"Name\":\"un praf de sare\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"960f926b-9e65-4b04-a8c5-3b92808240a6\",\"Name\":\"vanilie\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"df374c86-74ac-48ce-9b51-0ad576e4aeac\",\"Name\":\"portocala\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":8},{\"Id\":\"8f530b8e-381f-4276-9f0a-42d947480bec\",\"Name\":\"ciocolata neagra 50-70%\",\"Amount\":30,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":9},{\"Id\":\"a4cd9e36-83b8-45c6-86df-351d9fbd1b46\",\"Name\":\"sau felii de cozonac ramas\",\"Amount\":6,\"Unit\":\"piscoturi\",\"Order\":10}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"77ae1ca8-b1e7-4244-b003-b7efe3ee10df\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"Se taie cubulete o portocala. Restul se stoarce si se foloseste sucul. Se mixeaza mascarponele cu zaharul si sucul de portocala. Se adauga frisca si se bate pana se ingroasa.\"},{\"Id\":\"29526d2a-d697-470a-864d-484ddcf1bbe7\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Se pastreaza un pic de suc si se inmoaie piscoturile, si se aseaza pe fundul paharelor, apoi bucati de portocale si crema. Se pot face doua straturi sau doar unul din fiecare. Se dau la rece.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-17 17:26:46.876484",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-17 17:26:46.876484"
  },
  {
    "Id": "2E5D8514-0A91-4463-8AF2-587F915C3B0F",
    "Title": "Desert rapid la pahar cu zmeur\u0103",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Desert_rapid_la_pahar_cu_zmeur\u0103.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 1,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"cca0a62f-a4e8-4d34-b2ef-679a24dbc547\",\"Name\":\"Biscui\\u021Bi digestivi\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"fd61170a-2e50-4c01-a1af-6009f9ab00bc\",\"Name\":\"mascarpone\",\"Amount\":250,\"Unit\":\"grame\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"ea0f7110-5470-4dc8-867e-4abbd9a8cc60\",\"Name\":\"ciocolat\\u0103 alb\\u0103\",\"Amount\":100,\"Unit\":\"grame\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"2a5c6e74-8cf9-43e7-9ea9-2e024bff8931\",\"Name\":\"sm\\u00E2nt\\u00E2n\\u0103 pentru fri\\u0219c\\u0103\",\"Amount\":200,\"Unit\":\"ml\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"eafb7be5-6fd0-4bc3-b97a-0654e20d3fab\",\"Name\":\"Miere de albine\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"d3a386e8-98df-431a-bd40-9b0ff8b679da\",\"Name\":\"zmeur\\u0103 congelat\\u0103 sau proasp\\u0103t\\u0103\",\"Amount\":300,\"Unit\":\"grame\",\"Order\":6}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"8e9f88ed-d33a-4163-94dd-9e94e78ca4d7\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"Biscui\\u021Bi digestivi * 250 grame mascarpone * 100 grame ciocolat\\u0103 alb\\u0103 * 200 ml sm\\u00E2nt\\u00E2n\\u0103 pentru fri\\u0219c\\u0103 * Miere de albine * 300 grame zmeur\\u0103 congelat\\u0103 sau proasp\\u0103t\\u0103\"},{\"Id\":\"c9cfac44-9d44-4a6c-8a00-6b0f36cb1d8c\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"\\u00CEntr-un bol am pus mascarponele, ciocolata alb\\u0103 topit\\u0103 \\u0219i le-am b\\u0103tut bine p\\u00E2n\\u0103 s-au \\u00EEncorporat. Apoi am pus \\u0219i sm\\u00E2nt\\u00E2na pentru fri\\u0219c\\u0103, \\u0219i le-am mixat bine, p\\u00E2n\\u0103 a devenit o crem\\u0103 pufoas\\u0103.\"},{\"Id\":\"80af5909-7de4-47a0-8f38-05a6a57a280b\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"\\u00CEntr-un pahar \\u00EEnc\\u0103p\\u0103tor, sau canu\\u021Be mai mici, depinde de cum v\\u0103 place, am pus un biscuite \\u00EEntreg, peste am venit cu 2 linguri generoase de crem\\u0103, iar peste cu o m\\u00E2n\\u0103 de zmeur\\u0103, congelat\\u0103 am folosit eu. Peste am pus o linguri\\u021B\\u0103 de miere.\"},{\"Id\":\"5740a57a-48d6-4c5c-b88b-1bb1ab9f8d35\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Apoi am repetat pa\\u0219ii \\u00EEnc\\u0103 o dat\\u0103, p\\u00E2n\\u0103 paharul s-a umplut. Iar la final, cu anti-talentul meu, am decorat paharele cum m-am descurcat eu mai bine.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2150445",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2150445"
  },
  {
