    "CuisineType": "Desert",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"b3895db7-ddb7-4dfd-8c1f-f351aad89264\",\"Name\":\"dulci, medii, cur\\u0103\\u021Ba\\u021Bi de coaj\\u0103 \\u0219i t\\u0103ia\\u021Bi \\u00EEn felii sub\\u021Biri ca chipsurile\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"cartofi\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"054e4f7c-a975-4cd3-b65a-d8f7bca862a1\",\"Name\":\"linguri\\u021B\\u0103 de ulei\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"3eccddd1-b5bf-4ceb-849a-ef8123d65169\",\"Name\":\"ceap\\u0103 medie tocat\\u0103 m\\u0103runt (sau ceap\\u0103 verde)\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"4dfd1fcd-6b0a-418c-8468-29f4a3eb7ac1\",\"Name\":\"100-150 gr spanac proasp\\u0103t (sau alte verde\\u021Buri de sezon \\u2013 leurd\\u0103, de exemplu)\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"48a4693b-ac38-454a-bcdb-459928bb8baa\",\"Name\":\"lapte\",\"Amount\":125,\"Unit\":\"ml\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"223bff96-5def-45c3-82d4-68e08a4c1181\",\"Name\":\"\\u00BC linguri\\u021B\\u0103 de sare\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"6e1f43d9-b98b-4149-9917-938c4e02ffcf\",\"Name\":\"\\u00BC linguri\\u021B\\u0103 piper negru proasp\\u0103t m\\u0103cinat\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"38ea9f12-9057-46e6-a94a-8c1c6763d0d8\",\"Name\":\"\\u00BC linguri\\u021B\\u0103 piper ro\\u0219u proasp\\u0103t m\\u0103cinat\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":8},{\"Id\":\"781d5ebb-d20b-482e-9669-7f2e84d878a3\",\"Name\":\"ou\\u0103\",\"Amount\":4,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":9},{\"Id\":\"201c8cdb-4422-40ad-a842-1a44a696ac4f\",\"Name\":\"albu\\u0219uri de ou\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":10},{\"Id\":\"687056a3-a77d-43e2-9fcb-73561bbc8d7e\",\"Name\":\"de br\\u00E2nz\\u0103 feta (de oaie, de capr\\u0103, ricotta etc.)\",\"Amount\":50,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":11}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"3c1385d4-f762-424c-b516-f26fdf634703\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"2 cartofi dulci, medii, cur\\u0103\\u021Ba\\u021Bi de coaj\\u0103 \\u0219i t\\u0103ia\\u021Bi \\u00EEn felii sub\\u021Biri ca chipsurile 1 linguri\\u021B\\u0103 de ulei 1 ceap\\u0103 medie tocat\\u0103 m\\u0103runt (sau ceap\\u0103 verde) 100-150 gr spanac proasp\\u0103t (sau alte verde\\u021Buri de sezon \\u2013 leurd\\u0103, de exemplu) 125 ml lapte \\u00BC linguri\\u021B\\u0103 de sare \\u00BC linguri\\u021B\\u0103 piper negru proasp\\u0103t m\\u0103cinat \\u00BC linguri\\u021B\\u0103 piper ro\\u0219u proasp\\u0103t m\\u0103cinat 4 ou\\u0103 2 albu\\u0219uri de ou 50 gr de br\\u00E2nz\\u0103 feta (de oaie, de capr\\u0103, ricotta etc.)\"},{\"Id\":\"58d5f939-672f-4cda-a95a-5527d1941574\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Pre\\u00EEnc\\u0103lzi\\u021Bi cuptorul la 190\\u00B0C.\"},{\"Id\":\"6a3770a7-4867-4cb7-8b36-31a51f0bbf9d\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Lua\\u021Bi o form\\u0103 de tart\\u0103/tigaie cu diametrul de 20-24 cm \\u0219i unge\\u021Bi-o cu ulei. Forma\\u021Bi apoi \\u201Ccrusta\\u201D tartei a\\u0219ez\\u00E2nd feliile sub\\u021Biri de cartofi dulci de jur \\u00EEmprejurul t\\u0103vii, astfel \\u00EEnc\\u00E2t s\\u0103 se suprapun\\u0103 pe jum\\u0103tate, precum \\u0219i pe fundul vasului pe care l-a\\u021Bi ales pentru copt. Pulveriza\\u021Bi ulei pe feliile de cartofi \\u0219i introduce\\u021Bi tava \\u00EEn cuptor pentru 20 de minunte.\"},{\"Id\":\"ab9c6124-068a-493b-9903-e495e6f7084f\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"\\u00CEn acest timp, pune\\u021Bi pu\\u021Bin ulei \\u00EEntr-o tigaie \\u0219i ad\\u0103uga\\u021Bi ceapa tocat\\u0103 m\\u0103runt. Lasa\\u021Bi 3 minute la sotat, apoi ad\\u0103uga\\u021Bi \\u0219i spanacul pentru alte 3 minute. Apoi lua\\u021Bi tigaia de pe foc.\"},{\"Id\":\"5f4aa1d1-d0c6-400d-8a3c-2c33a2fdf7ed\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"\\u00CEntr-un bol, amesteca\\u021Bi laptele, cele 4 ou\\u0103 \\u0219i 2 albu\\u0219uri, sarea \\u0219i piperul. Scoate\\u021Bi crusta de cartofi din cuptor \\u0219i pune\\u021Bi spanacul sotat. Ad\\u0103uga\\u021Bi amestecul de ou\\u0103, lapte, sare, piper negru \\u0219i ro\\u0219u, iar apoi cubule\\u021Bele de br\\u00E2nz\\u0103 feta. Introduce\\u021Bi din nou tava \\u00EEn cuptor \\u0219i mai coace\\u021Bi pentru 35 de minute la aceea\\u0219i temperatur\\u0103, sau c\\u00E2t este nevoie pentru a se \\u00EEncheaga amestecul de ou.\"},{\"Id\":\"53d3c75d-88bf-4816-8f4f-649105697c62\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"C\\u00E2nd tarta este coapt\\u0103, scoate\\u021Bi-o din cuptor, lasa\\u021Bi-o 5-10 minute s\\u0103 se r\\u0103ceasc\\u0103, apoi por\\u021Biona\\u021Bi-o.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2153494",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2153494"
  },
  {
    "Id": "3589A624-0697-418A-9C56-1F960AF596CB",
    "Title": "Prajitura cu blat de cacao si crema de visine",
    "Description": "Un desert delicios care combin\u0103 savoarea unic\u0103 a ingredientelor \u00eentr-o re\u021bet\u0103 rafinat\u0103. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Prajitura_cu_blat_de_cacao_si_crema_de_visine.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "Desert",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"ab72e486-77f3-42e0-83b0-90ee46a936af\",\"Name\":\"Blat cacao:\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"0c08eb28-a61e-4c49-84b7-2540caa500ae\",\"Name\":\"zahar\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"cana\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"9f322daa-c89e-4beb-853f-94897473b9bf\",\"Name\":\"cacao\",\"Amount\":3,\"Unit\":\"tbsp\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"f5d8453f-5e51-4a5b-83d2-17f081884cc9\",\"Name\":\"3/4 cana ulei\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"5fbf1bfb-6e0f-4093-b9f5-8962de1113ca\",\"Name\":\"1/2 cana apa\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"f6c65edb-e183-4326-b152-c25f0ce38461\",\"Name\":\"oua\",\"Amount\":5,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"4a723c75-376c-464c-927a-35c8b9024b7d\",\"Name\":\"1/2 cana faina\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"0ee41dd6-05d7-47dd-b8c7-162ddf96f30e\",\"Name\":\"praf copt\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"plic\",\"Order\":8},{\"Id\":\"3362f320-c5d4-48d3-bed1-f3d354670c66\",\"Name\":\"1/2 cana zahar pudra\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":9},{\"Id\":\"52e7a8e7-f350-4b9f-96cc-7869bd6470c4\",\"Name\":\"Crema visine:\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":10},{\"Id\":\"c09f16aa-2230-4308-bc3d-60eda95896c3\",\"Name\":\"smantana frisca\",\"Amount\":500,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":11},{\"Id\":\"03a7c54a-2c33-4cd7-b7f1-380355c88b77\",\"Name\":\"congelate\",\"Amount\":800,\"Unit\":\"visine\",\"Order\":12},{\"Id\":\"c73cf658-183b-43a3-85be-36b803ca7981\",\"Name\":\"zeama de lamaie\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"tbsp\",\"Order\":13},{\"Id\":\"c418f15b-e255-4313-a7c3-53d30f5d3e88\",\"Name\":\"zahar\",\"Amount\":5,\"Unit\":\"tbsp\",\"Order\":14},{\"Id\":\"45bcd41b-b0ac-45eb-8dc4-0d95854d05cf\",\"Name\":\"apa\",\"Amount\":100,\"Unit\":\"ml\",\"Order\":15},{\"Id\":\"2187c547-16d0-4b30-93c0-2ccc37cf614b\",\"Name\":\"gelatina\",\"Amount\":30,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":16},{\"Id\":\"2060915c-04f6-46fd-8eb8-59c272d505f8\",\"Name\":\"Glazura ciocolata\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":17},{\"Id\":\"5ce42d70-0996-47ca-acea-46abf4c55f24\",\"Name\":\"smanatan frisca\",\"Amount\":125,\"Unit\":\"ml\",\"Order\":18},{\"Id\":\"2ec5e237-2f2c-44d4-b775-83ec91800329\",\"Name\":\"ciocolata\",\"Amount\":125,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":19}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"415cd0ae-8fe2-4ce4-8b40-871ac46f50b8\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"Blat cacao: * 1 cana zahar * 3 lg cacao * 3/4 cana ulei * 1/2 cana apa * 5 oua * 1 1/2 cana faina * 1 plic praf copt * 1/2 cana zahar pudra Crema visine: * 500 gr smantana frisca * 800 visine congelate * 2lg zeama de lamaie * 5 lg zahar * 100 ml apa * 30gr gelatina Glazura ciocolata * 125ml smanatan frisca * 125 gr ciocolata\"},{\"Id\":\"54fe9a8a-d4c0-4ab6-ab06-8e251417b792\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"zaharul, cacao, uleiul si apa se fierb pe foc mic pana se dizolva zaharul. Se lasa sa se raceasca\"},{\"Id\":\"f8658395-b548-4e24-a521-b52f880020ef\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Albusele se bat spuma impreuna cu zaharul pudra. Se adauga pe rand galbenusele si compozitia fiarta dupa ce s-a racit bine.\"},{\"Id\":\"803119a8-5c69-489d-9797-1fd4e453eaae\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Se incorporeaza faina si praful de copt.\"},{\"Id\":\"16dc9dca-71ce-4455-9150-c8c991f4bd80\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"Se pune intr-o tava si se coace (as recomanda in 2 ture, mai usor decat sa se raie ulterior blatul)\"},{\"Id\":\"54f277cb-2591-4eb7-b2bf-2bf76ff513c1\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"Visinele, zaharul, apa si zeama de lamaie fierb si se blendeaza, obtinandu-se un piure. Se lasa sa se raceasca si se incorporeza gelatina in ea inainte de a fi rece complet.\"},{\"Id\":\"be63f07b-0ad6-4b68-a753-e9a3a711c167\",\"StepNumber\":7,\"Text\":\"Smantana se bate si se obtine frisca, se incorporeaza si piureul de visine si se lasa la frigider 30min - 1 ora( nu peste noapte ca e mai greu de intins dupa ce se intareste)\"},{\"Id\":\"1c0edfc0-2f81-44ce-ac7a-c5508bdcb10a\",\"StepNumber\":8,\"Text\":\"Blaturile se insiropeaza cu un sirop de zahar (sau lichior de visine/amaretto). Se pune un blat, jumatate din crema, apoi al doilea blat si restul de crema. Se da prajitura la rece 1-2 ore sau peste noapte. Apoi se toarna peste glazura de ciocolata (care trebuie sa fie rece - la temperatura camerei)\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2156821",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2156821"
  },
  {
    "Id": "35D977D8-6BA8-46BA-8AFB-214D012F6B71",
    "Title": "Tort diplomat cu iaurt si fructe",
    "Description": "Un desert delicios care combin\u0103 savoarea unic\u0103 a ingredientelor \u00eentr-o re\u021bet\u0103 rafinat\u0103. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Tort_diplomat_cu_iaurt_si_fructe.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 1,
    "CuisineType": "Desert",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"fc5f640e-0cd9-40f0-9ad9-463d56e69f16\",\"Name\":\"zmeura sau fructe congelate\",\"Amount\":500,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"762a7435-9f98-4025-94f3-31e44f54f33c\",\"Name\":\"iaurt 10%\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"kg\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"0a6ac2ad-c930-41ef-83c1-ae6c56438913\",\"Name\":\"zahar pudra\",\"Amount\":300,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"8cd6bdf4-0430-4c5a-8b8a-022a4b26d43e\",\"Name\":\"-30 gr gelatina\",\"Amount\":20,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"d4e5687d-97e2-4850-8466-3c357376c639\",\"Name\":\"vanilie\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"0184c0e8-4f71-41e8-9b99-aff0b9f648ea\",\"Name\":\"piscoturi (sau se poate face un blat de pandispan- trebuie insiropat -probabil si poscoturile)\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":6}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"c010d600-347f-430c-86dd-25f0bef25876\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"500 gr zmeura sau fructe congelate * 1 kg iaurt 10% * 300 gr zahar pudra * 20 -30 gr gelatina * vanilie * piscoturi (sau se poate face un blat de pandispan- trebuie insiropat -probabil si poscoturile)\"},{\"Id\":\"4a7bf4e6-6487-44cd-944b-98718bd4d51d\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Am amestecat bine fructele cu iaurtul. Intr-o cratita am pus la hidratat gelatina. Am preparat un blat de pandispan si l-am avut pregatit intr-o forma.\"},{\"Id\":\"140fe0a7-7bc3-49e8-9e25-9026abddf2f7\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Am incalzit gelatina pana cand s-a topit, fara sa fiarba (nu are voie sa depaseasca 60grade). Am pus cate o lingura din iaurt in gelatina pana am temperat gelatina, apoi am turnat totul peste restul de iaurt cu fructe si am amestecat foarte repede. Am turnat amestecul peste pandispan si am dat la rece.\"},{\"Id\":\"b9c38f3d-750f-4d85-8d8e-071dbdc193dc\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Dupa ce se incheaga se poate decora cu fructe si ciocolata.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.215793",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.215793"
  },
  {
    "Id": "37B7A5D8-8CFC-4612-95D2-5E876E288858",
    "Title": "Pui cu lamaie",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Pui_cu_lamaie.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"f237545d-6051-4a19-8e18-cdaac511ba90\",\"Name\":\"de piept de pui\",\"Amount\":4,\"Unit\":\"fileuri\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"7a4e944a-a373-4693-8da6-3b7453f75377\",\"Name\":\"l\\u0103m\\u00E2i\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"58c3de3b-f436-4d42-9e2e-43ea70c1851a\",\"Name\":\"1-2 c\\u0103\\u0163ei de usturoi, op\\u0163ional\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"43157980-5c71-406c-9c6a-b855dd6a60b2\",\"Name\":\"unt\",\"Amount\":40,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"6be6f98c-3884-45f0-9d9a-42bf09bebc79\",\"Name\":\"de f\\u0103in\\u0103, cam 75 gr\",\"Amount\":3,\"Unit\":\"tbsp\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"02dc24a5-7314-4269-b899-cc2c7fed7ad2\",\"Name\":\"baz\\u0103 de legume sau pui\",\"Amount\":100,\"Unit\":\"ml\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"1cb6f4f0-9236-43ae-8ff1-7b1852787484\",\"Name\":\"sare, piper cu l\\u0103m\\u00E2ie, nuc\\u015Foar\\u0103\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"ed8960ab-947d-43f8-a0af-12d8c674b847\",\"Name\":\"rozmarin, oregano, cimbru, op\\u0163ional.\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":8}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"1e77cd4c-b856-4103-812e-cfed61831139\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"4 fileuri de piept de pui * 2 l\\u0103m\\u00E2i * 1-2 c\\u0103\\u0163ei de usturoi, op\\u0163ional * 40 gr unt * 3 linguri de f\\u0103in\\u0103, cam 75 gr * 100 ml baz\\u0103 de legume sau pui * sare, piper cu l\\u0103m\\u00E2ie, nuc\\u015Foar\\u0103 * rozmarin, oregano, cimbru, op\\u0163ional.\"},{\"Id\":\"c99f3617-fb4a-4a93-890e-bed13d9429d9\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Se curata fileurile de excesul de apa, dupa care se condimenteaza cu sare, piper si un praf nucsoara.\"},{\"Id\":\"8c8212c9-afa4-4747-8d8d-5703ef80d914\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Cele doua lamai se spala bine, una se stoarce si se folosesc feliile de la o jumatate de lamaie.\"},{\"Id\":\"2b9aa206-baad-4c33-8232-611126cf8a4c\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Fileurile se dau prin faina si se prajesc cateva minute pe fiecare parte intr-o tigaie cu unt, dupa care se scot.\"},{\"Id\":\"0a3e1013-5289-4fe0-8ed3-3ee2c49bd0ca\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"In tigaie se adauga unt si rozmarin, care se scoate dupa 1 min. Se adauga feliile de lamaie, supa de pui, zeama de lamaie, sare si piper dupa gust. Se lasa sa scada sosul.\"},{\"Id\":\"7b644b64-5cf4-45d3-9c52-526f0ab387bb\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"Dupa ce a scazut un pic se adauga inapoi si fileurile de pui.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2158929",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2158929"
  },
  {
    "Id": "3CC41C93-838F-4E8C-939D-8734778403EE",
    "Title": "Biscuiti inimosi",
    "Description": "Un desert delicios care combin\u0103 savoarea unic\u0103 a ingredientelor \u00eentr-o re\u021bet\u0103 rafinat\u0103. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Biscuiti_inimosi.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "Desert",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"d6d27854-968c-4a58-ab8a-9e2b58136af9\",\"Name\":\"f\\u0103in\\u0103\",\"Amount\":360,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"d72b5c72-d056-4976-9f43-78a2b98f244f\",\"Name\":\"f\\u0103in\\u0103 de migdale (sau migdale m\\u0103cinate c\\u00E2t mai fin)\",\"Amount\":85,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"4474a0a2-1a66-4da4-b6e6-cc5da79a69c7\",\"Name\":\"linguri\\u021B\\u0103 condimente pt vin fiert Fuchs , r\\u00E2\\u0219nite (v\\u0103 recomand s\\u0103 folosi\\u021Bi o r\\u00E2\\u0219ni\\u021B\\u0103 de cafea)\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"8774f774-a0cd-4c0a-abf9-f9e048af113a\",\"Name\":\"1/2 linguri\\u021B\\u0103 scor\\u021Bi\\u0219oar\\u0103 Ceylon\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"2e7e4d71-3937-490e-afd3-58465c0b4ed9\",\"Name\":\"unt rece de la frigider\",\"Amount\":100,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"17940f37-90cd-41fd-b288-81e75a5762cf\",\"Name\":\"sfecl\\u0103 ro\\u0219ie fiart\\u0103/ coapt\\u0103\",\"Amount\":100,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"fbfbb0c3-1bee-415f-9a99-bb335693e786\",\"Name\":\"c\\u0103p\\u0219uni\",\"Amount\":70,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"bb9cb789-a01d-4d76-8731-78b30c7bf868\",\"Name\":\"de miere ( sau se \\u00EEnlocuie\\u0219te cu 1/2 banan\\u0103)\",\"Amount\":4,\"Unit\":\"tbsp\",\"Order\":8}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"bf59e510-fd28-4b64-be8b-52ae1494381d\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"360g f\\u0103in\\u0103\"},{\"Id\":\"f6a69fef-c678-4e58-8656-7447f9f6505e\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Pre\\u00EEnc\\u0103lzi\\u021Bi cuptorul la **175grade cu ventila\\u021Bie.**\"},{\"Id\":\"5f50ec9e-98ca-4253-b0ba-5549e2126012\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Pune\\u021Bi \\u00EEn blender c\\u0103p\\u0219unile \\u0219i sfecla \\u0219i mixa\\u021Bi p\\u00E2n\\u0103 ce ob\\u021Bine\\u021Bi un piure fin.\"},{\"Id\":\"5ea51b84-e773-4045-9b59-a06c9141b066\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"\\u00CEntr-un bol amesteca\\u021Bi ingredientele uscate cu untul, p\\u00E2n\\u0103 ce ob\\u021Bine\\u021Bi o textur\\u0103 nisipoas\\u0103.\"},{\"Id\":\"954b2391-ab09-4067-a8d7-142395fda7ce\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"\\u00CEncorpora\\u021Bi mierea \\u0219i piureul de c\\u0103p\\u0219uni cu sfecl\\u0103.\"},{\"Id\":\"920e8e8d-d79f-4c84-ac7c-0fa4e68751a6\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"Dac\\u0103 e lipicios aluatul mai ad\\u0103uga\\u021Bi o lingur\\u0103 de f\\u0103in\\u0103.\"},{\"Id\":\"0bd29d9c-a365-47f5-b6a0-781cd51d00a2\",\"StepNumber\":7,\"Text\":\"Pe blatul \\u00EEnf\\u0103inat \\u00EEntinde\\u021Bi o foaie sub\\u021Bire de aluat, de aproximativ 3mm grosime, apoi decupa\\u021Bi \\u00EEn formele dorite.\"},{\"Id\":\"483a7bad-0b01-4fda-b418-1d6572e18eb1\",\"StepNumber\":8,\"Text\":\"A\\u0219eza\\u021Bi biscui\\u021Bii \\u00EEntr-o tav\\u0103 tapetat\\u0103 cu h\\u00E2rtie de copt.\"},{\"Id\":\"2fbc6369-eaad-4e42-9779-c099340018d8\",\"StepNumber\":9,\"Text\":\"Introduce\\u021Bi tava \\u00EEn cuptorul pre\\u00EEnc\\u0103lzit \\u0219i coace\\u021Bi timp de **10-12 minute dac\\u0103 dori\\u021Bi s\\u0103 fie mai moi sau 14-15 minute** dac\\u0103 \\u00EEi prefera\\u021Bi crocan\\u021Bi.\"},{\"Id\":\"997708aa-9f41-488b-b7a1-f93a1ff11deb\",\"StepNumber\":10,\"Text\":\"Inimioarele mici au nevoie de aproximativ 8 minute la cuptor.\"},{\"Id\":\"cdbae03c-db8b-488c-95b3-b4b1be0ffe07\",\"StepNumber\":11,\"Text\":\"C\\u00E2nd sunt gata l\\u0103sa\\u021Bi-i la r\\u0103cit pe un gr\\u0103tar metalic.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-02-16 15:32:51.8958349",
    "LastModified": "2026-02-16 15:32:51.8958349"
  },
  {
    "Id": "4047BF8E-64CD-459E-960C-BEA0D276CA1F",
    "Title": "Grisine dovleac",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/placeholder.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"9aa337cf-ef6d-42f4-abec-1aa84925830c\",\"Name\":\"dovleac\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"felie\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"42c01ff7-7ef0-4e5a-b1a5-507826ae2027\",\"Name\":\"mozarela\",\"Amount\":50,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"8e0b8355-f356-4973-b3fa-6b7898b281d4\",\"Name\":\"unt topit\",\"Amount\":100,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"fd200e6c-b34c-49f7-884e-7be5673c8a12\",\"Name\":\"ulei de masline\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"tbsp\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"eba950e6-f1d7-434d-88d4-ee2ad5fecfda\",\"Name\":\"faina\",\"Amount\":250,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"27aa53c1-fd3f-45ad-8bd2-e06339168937\",\"Name\":\"seminte susan\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"tbsp\",\"Order\":6}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"71b3daed-b2e7-435b-8d08-319d21caeb41\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"1 felie dovleac * 50gr mozarela * 100gr unt topit * 1 lg ulei de masline * 250gr faina * 1 lg seminte susan\"},{\"Id\":\"31a0cacf-19fb-4d71-b69c-d1714f6a8d02\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Am topit untul 2min/70gr/vit3\"},{\"Id\":\"aaabd480-3568-41e2-9302-e9e5208dfd03\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Am adaugat mozarela, uleiul si dovlecul taiat bucati. Am maruntit totul bine vreo 10 secunde.\"},{\"Id\":\"24464711-1565-4581-bc09-3da074860cfe\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Am adaugat faina si am framantat 4 min.\"},{\"Id\":\"0b3a4759-e34c-4141-9bfd-f57787c10b65\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"Aluatul nu trebuie sa se lipeasca, dar sa fie moale.\"},{\"Id\":\"cc2c54a1-19da-486c-9f98-1830fc59dda3\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"L-am modelat si am pus la cuptor la 180grade - 30-40min.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2161115",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2161115"
  },
  {
    "Id": "42368036-5766-4FC0-B94D-19D78211805D",
    "Title": "Ciorba de iarna (de cartofi)",
    "Description": "O sup\u0103 aromat\u0103 \u0219i reconfortant\u0103, perfect\u0103 pentru orice mas\u0103. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Ciorba_de_iarna_(de_cartofi",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "Sup\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"d9a1130a-c108-4130-87eb-cbc195e4d2aa\",\"Name\":\"kaiser sau fleica porc\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"8dd18a71-e53c-4a7f-a100-cbf31facc0ae\",\"Name\":\"dati pe razatoare\",\"Amount\":1.2,\"Unit\":\"morcovi\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"ad962ef0-2ffa-463f-ad11-7a4f3bdc6ff7\",\"Name\":\"cartofi\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"47affcc2-0e99-4fe8-bd65-9c4ff877cf21\",\"Name\":\"usturoi\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"a6a31116-536b-4434-95a7-ee1c5dd6ca7c\",\"Name\":\"patrunjel\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"56c1aa69-e94e-4134-a4fd-6f3a33809479\",\"Name\":\"sare, piper, chimen\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":6}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"63744dca-906c-478e-8514-2b72f931b3b5\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"kaiser sau fleica porc * 1,2 morcovi dati pe razatoare * cartofi * usturoi * patrunjel * sare, piper, chimen\"},{\"Id\":\"4be534b0-fbf9-4f44-b982-b4a75b5a56b2\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Se pune fleica in oala si se prajeste un pic. Pe cand e gata se adauga morcovul si se caleste si acesta cu niste seminte de chimen. Optional fleica se poate scoate\"},{\"Id\":\"0a36ad93-a6ca-4815-9ba1-960f938fa5c0\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Am adaugat si o parte din cartofi taiati mai mari.\"},{\"Id\":\"8a2ce521-0c73-4dbd-9abb-3ec6710f17d4\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Cand cartofii au fiert, i-am scos si i-am pisat, am adaugat smantana si usturoi.\"},{\"Id\":\"6ce83f3b-84b3-4bcf-aef6-70cfdd2a25ed\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"Am pus restul de cartofi la fiert in oala. Am gustat de sare.\"},{\"Id\":\"ea03caa7-1c11-4aa6-8507-7be79342a481\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"Cand au fiert am adaugat ingrosala facuta din cartofi in ciorba. Adaugam verdeata tocata.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2164166",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2164166"
  },
  {
    "Id": "42931016-40F8-4552-8838-1ED4F88F7849",
    "Title": "\u015eal\u0103u cu sos de capere",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/\u015eal\u0103u_cu_sos_de_capere.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"bf99d7e4-e711-47d9-91b4-4f34492ee502\",\"Name\":\"de \\u015Fal\\u0103u\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"fileuri\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"8e04c7d4-c85c-4907-b973-ee7461f17798\",\"Name\":\"de ulei de m\\u0103sline\",\"Amount\":3,\"Unit\":\"tbsp\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"017e8044-e608-4a1e-add4-6bd3b3e4b9df\",\"Name\":\"sare, piper dup\\u0103 gust\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"e5c68a85-aea4-4495-a99c-ec2f8f410f09\",\"Name\":\"Sos\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"1ed13aa8-a1b0-4a79-95e0-79a6320b0cea\",\"Name\":\"l\\u0103m\\u00E2ie\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"ae69eaa1-3283-47b4-b91f-6486e18943a1\",\"Name\":\"coaja ras\\u0103 de la 1 lime\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"8cb063f8-cec5-4873-9647-c5287e3d2a40\",\"Name\":\"ceap\\u0103 ro\\u015Fie sau alb\\u0103\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"fa3764a8-f283-4c38-8cd7-e4c89d63214b\",\"Name\":\"de capere \\u00EEn saramur\\u0103\",\"Amount\":20,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":8},{\"Id\":\"3673158d-9f32-43c7-b14f-2a62dc7a4c04\",\"Name\":\"de unt\",\"Amount\":150,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":9},{\"Id\":\"e0a56b1e-2f8c-4125-a0a2-1bedae550c78\",\"Name\":\"vin alb\",\"Amount\":100,\"Unit\":\"ml\",\"Order\":10},{\"Id\":\"820a0397-586a-4230-a29f-9e08cb4d0c85\",\"Name\":\"c\\u00E2teva fire de m\\u0103rar\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":11},{\"Id\":\"d34359ed-ed0a-4feb-8263-c49260c7c528\",\"Name\":\"sare, piper dup\\u0103 gust\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":12},{\"Id\":\"70938cfb-1251-4d6b-97e1-5426f51fecb2\",\"Name\":\"usturoi, op\\u0163\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":13}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"270108db-5701-4934-ab69-10fcd459fb4b\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"2 fileuri de \\u015Fal\\u0103u * 3 linguri de ulei de m\\u0103sline * sare, piper dup\\u0103 gust Sos * 1 l\\u0103m\\u00E2ie * coaja ras\\u0103 de la 1 lime * 1 ceap\\u0103 ro\\u015Fie sau alb\\u0103 * 20 gr de capere \\u00EEn saramur\\u0103 * 150 gr de unt * 100 ml vin alb * c\\u00E2teva fire de m\\u0103rar * sare, piper dup\\u0103 gust * usturoi, op\\u0163\"},{\"Id\":\"ad434921-d0b9-491f-be4f-12111fdc1f69\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Condiment\\u0103m fileurile de \\u015Fal\\u0103u cu sare \\u015Fi piper, apoi le d\\u0103m prin f\\u0103in\\u0103 \\u015Fi le scutur\\u0103m bine pentru a elimina excesul de f\\u0103in\\u0103.\"},{\"Id\":\"5ac603a7-2bd6-434e-b2d3-5bdfbae4cd46\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"\\u00CEntr-o tigaie punem cele 3 linguri de ulei de m\\u0103sline \\u015Fi pr\\u0103jim fileurile c\\u00E2teva minute pe fiecare parte.\"},{\"Id\":\"c511774d-f8d4-4f46-96a2-fcc77c85549a\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"\\u00CEntr-o cr\\u0103ticioar\\u0103 am c\\u0103lit ceapa in 25 gr de unt, apoi am ad\\u0103ugat vinul alb \\u015Fi am redus totul un pic.\"},{\"Id\":\"86ec94a4-c1b3-407a-a3ef-c29a3f480745\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"Ad\\u0103ug\\u0103m restul de unt, 100 gr, pe care l-am t\\u0103iat cuburi mai mari, unul c\\u00E2te unul \\u015Fi amestec\\u0103m bine p\\u00E2n\\u0103 se formeaz\\u0103 un sos gros.\"},{\"Id\":\"22ca6e0d-1940-400b-9fe7-60987916c3fb\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"\\u00CEn sosul astfel preparat ad\\u0103ug\\u0103m caperele, feliile de l\\u0103m\\u00E2ie fara coaja, coaj\\u0103 ras\\u0103 de lime \\u015Fi m\\u0103rar \\u015Fi mai fierbem 1-2 minute, astfel aromele s\\u0103 se \\u00EEntrep\\u0103trund\\u0103.\"},{\"Id\":\"44f88527-3b61-4776-8e0e-6e77534728bd\",\"StepNumber\":7,\"Text\":\"Op\\u0163ional pute\\u0163i ad\\u0103uga \\u00EEn sos \\u015Fi 1-2 c\\u0103\\u0163ei de usturoi.\"},{\"Id\":\"fc641276-fa3a-47cd-b5da-70ffc33b4aa0\",\"StepNumber\":8,\"Text\":\"Peste fileurile de pe\\u015Fte din farfurie turn\\u0103m sosul de capere.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2165402",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2165402"
  },
  {
    "Id": "42F4DEC6-DE41-4A65-9095-0CEB7AA0C444",
    "Title": "Gogosi ou de bou cu branza",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Gogosi_ou_de_bou_cu_branza.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"fc1a1149-669d-4c07-ac92-c2d7bcbbf78e\",\"Name\":\"\\u2022750 g f\\u0103in\\u0103\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"ae09d334-df39-4545-863f-35b9c57abf23\",\"Name\":\"\\u2022350 g lapte\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"2ba08210-d692-478d-a08f-8bd6d90590ad\",\"Name\":\"\\u2022125 g zahar\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"3b27e753-e36e-4105-b3bc-cbe13dab2b22\",\"Name\":\"\\u20224 g\\u0103lbenu\\u0219uri\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"0f99408c-0d8a-4c3b-9c11-11bef0bc38ca\",\"Name\":\"\\u2022un praf de sare\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"5337ba4b-086e-4e88-a3eb-b96d9332118f\",\"Name\":\"\\u2022coaja de l\\u0103m\\u00E2ie( BIO)\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"412f05e1-e260-4a26-9ad3-6b5dd5337268\",\"Name\":\"\\u2022vanilie\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"9ef0bc37-737d-4e0c-8649-fc87c6e4d3d6\",\"Name\":\"\\u202230 g drojdie proasp\\u0103t\\u0103 sau 10 g drojdie uscat\\u0103\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":8},{\"Id\":\"f9731f55-656c-43fe-b6fe-6fb6c58549bb\",\"Name\":\"\\u2022500 g br\\u00E2nz\\u0103 dulce de vaci\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":9},{\"Id\":\"838c7851-b20f-4337-86a3-17b25c6dd0c2\",\"Name\":\"\\u20222 ou\\u0103\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":10},{\"Id\":\"74c03089-0972-4331-9128-6e50c85b375e\",\"Name\":\"\\u2022150 g zah\\u0103r\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":11},{\"Id\":\"2a44bbd3-5254-4b3b-9d27-dac691e3f974\",\"Name\":\"\\u2022100 g gri\\u0219\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":12},{\"Id\":\"1d68e90c-846c-417e-881b-0101edb7578b\",\"Name\":\"\\u2022100 g stafide\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":13},{\"Id\":\"14e2a00d-8b74-42d2-baea-d682fccb0765\",\"Name\":\"\\u2022vanilie\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":14},{\"Id\":\"d641ad5d-7f1e-4c1d-9113-4931cd14c83b\",\"Name\":\"\\u2022un praf de sare\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":15}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"74b68d03-ed94-48ec-a869-3d46093be865\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"Pentru aluat : \\u2022750 g f\\u0103in\\u0103 \\u2022350 g lapte \\u2022125 g zahar \\u20224 g\\u0103lbenu\\u0219uri \\u2022un praf de sare \\u2022coaja de l\\u0103m\\u00E2ie( BIO) \\u2022vanilie \\u202230 g drojdie proasp\\u0103t\\u0103 sau 10 g drojdie uscat\\u0103 Pentru umplutur\\u0103: \\u2022500 g br\\u00E2nz\\u0103 dulce de vaci \\u20222 ou\\u0103 \\u2022150 g zah\\u0103r \\u2022100 g gri\\u0219 \\u2022100 g stafide \\u2022vanilie \\u2022un praf de sare Pentru uns : un ou\"},{\"Id\":\"d87666b8-3711-42fe-b5b8-2af6bf56560b\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"1 . Se pun in bol laptele, drojdia \\u0219i zah\\u0103rul 3 minute/37 *C/ viteza 1\"},{\"Id\":\"ed730a9f-1e2c-4f28-aeac-883733101eb5\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"2 . Se adaug\\u0103 f\\u0103ina, g\\u0103lbenu\\u0219urile, sarea, coaja de l\\u0103m\\u00E2ie, vanilia si se fr\\u0103m\\u00E2nt\\u0103 3 minute/spic .\"},{\"Id\":\"ac125eee-8ca5-4038-80f3-f518911f08aa\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"3 . Se las\\u0103 aluatul la dospit o or\\u0103 .\"},{\"Id\":\"2416b8fe-9a54-4726-8567-498e1051fcb2\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"4 . Pentru umplutur\\u0103 se pun in bol ou\\u0103le, sarea \\u0219i zah\\u0103rul si se bat 1minut /viteza 3,5\"},{\"Id\":\"26e4280b-da1e-4d66-a457-89228513b480\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"5 . Se adaug\\u0103 br\\u00E2nza, stafidele, gri\\u0219ul, vanilia si coaja de l\\u0103m\\u00E2ie \\u0219i se amestec\\u0103 1minut/ viteza 2 /Antiorar .\"},{\"Id\":\"6e7c04f8-8bf4-4342-9676-7b0f52456e3d\",\"StepNumber\":7,\"Text\":\"6 . Se \\u00EEmparte aluatul \\u00EEn 3 buc\\u0103\\u021Bi egale .\"},{\"Id\":\"7bd439f5-f46e-46c0-8382-672ea45c7068\",\"StepNumber\":8,\"Text\":\"Se \\u00EEntinde o foaie de un centimetru grosime ( nu mai mult) si se decupeaza cu o forma rotund\\u0103 ( trecut\\u0103 prin f\\u0103in\\u0103 ) discuri cu diametrul de 5-6 cm. Eu am folosit o cea\\u0219c\\u0103 de cafea.Se a\\u0219eaz\\u0103 formele intr-o tav\\u0103, pe h\\u00E2rtie de copt.\"},{\"Id\":\"530426d7-d78d-4497-a83b-c59fe0e81e4d\",\"StepNumber\":9,\"Text\":\"Se apas\\u0103 cu fundul aceleia\\u0219i ce\\u0219ti in centrul discurilor de aluat, form\\u00E2nd niste cavit\\u0103\\u021Bi (4 cm diametru) . Vede\\u021Bi fotografiile mele .\"},{\"Id\":\"3749ea2a-e303-400b-8505-3c72d0e98923\",\"StepNumber\":10,\"Text\":\"Se ung cu ou b\\u0103tut discurile de aluat si se umplu cavit\\u0103\\u021Bile din centru cu o lingur\\u0103 de umplutur\\u0103 cu br\\u00E2nz\\u0103.\"},{\"Id\":\"e7ddd80d-afa2-4b58-a269-7db48a71fa67\",\"StepNumber\":11,\"Text\":\"7 . Se coc 25 minute in cuptorul pre\\u00EEnc\\u0103lzit la 170 *C .\"},{\"Id\":\"5a8480cd-1378-446d-a20b-ad2ab9aa9ba4\",\"StepNumber\":12,\"Text\":\"8 . Se pot pudra cu zah\\u0103r.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2166613",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2166613"
  },
  {
    "Id": "4ACAAE52-5701-4767-A1CB-CB7952E39908",
    "Title": "Prajitura melba cu piersici si zmeura",
    "Description": "Un desert delicios care combin\u0103 savoarea unic\u0103 a ingredientelor \u00eentr-o re\u021bet\u0103 rafinat\u0103. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Prajitura_melba_cu_piersici_si_zmeura.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "Desert",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"89a9185a-bd32-4a84-bdb4-6f2ccaefe3b3\",\"Name\":\"oua\",\"Amount\":3,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"8846636c-fd54-4709-9214-b1a8dbccb214\",\"Name\":\"zahar\",\"Amount\":90,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"8ea48c4d-ad52-4ff2-9b44-6e97dd8b65f0\",\"Name\":\"faina\",\"Amount\":90,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"9051039a-cf45-4525-9ed3-ad72b0bcbffc\",\"Name\":\"sare\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"strop\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"133a9a13-9814-453d-883a-95d2fb54fd9b\",\"Name\":\"smantana pentru frisca (30% grasime)\",\"Amount\":500,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"6806f370-044f-4fa9-8da4-fc5d19dc8f07\",\"Name\":\"iaurt grecesc\",\"Amount\":500,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"ff12dd1a-3b93-4536-abf2-0f8c410b3563\",\"Name\":\"(proaspete sau din compot)\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"piersici\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"f81ffce7-bc37-4a68-9c14-ad6d56b887d6\",\"Name\":\"zmeura (proaspata sau congelata)\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"cana\",\"Order\":8},{\"Id\":\"76bfa7b6-b273-40ea-8405-ada63c9b2e62\",\"Name\":\"zahar\",\"Amount\":100,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":9},{\"Id\":\"a5a69b5d-99b5-4eed-89dc-57fabae10e42\",\"Name\":\"gelatina (10g)\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"plic\",\"Order\":10},{\"Id\":\"a0237f04-c953-4659-9226-d573ad8c4860\",\"Name\":\"apa\",\"Amount\":100,\"Unit\":\"ml\",\"Order\":11},{\"Id\":\"fed2d93b-1d29-4372-a24e-c26afdcfc6c9\",\"Name\":\"Decor:\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":12},{\"Id\":\"1f4f9a2e-9087-4997-8cb6-2d4a37213a68\",\"Name\":\"3-4 piersici (proaspete sau din compot)\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":13},{\"Id\":\"51ada8bc-6d2d-47ff-9514-04f307bfb939\",\"Name\":\"zmeura (proaspata sau congelata)\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"ceasca\",\"Order\":14},{\"Id\":\"857df772-4858-4d47-aa1d-073f3d2aee1c\",\"Name\":\"gelatina \\u002B 50ml apa\",\"Amount\":5,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":15},{\"Id\":\"fcb04365-3300-4410-ba09-269620b2546c\",\"Name\":\"apa (zeama de compot)\",\"Amount\":100,\"Unit\":\"ml\",\"Order\":16},{\"Id\":\"ff2d2fd0-c350-45f6-bd08-b21223f26d17\",\"Name\":\"zahar (optional)\",\"Amount\":50,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":17}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"c44d581d-3a01-463a-b146-7731e5a0456a\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"Ingrediente blat:** * 3 oua * 90g zahar * 90g faina * 1 strop sare **Ingrediente crema:** * 500g smantana pentru frisca (30% grasime) * 500g iaurt grecesc * 2 piersici (proaspete sau din compot) * 1 cana zmeura (proaspata sau congelata) * 100g zahar * 1 plic gelatina (10g) * 100ml apa **Decor:** * 3-4 piersici (proaspete sau din compot) * 1 ceasca zmeura (proaspata sau congelata) * 5g gelatina \\u002B 50ml apa * 100ml apa (zeama de compot) * 50g zahar (optional)\"},{\"Id\":\"e4003b24-a787-4e92-a4ca-dc62ad98b20b\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Se tapeteaza o tava dreptunghiulara cu fund detasabil cu hartie de copt. Tava mea are 20/30cm.\"},{\"Id\":\"be6a1a9f-7e67-4f32-a625-7151ef5f39ba\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Se aprinde cuptorul la **180grade Celsius.**\"},{\"Id\":\"5389988f-a8c2-4c4a-8970-2e5f730c815e\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Ouale se mixeaza cu zaharul si sarea pana ce compozitia devine albicioasa si creste in volum. Faina se adauga treptat si se incorporeaza cu miscari largi de jos in sus. Compozitia se toarna in tava si se coace cca.**10-12 minute la 180grade Celsius.**\"},{\"Id\":\"5b74cf75-e5f9-4f05-b4e9-08cee5cdbfa1\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"Dupa coacere foaia de pandispan se lasa sa se raceasca.\"},{\"Id\":\"223c603a-f472-4bc1-9da1-b7906362f7f0\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"Doua piersici spalate si sterse se taie cubulete. Gelatina (10g) se pune la hidratat intr-un vas metalic mic in 100ml apa rece si se lasa cateva minute sau conform instructiunilor de pe ambalaj. Dupa hidratare gelatina se inmoaie la bain marie.Intr-un bol, smantana pentru frisca se mixeaza cu zaharul pana ce aceasta devine aerata. Frisca se amesteca cu iaurtul grecesc si apoi cu zmeura si piersicile taiate cubulete. Se adauga gelatina inmuiata si se amesteca usor cat sa se incorporeaze bine t...\"},{\"Id\":\"a8a7ab50-c90b-4f63-9293-1866b5f6ef11\",\"StepNumber\":7,\"Text\":\"Crema se toarna peste foaia de pandispan si se niveleaza cu o spatula.\"},{\"Id\":\"dde749ee-cd4f-41a8-93f9-d6de681922a8\",\"StepNumber\":8,\"Text\":\"Deasupra se decoreaza cu felii din jumatati de piersica si zmeura zdrobita. Peste aceste fructe de decor vine o pelicula subtire de jeleu ce va proteja fructele impotriva oxidarii.Daca se fooseste zeama de compot nu mai este nevoie de zahar. Gelatina se pune la hidratat si apoi se inmoaie la bain marie. Se amesteca cu zeama de compot si se distribuie peste fructe. Se poate folosi si o pensula din silicon pentru a acoperi fructele cu pelicula de gelatina.\"},{\"Id\":\"9be71f1d-1807-4b84-9647-7c658d293d3c\",\"StepNumber\":9,\"Text\":\"Daca se foloseste apa in loc de compot, atunci aceasta se va fierbe cu zaharul 1-2 minute si dupa ce s-a racorit se amesteca cu gelatina inmuiata.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2167764",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2167764"
  },
  {
    "Id": "4B021489-E200-493D-ACC7-808A4760A455",
    "Title": "Somon pe sare cu legume",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Somon_pe_sare_cu_legume.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"b6465ed1-ad23-41b6-ad64-438ae04567c6\",\"Name\":\"##### **Ingrediente necesare:\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"a1456f3e-887f-47f8-bc0a-e7cbda2d5395\",\"Name\":\"file de somon ( in functie de c\\u00E2te persoane servesc)\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"43f8aa22-6ac3-4ef3-82c3-9b718ef6c23d\",\"Name\":\"o l\\u0103m\\u00E2ie\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"0b66c4d8-7299-4a0e-93fe-ab1c08e02726\",\"Name\":\"sare grunjoas\\u0103\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"7d5f3d17-1674-47d5-b50a-ab6265f5e6cc\",\"Name\":\"ulei de m\\u0103sline\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"6118b254-b38d-4ffa-99bb-f91df4943e5f\",\"Name\":\"vinete\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"8218d851-c352-47d1-aa31-b44fd34e3ade\",\"Name\":\"zucchini\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"04042ce6-b811-4ec7-80dd-c22a569a499f\",\"Name\":\"morcovi\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":8},{\"Id\":\"6efbdf50-5674-4059-8ff1-bc52a242d9a3\",\"Name\":\"sparanghel\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":9},{\"Id\":\"5f449986-ba45-4066-b318-73bddf651e29\",\"Name\":\"ciuperci (eu am folosit g\\u0103lbiori)\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":10},{\"Id\":\"180d34f0-4b46-41ab-a5cf-f62f93ccd7fe\",\"Name\":\"c\\u0103\\u021Bei de usturoi\",\"Amount\":3,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":11},{\"Id\":\"082992f3-dc3d-46d8-abf3-fa123af6f846\",\"Name\":\"Sare si piper\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":12},{\"Id\":\"2c293f42-3477-4e62-9a05-e557833d7864\",\"Name\":\"Rozmarin proasp\\u0103t\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":13}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"14e5cb62-72e8-4754-b289-735d1d160e9a\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"##### **Ingrediente necesare:** * file de somon ( in functie de c\\u00E2te persoane servesc) * o l\\u0103m\\u00E2ie * sare grunjoas\\u0103 * ulei de m\\u0103sline * vinete * zucchini * morcovi * sparanghel * ciuperci (eu am folosit g\\u0103lbiori) * 3 c\\u0103\\u021Bei de usturoi * Sare si piper * Rozmarin proasp\\u0103t\"},{\"Id\":\"ffdcca0a-2ee7-4be6-9cb9-3889ab6da67d\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Am \\u00EEnceput prin a \\u00EEnc\\u0103lzi cuptorul la **180 de grade**.\"},{\"Id\":\"c40b6f8f-09cb-4fab-a30b-b8ff0e14a8cb\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Am tapetat o tava cu h\\u00E2rtie de copt, peste care am pus un strat gros de sare grunjoas\\u0103. Am pus fileul de somon pe acest pat de sare \\u0219i l-am dichisit cu sare, piper, ulei, felii de l\\u0103m\\u00E2ie \\u0219i crengu\\u021Be de rozmarin. L-am b\\u0103gat la cuptorul pre\\u00EEnc\\u0103lzit, aproximativ **40** de minute.\"},{\"Id\":\"092d1232-7d58-45fb-a8c0-96a486120f13\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Am t\\u0103iat legumele, unele rondele, altele in jum\\u0103t\\u0103\\u021Bi. Am umplut o oal\\u0103 micu\\u021B\\u0103, cu ap\\u0103 \\u0219i am pus morcovii la fiert. Dup\\u0103 ce am sim\\u021Bit ca s-au \\u00EEnmuiat pu\\u021Bin, am ad\\u0103ugat \\u0219i sparanghelul \\u0219i am mai l\\u0103sat totul la fiert cam 5 minute. Nu trebuie fierte mult, ci doar pu\\u021Bintel p\\u0103trunse, c\\u00E2t s\\u0103 devin\\u0103 crocante c\\u00E2nd le voi pune in tigaie.\"},{\"Id\":\"87f3d0d7-ba7a-4b9f-9452-a00b008b9d59\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"Am pus vreo 3-4 linguri de ulei de m\\u0103sline, \\u00EEntr-o tigaie, apoi am pus celelalte legume \\u0219i le-am l\\u0103sat la sotat c\\u00E2teva minute.\"},{\"Id\":\"e4673d3f-4972-444c-97b6-c3a74fde43ed\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"Dup\\u0103 ce au fost gata \\u0219i morcovii \\u0219i sparanghelul, le-am pus \\u0219i pe ele in tigaie.\"},{\"Id\":\"08674292-2e78-4ee6-af64-60dd4268760a\",\"StepNumber\":7,\"Text\":\"Am l\\u0103sat totul la sotat vreo 15-20 de minute, la foc rapid, primele 10 minute, dup\\u0103 care am redus temperatura. Legumele trebuie sa fie pu\\u021Bin pr\\u0103jite.\"},{\"Id\":\"b5292d10-c72b-4557-ba2b-74d8cff931ea\",\"StepNumber\":8,\"Text\":\"Le-am asezonat cu sare \\u0219i piper, f\\u0103r\\u0103 alte complica\\u021Bii. Totul simplu \\u0219i gustos.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2168858",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2168858"
  },
  {
    "Id": "4C29A0EE-7879-4B4C-9F3B-4C37A70D1718",
    "Title": "(Quiche) Tarta cu praz",
    "Description": "Un desert delicios care combin\u0103 savoarea unic\u0103 a ingredientelor \u00eentr-o re\u021bet\u0103 rafinat\u0103. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/(Quiche",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "Desert",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"744d4215-25c7-466e-b94a-31e1626ac8ab\",\"Name\":\"Aluat\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"f6f598bc-a890-41b0-9598-50bb424d360e\",\"Name\":\"unt\",\"Amount\":100,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"433aad80-69b7-48aa-aee8-9d3677ea6988\",\"Name\":\"faina\",\"Amount\":200,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"a888bade-b875-4abe-bed7-56fe3e22ee0f\",\"Name\":\"5-6 lg apa rece\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"6e3d0f43-1eae-4d05-9e84-22ed8f3e6264\",\"Name\":\"Umplutura\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"e462ba83-94ce-4a65-b50b-9e10aacb8903\",\"Name\":\"5-6 felii de bacon\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"aca342db-40bc-41c7-9565-8c653e609f5a\",\"Name\":\"c\\u0103tei de usturoi,\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"d6eec5dd-62d2-443b-88aa-cd1564401158\",\"Name\":\"mare sau 2 mai mici\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"praz\",\"Order\":8},{\"Id\":\"e29bb805-911d-426b-94df-db9cb6b0e810\",\"Name\":\"c\\u00E2teva fire de cimbru uscat\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":9},{\"Id\":\"5a49159c-1af7-4c98-96ba-df48cd5123c1\",\"Name\":\"grame de baby spanac\",\"Amount\":100,\"Unit\":\"de\",\"Order\":10},{\"Id\":\"15aa262a-673a-4930-925b-46272454b253\",\"Name\":\"grame de br\\u00E2nz\\u0103 Cheddar\",\"Amount\":45,\"Unit\":\"de\",\"Order\":11},{\"Id\":\"0fd9edb7-84fd-47d6-8b97-99492063af15\",\"Name\":\"ou\\u0103\",\"Amount\":3,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":12},{\"Id\":\"1a507f53-0db3-4c60-8f77-bcccc77c1c87\",\"Name\":\"de sm\\u00E2nt\\u00E2n\\u0103\",\"Amount\":3,\"Unit\":\"tbsp\",\"Order\":13},{\"Id\":\"ce08384c-686a-4678-a25f-95f8c814c251\",\"Name\":\"sare \\u015Fi piper\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":14}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"ee54be79-6356-4d8d-a356-53720c0839ca\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"Pentru alaut se amesteca ingredientele pana se optine o compozitie omogena. Se pune in folie si se da la frigider 30\\u0027.\"},{\"Id\":\"76dffb73-e9f6-43c9-b75b-0760654bf9f7\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Aluatul se scote si se intinde pe o suprafata tapetata cu faina. Se pune in forma, se inteapa cu o furculita si se da la cuptor pentru 20\\u0027. Se scoate cand e gata.\"},{\"Id\":\"72aa2dcc-a923-4860-89f7-7dd7974a0342\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Se pune baconul, usturoiul si cimbrul intr-o tigaie cu ulei. Dupa ce e calit usturoiul, se adauga si prazul peste, se da focul mic si se acopera cu capac. Se lasa pana ce prazul se inmoaie, undeva la 20\\u0027. Dupa ce prazul s-a inmuita, se adauga spanacul si se mai tine un pic pe foc.\"},{\"Id\":\"9bbecc40-ba56-44bf-845c-a12bcf0a2d72\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Intr-un bol se rade branza se adauga oula si smantana. Se pune peste compozitia din tigaie. Apoi se toarna toate peste aluat si se baga la cuptor pentru alte 15\\u0027 sau pana este copt.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-13 18:48:07.3163077",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-13 18:48:07.3163077"
  },
  {
    "Id": "4CBA8C96-E7C2-46F5-AF7F-5FE4E3E2AC23",
    "Title": "Chifle pufoase",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Chifle_pufoase.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"b9efb0af-89a8-4525-be6c-09b51ed2223f\",\"Name\":\"faina 000\",\"Amount\":880,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"4fee1b9e-bb3d-4aaf-bdae-c76e9f47d6a4\",\"Name\":\"lapte ( 400 lapte \\u002B120 apa )\",\"Amount\":520,\"Unit\":\"ml\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"9e7f0aa3-2d0e-4c8f-b6f2-68bdabad0bfa\",\"Name\":\"O lingurita de sare\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"85a238ea-1168-41ae-8e36-2b9a89c3e4df\",\"Name\":\"O lingurita de miere\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"eed45ae9-db0f-41bb-ad07-f0820784c6b1\",\"Name\":\"zahar\",\"Amount\":20,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"e98f2c48-e61b-47a5-9b53-d19c9932e671\",\"Name\":\"ulei sau unt\",\"Amount\":50,\"Unit\":\"ml\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"dcc5152b-9c9e-4b96-a4bd-baf0bf5616a5\",\"Name\":\"de drojdie\",\"Amount\":30,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"715b0343-3f87-4b1c-8abc-4acb5a1c2229\",\"Name\":\"Ou pt.uns\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":8}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"dfa7f8fc-4071-44bf-a3de-b4f2beec518a\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"880 gr faina 000 * 520 ml lapte ( 400 lapte \\u002B120 apa ) * O lingurita de sare * O lingurita de miere * 20 gr zahar * 50 ml ulei sau unt * 30gr de drojdie * Ou pt.uns\"},{\"Id\":\"36026bc4-45c4-4c12-b91e-0f4786673bfd\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"2 min / 37 / vit 1 laptele , apa si drojdia\"},{\"Id\":\"f27dcf6c-730b-4c30-ad5b-477ebc1262ae\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"10 min lasat in vas la odihnit\"},{\"Id\":\"e8eed3e7-f960-4a71-9ec1-d2c5c65fb294\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Se adauga restul de ingrediente\"},{\"Id\":\"2b9d05e4-3490-4e60-aa8f-19d05c7df5c0\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"5 min vit spic ( eu am pus 4 ) .\"},{\"Id\":\"22a45712-97a5-4568-8ba4-f8da8641bc94\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"Rezulta un aluat foarte fin si moale si nu se lipeste decat foarte putin de cutite. Se poate inlocui laptele cu lapte de soia sau altul.\"},{\"Id\":\"5d2bb083-3710-4e75-b825-7ed60da7f2aa\",\"StepNumber\":7,\"Text\":\"Se lasa aprox 25 min , pana se dubleaza aluatul dupa care se imparte si se formeaza bilute , rotunjite frumos in nana , dupa marimea dorita , cel mai simplu este sa se cantareasca , mai ales ca avem cantar .\"},{\"Id\":\"ecbb8b6b-2e80-4a4d-b673-fdff40d071dc\",\"StepNumber\":8,\"Text\":\"Se coc aprox 20 min , cuptorul incins , 10 min 250 grade \\u002B 10 200 grade , depinde si de cuptor .\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2170986",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2170986"
  },
  {
    "Id": "4E486D41-B359-460D-BCE5-CD594418FDD6",
    "Title": "Mere cremoase",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
