    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"78039dc8-9e38-4ca4-81ae-93a520de7656\",\"Name\":\"Frigarui miel**: am facut o marinada din pasta de ardei copti(ardei copti , curatati si blenduiti, tinuti in tigaie pana scade putin) , am pus cumin, usturoi facut la mojar, ghimbir pudra, menta, iaurt, ulei de masline, piper, putina zeama de lamaie ,cativa stropi, paprica, cimbru uscat,putin sos de rosii.\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"69262ff6-56ad-49fe-a584-634636204f97\",\"Name\":\"Toate amestecate cu bucatile de miel. Apoi a doua zi, am pus si legumele pt frigarui si am amestecat. Facute pe gratar (nu arse):))\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"a8b9dbd2-6994-4524-bdd6-ec33ca1a3234\",\"Name\":\"Kofta**: carne de vita tocata, amestecata cu rosie , piper, cumin,cimbru si mult patrunjel, plus o ceapa rosie taiata marunt. Totul la frigider minim o ora . Facute pe plita la gratar\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"21e8c44c-6c07-4ce1-bc5a-108a4fd135d8\",\"Name\":\"Cartofi albi, morcovi tricolori, condimentati cu piper si turmeric, la cuptor 200 grade pt 20-30 minute\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":4}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"697fa076-07c6-4d00-85b3-c08840a0a0d1\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"Frigarui miel**: am facut o marinada din pasta de ardei copti(ardei copti , curatati si blenduiti, tinuti in tigaie pana scade putin) , am pus cumin, usturoi facut la mojar, ghimbir pudra, menta, iaurt, ulei de masline, piper, putina zeama de lamaie ,cativa stropi, paprica, cimbru uscat,putin sos de rosii. Toate amestecate cu bucatile de miel. Apoi a doua zi, am pus si legumele pt frigarui si am amestecat. Facute pe gratar (nu arse):)) **Kofta**: carne de vita tocata, amestecata cu rosie , pi...\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2178049",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2178049"
  },
  {
    "Id": "52B95E14-C523-4E9D-BE8C-E657FEB959EF",
    "Title": "Bors de curcan cu taietei",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Bors_de_curcan_cu_taietei.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 1,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"96156a2f-00a9-4a37-aad2-0e9d34a75542\",\"Name\":\"o pulpa de curcan\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"609b172b-98e2-44a6-b8e9-267349915094\",\"Name\":\"3-4 morcovi\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"2c56e363-7be3-4a24-9f70-7eea588b87eb\",\"Name\":\"jumatate telina\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"78697356-6053-4a02-9183-8c69d1017647\",\"Name\":\"gulie\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"61509bc8-7353-401d-8f2c-95a3ab007901\",\"Name\":\"ceapa\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"0acdc97c-d0be-4c40-80e5-4ce8036e62fe\",\"Name\":\"pastranac/patrunjel radacina\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"0059541c-11a7-4a19-8807-288213133f58\",\"Name\":\"rosu\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"ardei\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"e7f37263-b54d-4d83-aa46-b070aaa21615\",\"Name\":\"taietei\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":8},{\"Id\":\"3ed2768b-96d3-470f-a359-3c443575a2ac\",\"Name\":\"bors dupa gust (300-500ml) fiert inainte\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":9},{\"Id\":\"b54e1f7e-22d3-4417-b900-8a1af4d7cb86\",\"Name\":\"sare, piper\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":10},{\"Id\":\"55d85ab4-050e-4ef0-bbfc-132b5de5d5cd\",\"Name\":\"mazare\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":11}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"318fa3b0-26d6-44ef-97e5-c979fbfd52b1\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"o pulpa de curcan * 3-4 morcovi * jumatate telina * 1 gulie * 1 ceapa * pastranac/patrunjel radacina * 1 ardei rosu * taietei * bors dupa gust (300-500ml) fiert inainte * sare, piper * mazare\"},{\"Id\":\"9f922c54-fbbf-4f94-b0de-1c38901fcdb3\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Se pune pulpa la fiert. Se spumuieste si dupa ce nu mai face spuma se pot adauga si legumele. Se pune borsul la fiert intre timp. Dupa ce au fiert legumele se pun taieteii si se mai lasa un pic. Apoi se adauga si borsul si se lasa sa dea un clocot. Se ia de pe fox, se potriveste de sare si piper si se adauga verdeata.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.218047",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.218047"
  },
  {
    "Id": "53CA21B3-AB11-484B-96E0-41B9AE40F033",
    "Title": "Prasadam - bile de susan negru",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Prasadam_-_bile_de_susan_negru.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"1fdb5d84-91d5-49f7-bfe8-1581b6c96cc5\",\"Name\":\"semin\\u021Be de susan negru\",\"Amount\":500,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"f8a26bfb-48bf-4cbf-9e40-64774279197f\",\"Name\":\"cardamon\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"tsp\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"7923a3ea-2568-4451-bc14-226930bd3bf8\",\"Name\":\"miere lichida\",\"Amount\":150,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":3}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"74372d9e-e0db-4da2-a242-bf659d6470f8\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"500 g semin\\u021Be de susan negru * 1 lingurita cardamon * 150 gr miere lichida\"},{\"Id\":\"086915ae-99c4-4e60-86dc-01f074277915\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Semintele se pr\\u0103jesc la cuptor la 160 grade (foc de sus \\u0219i jos), 10 - 12 minute p\\u00E2n\\u0103 sunt u\\u0219or rumenite (aten\\u021Bie: semin\\u021Bele sunt moi c\\u00E2t sunt calde ceea ce te poate \\u00EEn\\u0219ela c\\u0103 nu ar fi suficient de pr\\u0103jite; ca s\\u0103 le testezi, scoate c\\u00E2teva afar\\u0103 din cuptor \\u0219i las\\u0103-le s\\u0103 se r\\u0103ceasc\\u0103, iar dup\\u0103 c\\u00E2teva minute gust\\u0103-le, \\u00EE\\u021Bi vei da u\\u0219or seama dac\\u0103 sunt pr\\u0103jite)\"},{\"Id\":\"a9370c27-28ca-4a53-aaca-12708c3212d5\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"se adaug\\u0103 semin\\u021Bele \\u00EEn bolul Thermomix \\u0219i se macin\\u0103 10 secunde la viteza 10\"},{\"Id\":\"184d3790-e1ca-4219-bed6-1e17ccfcadd7\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"se adaug\\u0103 1 linguri\\u021B\\u0103 cardamom pudr\\u0103 \\u0219i se amestec\\u0103 5 secunde la viteza 3\"},{\"Id\":\"3fe2643e-6d2a-4f57-90b7-fe6bb5c7bb71\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"se adaug\\u0103 150 g de miere lichid\\u0103 \\u0219i se amestec\\u0103 10 sec la viteza 5 (gusta\\u021Bi \\u0219i mai ad\\u0103uga\\u021Bi miere dac\\u0103 nu vi se par suficient de dulci)\"},{\"Id\":\"40443dfc-3208-48d9-afda-f29e560533fb\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"se scoate afar\\u0103 amestecul din bol \\u0219i se formeaz\\u0103 mici bile (dac\\u0103 amestecul nu se adun\\u0103 suficient de bine, ad\\u0103uga\\u021Bi pu\\u021Bin\\u0103 ap\\u0103, at\\u00E2t c\\u00E2t s\\u0103 pute\\u021Bi forma bile, ele se vor \\u00EEnt\\u0103ri la frigider).\"},{\"Id\":\"0bacae19-8c3d-40f6-bd07-146f67be4b3d\",\"StepNumber\":7,\"Text\":\"Se p\\u0103streaza multe zile la frigider, sunt o surs\\u0103 excelent\\u0103 de calciu, proteine \\u0219i gr\\u0103simi s\\u0103n\\u0103toase \\u0219i sunt absolut delicioase\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2187723",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2187723"
  },
  {
    "Id": "5423E838-29CF-4AB0-A5B9-7FDA4BDFB247",
    "Title": "Ficat si costita cu cimbru",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/placeholder.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"875cb74a-048f-45bf-92b4-c3613a7114f2\",\"Name\":\"cartofi mici\",\"Amount\":500,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"b790fdaf-1602-4e25-9fbf-ef8d0aec202d\",\"Name\":\"ulei de masline\",\"Amount\":3,\"Unit\":\"tbsp\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"d344e3df-21de-4d7e-92a0-f459a90703c7\",\"Name\":\"ficat miel, cc 340 gr, clatit si scurs\",\"Amount\":4,\"Unit\":\"felii\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"a9587cdf-d0c0-46ad-bcd5-63f24d93dcbf\",\"Name\":\"1/4 lingurita rasa de sare\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"0b75a4c4-8951-46ae-9c42-4931f6bc801e\",\"Name\":\"piper negru proaspat macinat\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"db83d736-b1fe-4625-8855-199473e6a142\",\"Name\":\"rasa boia dulce\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"tsp\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"0007e513-a76b-400d-87f7-74364d4761b9\",\"Name\":\"unt\",\"Amount\":30,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"629f38d5-c1a8-4540-9853-b5e306304d7e\",\"Name\":\"sunca impanata neafumata, fara coaja, tocata\",\"Amount\":100,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":8},{\"Id\":\"7adc0327-610d-4fab-8c4a-c15fcfb7f2a5\",\"Name\":\"mijlocie tocata\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"ceapa\",\"Order\":9},{\"Id\":\"58dc7ecc-6fac-4c2c-8e73-157d3e84ac27\",\"Name\":\"de usturoi zdrobit\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"catel\",\"Order\":10},{\"Id\":\"a2bf82c5-3c6e-4cf5-92bb-0553e8c44062\",\"Name\":\"mare de desert taiat in bucati mari\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"mar\",\"Order\":11},{\"Id\":\"7c8c97b2-4f3a-47c4-ad3c-d208982b2758\",\"Name\":\"rosii taiate (din conserva)\",\"Amount\":400,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":12},{\"Id\":\"ee9b2a9e-42cf-4877-8e17-74e14aa58a41\",\"Name\":\"cimbru\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"ramurica\",\"Order\":13},{\"Id\":\"cb0fcc3b-49b4-487e-b6c0-ab310649db26\",\"Name\":\"sos Worcestershire\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"tbsp\",\"Order\":14},{\"Id\":\"756c93fc-639e-48de-913a-de6017ce9799\",\"Name\":\"patrunjel\",\"Amount\":3,\"Unit\":\"tbsp\",\"Order\":15}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"fb9a6dea-e53d-48b1-8b41-d95af222fdcf\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"3 linguri ulei de masline\"},{\"Id\":\"70fb6d68-2c89-4bd0-a98d-e126f0768c53\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"4 felii ficat miel, cc 340 gr, clatit si scurs\"},{\"Id\":\"df9f63d9-928e-4b72-8631-a2500b4c70cc\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"1/4 lingurita rasa de sare\"},{\"Id\":\"24427524-a018-4443-a5a4-41d4f96c8774\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"piper negru proaspat macinat\"},{\"Id\":\"b75f7d9f-a86f-43e5-9f1a-3a9221447f62\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"1 lingurita rasa boia dulce\"},{\"Id\":\"797020f6-c6ad-4fb4-b004-f9249b704835\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"100 gr sunca impanata neafumata, fara coaja, tocata\"},{\"Id\":\"c5622b1a-98b1-4d05-afe4-bbe699f52afb\",\"StepNumber\":7,\"Text\":\"1 ceapa mijlocie tocata\"},{\"Id\":\"954db635-e32e-47bd-8ab2-de0e6b734637\",\"StepNumber\":8,\"Text\":\"1 catel de usturoi zdrobit\"},{\"Id\":\"87ae2868-1852-4584-8257-df06c9379ea6\",\"StepNumber\":9,\"Text\":\"1 mar mare de desert taiat in bucati mari\"},{\"Id\":\"ce99729c-3a22-406b-aed5-be66150f8a8d\",\"StepNumber\":10,\"Text\":\"400 gr rosii taiate (din conserva)\"},{\"Id\":\"1a245ed3-a75f-473e-8bf2-a4d7080b1b4e\",\"StepNumber\":11,\"Text\":\"1 lg sos Worcestershire\"},{\"Id\":\"e3c30cf9-853d-4d9b-a9e8-0767c20830ab\",\"StepNumber\":12,\"Text\":\"1 . Se fierb cartofii 10 minute, apoi se scurg bine si se taie in doua. Se incalzesc 2 linguri de ulei intr-o tigaie mare cu fundul gros. Se prajesc cartofii pana devin aurii si se scot pe o farfurie.\"},{\"Id\":\"6bc5b36a-d9b1-43f5-9620-84171273ae69\",\"StepNumber\":13,\"Text\":\"2 . Se presara ambele parti ale feliilor de ficat cu sare, putin piper si boia. Se topeste untul in tigaie pana incepe sa sfaraie, apoi se rumeneste ficatul pe ambele parti. Se scoate ficatul pe o farfurie si se tine la rece.\"},{\"Id\":\"aef6279e-f1c7-46d4-b567-030da8a2352d\",\"StepNumber\":14,\"Text\":\"3 . Se adauga restul de ulei in tigaie si se rumenesc costita, ceapa si usturoiul. Se adauga marul si se mai prajesc 2 minute, apoi se adauga rosiile, cimbrul si sosul Worcestershire. Cand dau in clocot se face focul mic si se mai lasa sa fiarba 3-4 minute.\"},{\"Id\":\"62b573e6-a93f-4c4c-a9df-1c349de35740\",\"StepNumber\":15,\"Text\":\"4 . Se pun cartofii in sos si se aranjeaza feliile de ficat deasupra. Se incalzesc 3-4 minute cu capac. Se mai adauga piper, se presara cu patrunjel si se servesc din tigaie cu paine neagra sau alba, cu coaja crocanta.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2190077",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2190077"
  },
  {
    "Id": "55C6BCBC-F246-4BD6-90D6-76F1D07AE16A",
    "Title": "Quiche cu praz",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 rafinat\u0103 fran\u021buzeasc\u0103, elegant\u0103 \u0219i delicioas\u0103. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Quiche_cu_praz.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "Francez\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"9da568e9-aa39-4333-9812-d57bcb4d55b6\",\"Name\":\"Aluat\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"c4937b3d-e719-4da6-be66-6a05081439db\",\"Name\":\"unt\",\"Amount\":100,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"f71b0c6a-97c1-48bc-a6d2-9262a54a8148\",\"Name\":\"faina\",\"Amount\":200,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"48180165-cea7-4f73-b8de-7acb77578128\",\"Name\":\"5-6 lg apa rece\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"f0fc48f9-233b-4ce3-a360-865572dc9f19\",\"Name\":\"Umplutura\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"dbe07c26-0e99-474d-a1ad-efbfe35df188\",\"Name\":\"5-6 felii bacon\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"cf512075-3aa0-47f1-aaf8-391aea45754f\",\"Name\":\"de usturoi\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"catei\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"b30b6f90-74f3-419a-99f9-479c37503c2b\",\"Name\":\"partea alba\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"praz\",\"Order\":8},{\"Id\":\"cc2cd6a4-bdbc-424e-8563-a3c8fecdb442\",\"Name\":\"cimbru\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":9},{\"Id\":\"ff84bbcb-7050-4879-9e0f-e44db63e6d62\",\"Name\":\"baby spanac\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":10},{\"Id\":\"02dd3d44-1e1a-4e5d-b372-844f7f6b9994\",\"Name\":\"branza chedar\",\"Amount\":45,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":11},{\"Id\":\"68bddf84-5205-411f-839a-adb89241fbca\",\"Name\":\"oua\",\"Amount\":3,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":12},{\"Id\":\"63d480c4-8c21-4486-be4e-61216df69acd\",\"Name\":\"smantana\",\"Amount\":3,\"Unit\":\"tbsp\",\"Order\":13}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"a790d3ab-c6d6-43c9-9f09-03855a3977c1\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"Aluat * 100gr unt * 200gr faina * 5-6 lg apa rece Umplutura * 5-6 felii bacon * 2 catei de usturoi * 1 praz partea alba * cimbru * baby spanac * 45gr branza chedar * 3 oua * 3 lg smantana\"},{\"Id\":\"7306beea-25e5-40a3-98b8-5644dc89f60a\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Aluatul se framanta si se da la rece pentru 30 de minute. Intre timp se pregateste umplutura. Se caleste baconul, apoi e adauga prazul. Intr-un castron sa da pe razatoare branza si se amesteca cu ouale si smantana.\"},{\"Id\":\"44e992bf-d3ba-499c-b84e-e3bf5dfc9c47\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Se intinde aluatul si de pune in forma, se inteapa si se baga la cuptor la 180 grade pentru 20 de minute.\"},{\"Id\":\"0a77e8aa-ccca-42ff-ac19-812f1c0eb808\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Umplutura se amesteca bine, se condimenteaza, iar cand foaia de tarta este gata se scoate si se toarna peste. Se baga inapoi la cuptor pentru 15-30 de minute, in functie de cat de multa compozitie s-a facut (se verifica sa se coaca)\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2191244",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2191244"
  },
  {
    "Id": "562F8167-BC86-4A57-83DE-E4BA60DCB85F",
    "Title": "Biscuiti 100",
    "Description": "Un desert delicios care combin\u0103 savoarea unic\u0103 a ingredientelor \u00eentr-o re\u021bet\u0103 rafinat\u0103. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Biscuiti_100.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 1,
    "CuisineType": "Desert",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"2a9dc4fd-f430-4d1a-9653-abeed8b49648\",\"Name\":\"faina\",\"Amount\":100,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"e7efacb0-b7a7-4d7b-8c80-8615e213c403\",\"Name\":\"dat pe razatoare\",\"Amount\":100,\"Unit\":\"unt\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"7bcc9fd3-c6cc-46a4-b1a5-1f49c95f408e\",\"Name\":\"branza\",\"Amount\":100,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"34c9ea46-6e6c-464c-9d17-d4d23f6b5fd9\",\"Name\":\"sare - optional\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"499091a8-46a7-4338-9427-6c7061636f20\",\"Name\":\"pentru uns deasupra\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"ou\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"63d1d131-9e27-43df-bbe9-01e0c699a284\",\"Name\":\"chimen, susan, mac - optional\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":6}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"41c1c9fb-d137-4498-8fd3-daa702a951c1\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"100 faina * 100 unt dat pe razatoare * 100 branza * sare - optional * 1 ou pentru uns deasupra * chimen, susan, mac - optional\"},{\"Id\":\"d0dd63f7-b39a-4aa5-848b-2cffe3ec5aef\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Se formeaza un aluat din unt, faina si branza. Se da la rece macar 1 ora.\"},{\"Id\":\"29ccae58-4042-41b1-8f44-dfed05af2059\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Se iscoate si se intinde o foaie si se decupeaza.\"},{\"Id\":\"66621cf2-4995-4b31-954d-a2f959f37bbe\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Se ung cu ou si se presara seminte\"},{\"Id\":\"0aff366c-bc0b-4b84-899f-b7b3c257ce74\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"Se dau la cuptor la 180 grade pentru aproximativ 20-25 min, pana se rumenesc.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2194226",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2194226"
  },
  {
    "Id": "57637E4B-15D6-402A-A034-EBAC5D79BB23",
    "Title": "Supa crema de pere, mere si cartofi",
    "Description": "O sup\u0103 aromat\u0103 \u0219i reconfortant\u0103, perfect\u0103 pentru orice mas\u0103. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Supa_crema_de_pere,_mere_si_cartofi.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "Sup\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"ba6b2791-b980-4fcc-b02c-662b3d9f023b\",\"Name\":\"partea alb\\u0103 de la 2 fire de praz\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"f4f10a6a-e9ce-4f23-8802-0d11631112d6\",\"Name\":\"pere cu pulpa ferm\\u0103\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"kg\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"69727641-1b3a-4408-bafb-70d5134cb257\",\"Name\":\"mere cu pulpa ferm\\u0103\",\"Amount\":200,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"72c507e7-303c-4c37-9b09-d52da0157c5f\",\"Name\":\"unt\",\"Amount\":50,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"63cb79e3-e09c-402b-8f10-7e5566b26550\",\"Name\":\"sup\\u0103 concentrat\\u0103 de pui sau de legume (ori 2 p\\u0103r\\u0163i sup\\u0103 \\u015Fi 1 parte ap\\u0103)\",\"Amount\":1.5,\"Unit\":\"l\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"08229c9a-3dfb-4224-8ca1-b3356f285bd8\",\"Name\":\"cartofi\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"dd5e4d8c-bbbc-41cc-abda-cacb35fa2c4e\",\"Name\":\"morcov\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"f3ddbdc9-da64-48de-a133-7b0563cf531d\",\"Name\":\"de scor\\u0163i\\u015Foar\\u0103\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"baton\",\"Order\":8},{\"Id\":\"cc1051c1-d125-42dc-90b8-7a50de1a1a16\",\"Name\":\"1/2 linguri\\u0163\\u0103 ghimbir\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":9},{\"Id\":\"c997d860-b588-4c89-b0f4-b265784428fa\",\"Name\":\"semin\\u0163ele proasp\\u0103t m\\u0103cinate de la 3-4 p\\u0103st\\u0103i de cardamom\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":10},{\"Id\":\"cb3ea9c7-47f4-4ffd-a051-3b2a5ca00e4c\",\"Name\":\"un praf de nuc\\u015Foar\\u0103 ras\\u0103\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":11},{\"Id\":\"04d21358-585d-4667-8577-a4acd7c41276\",\"Name\":\"sare \\u015Fi piper alb proasp\\u0103t m\\u0103cinat\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":12},{\"Id\":\"02c72f7f-f68d-4216-a474-df32956399de\",\"Name\":\"cr\\u00E8me fra\\u00EEche sau sm\\u0203nt\\u0203n\\u0103 fermentat\\u0103 gras\\u0103\",\"Amount\":200,\"Unit\":\"ml\",\"Order\":13},{\"Id\":\"2f5a818e-9998-4b9f-9cbe-d03e2afc7269\",\"Name\":\"c\\u0203teva frunze de ment\\u0103 proasp\\u0103t\\u0103\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":14}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"35a1dee5-600e-4b37-836c-5883624e3686\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"Ingrediente: * partea alb\\u0103 de la 2 fire de praz * 1 kg pere cu pulpa ferm\\u0103 * 200 g mere cu pulpa ferm\\u0103 * 50 g unt * 1,5 l sup\\u0103 concentrat\\u0103 de pui sau de legume (ori 2 p\\u0103r\\u0163i sup\\u0103 \\u015Fi 1 parte ap\\u0103) * 2 cartofi * 1 morcov * 1 baton de scor\\u0163i\\u015Foar\\u0103 * 1/2 linguri\\u0163\\u0103 ghimbir * semin\\u0163ele proasp\\u0103t m\\u0103cinate de la 3-4 p\\u0103st\\u0103i de cardamom * un praf de nuc\\u015Foar\\u0103 ras\\u0103 * sare \\u015Fi piper alb proasp\\u0103t m\\u0103cinat * 200 ml cr\\u00E8me fra\\u00EEche sau sm\\u0203nt\\u0203n\\u0103 fermentat\\u0103 gras\\u0103 * c\\u0203teva frunze de ment\\u0103 proasp\\u0103t\\u0103\"},{\"Id\":\"d01be545-6636-4e39-9ed0-23553336b96a\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Se lasa un mar si o para la o parte pentru decor. Se curata fructele si legumele si se taie in cuburi potrivite. Prazul se taie rondele si sa caleste in jumatate din unt. Apoi se adauga fructele si se calesc 5 minute la foc mediu. Peste se toarna supa si imediat dupa cuburile de cartofi si morcovi.\"},{\"Id\":\"ac5a90d4-043f-468d-94f5-358269842b21\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Se adauga batonul de scortisoara, mirodeniile macinate, sare dupa gust si se lasa sa fiarba vreo jumatate de ora.\"},{\"Id\":\"69d70ea8-ec9d-4c19-b795-fada71da678c\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Dupa ce sunt gata, se scoate batonul, se adauga smantana si se piseaza cu un blender.\"},{\"Id\":\"cc10f9e2-0c3e-4f72-9d1b-2eecda23d073\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"Para si marul se taie felii si se calesc intr-o tigaie in restul de unt. Dupa ce s-au rumenit se scot si se lasa la scurs pe un prosop absorbant.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2195285",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2195285"
  },
  {
    "Id": "5939D628-1C9A-458E-9413-197AE552FC0A",
    "Title": "Creveti cu paste",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Creveti_cu_paste.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"c5f2d94c-f347-4aa0-8ba4-670d650bb982\",\"Name\":\"creve\\u021Bi cruzi, cur\\u0103\\u021Ba\\u021Bi (king prawns folosesc)\",\"Amount\":500,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"a0091029-cdc6-40eb-ac15-a07f9d7271d4\",\"Name\":\"macaroane (sau alt tip de paste)\",\"Amount\":500,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"b408e3c7-bff0-4ab0-a148-f589081a8106\",\"Name\":\"unt 80%\",\"Amount\":150,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"51c7e1ae-6c5c-4cc3-966b-041b73f77fdb\",\"Name\":\"ulei de m\\u0103sline extravirgin\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"tbsp\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"a3be9d04-f381-4aa1-9cf7-12a3e2457c76\",\"Name\":\"c\\u0103\\u021Bei mari mari de usturoi pisate\",\"Amount\":12,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"031fda8a-786a-4e67-8843-21e49680b469\",\"Name\":\"Zeama \\u0219i coaja la 1 l\\u0103m\\u00E2ie mica netratata\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"84a7bd94-69af-41b1-a759-9234f92758b3\",\"Name\":\"Frunze verzi de salvie (op\\u021Bional)\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"2340d1b5-0e02-4d5b-8956-8c7e0f4a9a2b\",\"Name\":\"Piper alb\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":8},{\"Id\":\"a340a2c0-6c52-4739-8e22-c425a66f06fb\",\"Name\":\"Parmezan ras\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":9}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"943cf1c6-9803-461a-b6de-3b1d82cc6743\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"500g creve\\u021Bi cruzi, cur\\u0103\\u021Ba\\u021Bi (king prawns folosesc) 500g macaroane (sau alt tip de paste) 150g unt 80% 1 lg ulei de m\\u0103sline extravirgin 12 c\\u0103\\u021Bei mari mari de usturoi pisate Zeama \\u0219i coaja la 1 l\\u0103m\\u00E2ie mica netratata Frunze verzi de salvie (op\\u021Bional) Piper alb Parmezan ras\"},{\"Id\":\"d0abcce5-03e9-4ff7-a1af-9747de866d6c\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Se pune apa fiert pt paste \\u0219i \\u00EEntre timp preg\\u0103ti\\u021Bi sosul.\"},{\"Id\":\"d69e1b9a-090d-4584-9bad-2e7d39cd3341\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"\\u00CEntr-o oala antiaderenta se pune la topit untul \\u00EEmpreun\\u0103 cu uleiul de m\\u0103sline. Se adaug\\u0103 usturoiul, piperul alb, frunzele de salvie \\u0219i se soteaz\\u0103 usturoiul pt 2-3 minute pe foc mic \\u0219i amestec\\u00E2nd mereu s\\u0103 nu se ard\\u0103.\"},{\"Id\":\"4ab46d98-b0eb-4968-b80f-2cf8bbcb9c29\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Se adaug\\u0103 creve\\u021Bii dezghe\\u021Ba\\u021Bi, zeama \\u0219i coaja de l\\u0103m\\u00E2ie \\u0219i aprox 50ml din apa in care fierb pastele. Se las\\u0103 s\\u0103 clocoteasc\\u0103 pt 5-6 minute pe foc mediu.\"},{\"Id\":\"115fe7b2-6830-43b7-b832-9b54604bfac6\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"C\\u00E2nd pastele sunt al dente se strecoar\\u0103 \\u0219i se adaug\\u0103 \\u00EEn oala peste sos \\u00EEmpreun\\u0103 cu parmezanul ras \\u0219i se amestec\\u0103 bine.\"},{\"Id\":\"e6514b93-11a8-4323-9806-3f057ae242e7\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"PS: daca aveam niste p\\u0103trunjel verde l-a\\u0219 fi ad\\u0103ugat \\u00EEn sos \\u00EEnainte s\\u0103 adaug pastele.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2196286",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2196286"
  },
  {
    "Id": "5DD344C7-6A18-4847-BEF5-CB77236F033D",
    "Title": "Hummus cu rosii coapte",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Hummus_cu_rosii_coapte.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"544af922-ffaa-4c3d-95fe-14a30233de37\",\"Name\":\"naut\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"78efe06d-e598-4094-8a7b-78ca5e99cccf\",\"Name\":\"1/3 tahini\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"158f6821-6dc6-4d65-aa68-3916bbf6ef89\",\"Name\":\"1/4 ulei de masline\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"b44bb72e-ba2a-4591-805e-f921bccd5150\",\"Name\":\"1/4 iaurt grecesc\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"b4739fdc-dbe8-41fb-8c98-20e3537aa74b\",\"Name\":\"1/4 apa\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"a15f64a3-7ca8-46a7-925f-2ef26929ee57\",\"Name\":\"cumin, sare\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"2b67f0fc-5da2-409e-9ca3-ee92b2b6cef8\",\"Name\":\"Rosii coapte:\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"bbc026d0-6b20-45d6-867e-004bc8b2dcf7\",\"Name\":\"rosii\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":8},{\"Id\":\"8751c902-6773-48ab-8902-ced5d3c63a6a\",\"Name\":\"masline kalamata\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":9},{\"Id\":\"88235df6-3290-44ae-86ca-57c537582457\",\"Name\":\"naut\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":10},{\"Id\":\"4ee4a409-3789-4e20-bb20-4aa09219e9e9\",\"Name\":\"feta\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":11},{\"Id\":\"53dc7c2a-41b3-4711-b53d-83eb984f17ec\",\"Name\":\"ceapa rosie\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":12},{\"Id\":\"370487b9-0eb9-486d-bd27-6ab08c7ea037\",\"Name\":\"cumin, suc de lamaie, ulei de masline, sare\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":13},{\"Id\":\"fbb1d918-38d8-4ab4-8a8e-272d6273eafd\",\"Name\":\"Extra:\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":14},{\"Id\":\"24e756c5-eba7-487d-a3a3-eebdaf19e8da\",\"Name\":\"castravete\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":15},{\"Id\":\"113ac811-6ae6-46cd-bc10-ded57f930f6d\",\"Name\":\"feta\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":16}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"1c22903c-8753-4ed5-b07d-1ba4dc17826f\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"naut * 1/3 tahini * 1/4 ulei de masline * 1/4 iaurt grecesc * 1/4 apa * cumin, sare Rosii coapte: * rosii * masline kalamata * naut * feta * ceapa rosie * cumin, suc de lamaie, ulei de masline, sare Extra: * castravete * feta\"},{\"Id\":\"08f578cd-3c8f-4bda-ae80-302917d7c0a7\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Se pun toate ingredientele in mixer si se mixeaza pana se obtine o pasta. Se mai poate adauga apa daca e prea gros, pana la obtinerea consistentei dorite\"},{\"Id\":\"c432984a-9f1e-4c8c-ab5a-d62318a2779a\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Separat se pun rosiile taiate in jumatati, maslinele, feta, nautul si ceapa rosie, se condimenteaza si se dau la cuptor la 200 C pentru 15-20 min.\"},{\"Id\":\"512940b0-0526-4bc2-ab2e-a8fc8c59d149\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Se adauga castravete taiat bucati si extra feta.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2198784",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2198784"
  },
  {
    "Id": "5FC51D14-E28B-47DF-8FF8-35E9CF25C437",
