    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Ciocolata_de_casa.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"5bb12688-c04c-435f-82aa-d50097fdd4f0\",\"Name\":\"de unt cu 82% grasime\",\"Amount\":100,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"f068dac0-932a-45ff-a3dc-2a3c5ba6068c\",\"Name\":\"apa\",\"Amount\":100,\"Unit\":\"ml\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"f550495a-83d2-4bbb-8aa9-16b8e3b7c6d9\",\"Name\":\"zahar\",\"Amount\":150,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"0fe813e9-9037-478c-a93d-fd995c3d8963\",\"Name\":\"lapte praf\",\"Amount\":350,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"c4f6be3b-5a03-47d5-8f2e-ac676f047d8d\",\"Name\":\"cacao\",\"Amount\":40,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"9eef83aa-496a-4f6f-983e-9daa43b31042\",\"Name\":\"o lingura de extract de vanilie\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"2e363a66-97fc-4faf-9c62-d421ab96d86d\",\"Name\":\"nuci, alune de padure, stafide\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":7}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"61f170ed-0784-4bb5-8f75-6bec1a3cf180\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"100 gr de unt cu 82% grasime * 100 ml apa * 150 gr zahar * 350 gr lapte praf * 40 gr cacao * o lingura de extract de vanilie * nuci, alune de padure, stafide\"},{\"Id\":\"18719247-eb51-4cd8-9bda-d701b8749f15\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"1. Pune apa, zaharul si untul la fiert. Dupa 5-7 minute, cand dau in clocot si zaharul e topit, opreste focul, adauga extractul de vanilie si lasa lichidul sa ajunga la temperatura camerei. Untul are tendinta de a se intari deasupra, mai amesteca din cand in cand, pentru a-l omogeniza.\"},{\"Id\":\"4ef83eca-0098-4eb0-b036-6931468b5287\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"2. Cerne laptele praf impreuna cu cacaoa intr-un castron.\"},{\"Id\":\"8156b313-f748-46ae-8210-0ecd1f919b4e\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"3. Cand lichidul s-a racit, toarna-l treptat peste ingredientele solide. Amesteca bine, dupa fiecare portie de lichid adaugata.\"},{\"Id\":\"9520c7ca-9b14-4415-89e2-4b956b83e7ba\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"4. Cand compozitia s-a legat si are o textura omogena, dar inca moale si lucioasa, adauga nucile si stafidele.\"},{\"Id\":\"2ed7db57-997f-45a3-8e79-de5608054689\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"5. Unge o bucata de folie alimentara cu unt si toarna ciocolata in mijloc. Da-i o forma de baton, strange bine folia la capete si las-o la racit in frigider, minim 4-5 ore.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.220098",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.220098"
  },
  {
    "Id": "6353DE46-D6F5-4103-8659-89B66C546FA2",
    "Title": "Painici crocante",
    "Description": "Un mic dejun hr\u0103nitor \u0219i s\u0103n\u0103tos, ideal pentru a \u00eencepe ziua. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Painici_crocante.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "Mic Dejun",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"731c517e-7630-4bac-b404-fbcec72c12fd\",\"Name\":\"f\\u0103ina\",\"Amount\":600,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"a31ef8c4-bdcd-47ec-aa32-ee1293526c03\",\"Name\":\"ap\\u0103\",\"Amount\":340,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"be631efb-7ad3-4ce3-ab24-5188281192aa\",\"Name\":\"drojdie proasp\\u0103ta\",\"Amount\":20,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"24fb4743-5f50-4ac0-9170-9fceaa4b1e06\",\"Name\":\"linguri\\u021Be rase de sare\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":4}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"8ec2a637-987a-4808-b814-7bfe2116d996\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"600g f\\u0103ina 340g ap\\u0103 20g drojdie proasp\\u0103ta 2 linguri\\u021Be rase de sare\"},{\"Id\":\"12c98ce3-8037-4d57-8b70-ea1768fb3b88\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Punem \\u00EEn bol apa \\u0219i drojdia pentru 2 min./37 grade/vit. 2.\"},{\"Id\":\"46dc7d02-5030-4438-be66-d13b69518b9b\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Ad\\u0103ug\\u0103m f\\u0103ina 2 min spic\"},{\"Id\":\"85e630fc-6071-4526-aef4-7ac9838e1971\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Punem aluatul la dospit intr-un vas acoperit la loc cald sau \\u00EEn cuptorul \\u00EEnchis cu lumina de la cuptor aprins\\u0103 pentru o or\\u0103 p\\u00E2na se dubleaz\\u0103.\"},{\"Id\":\"bd825796-730a-468f-bc95-938c7c2ec259\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"Se \\u00EEmparte aluatul \\u00EEn 3 buc\\u0103\\u021Bi. Intr-o tav\\u0103 acoperit\\u0103 cu h\\u00E2rtie de copt se pun la crescut pentru circa o ora, p\\u00E2n\\u0103 se dubleaz\\u0103 \\u00EEn volum.\"},{\"Id\":\"fda6acd5-411d-4239-8ae8-fa65b9658a67\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"Dup\\u0103 ce au crescut se fac 2 t\\u0103ieturi \\u00EEn p\\u00E2ine nu prea ad\\u00E2nci si se pulverizeaz\\u0103 cu f\\u0103in\\u0103 deasupra.\"},{\"Id\":\"82623239-9e46-43e6-999f-2c6a65cc43ff\",\"StepNumber\":7,\"Text\":\"Se bag\\u0103 tava \\u00EEn cuptorul pre\\u00EEnc\\u0103lzit:\"},{\"Id\":\"7efb418c-68c2-4dab-babb-77bab8784ccd\",\"StepNumber\":8,\"Text\":\"dac\\u0103 e ventilat la 250 grade pentru circa 20 de min.(depinde de cuptor) , important pune\\u021Bi intr-un vas pe fundul cuptorului o can\\u0103 de ap\\u0103, ajut\\u0103 la coacerea p\\u00E2inii \\u00EEn mod uniform \\u0219i sa devina crocant\\u0103.\"},{\"Id\":\"6c926c9e-c75f-4400-a416-ba0fafbd1ea4\",\"StepNumber\":9,\"Text\":\"dac\\u0103 cuptorul e static atunci pune\\u021Bi la 230 grade pentru 10 min. cu vasul de ap\\u0103 pe fundul cuptorului dup\\u0103 care scoate\\u021Bi vasul cu ap\\u0103 \\u0219i sc\\u0103de\\u021Bi temperatura cuptorului la 200 grade pentru circa 20-30 min.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2203731",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2203731"
  },
  {
    "Id": "65BBEEF0-68A1-438E-99ED-114AF4A8EB8F",
    "Title": "Mamaliga cremoasa cu legume",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 tradi\u021bional\u0103 rom\u00e2neasc\u0103, preg\u0103tit\u0103 dup\u0103 re\u021beta clasic\u0103. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Mamaliga_cremoasa_cu_legume.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "Rom\u00e2neasc\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"6f2aa831-fd15-437f-8f51-a16b9bc1f487\",\"Name\":\"Un p\\u0103st\\u00E2rnac\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"7c97c2af-296b-4afe-a14c-c76f01d4b552\",\"Name\":\"medii\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"sfecle\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"250c1029-277d-4560-a82e-20c21040d9c7\",\"Name\":\"dulce\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"cartof\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"13c4f453-3ce2-483c-b73b-1dd629805eff\",\"Name\":\"ceap\\u0103 ro\\u0219ie\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"96cd74d1-a576-4dfd-8797-c08531eee794\",\"Name\":\"potrivi\\u021Bi\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"morcovi\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"0ad4f35e-5f4d-4d9d-98d1-fb23e55eac64\",\"Name\":\"ulei de m\\u0103sline\",\"Amount\":50,\"Unit\":\"ml\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"1d84b856-03f9-4bc8-84a4-df63fa52bda8\",\"Name\":\"lingur\\u0103 jum\\u0103tate de o\\u021Bet de cidru de mere sau o\\u021Bet balsamic\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"8c199936-76fd-4d33-95ca-c5ccfc13f09e\",\"Name\":\"Sare, piper\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":8},{\"Id\":\"795ff4cc-0f63-471f-9015-711606ead4d3\",\"Name\":\"c\\u0103\\u021Bel de usturoi\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":9},{\"Id\":\"a2e2c45d-d486-4c26-89af-54b0e77a9655\",\"Name\":\"Condimente dup\\u0103 plac, eu am folosit cimbru, salvie \\u0219i rozmarin\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":10},{\"Id\":\"478b81bf-924e-46d5-a722-a973fb49b114\",\"Name\":\"m\\u0103lai\",\"Amount\":100,\"Unit\":\"grame\",\"Order\":11},{\"Id\":\"4c32aede-c12d-4d23-8b0c-8d9ba570a622\",\"Name\":\"ap\\u0103\",\"Amount\":200,\"Unit\":\"ml\",\"Order\":12},{\"Id\":\"23fbafce-42a5-4c31-8033-0665b8d15f1e\",\"Name\":\"lapte\",\"Amount\":200,\"Unit\":\"ml\",\"Order\":13},{\"Id\":\"2ea06d73-1ba7-4ae8-b00f-93cbc3c96d73\",\"Name\":\"br\\u00E2nz\\u0103 de capr\\u0103\",\"Amount\":50,\"Unit\":\"grame\",\"Order\":14},{\"Id\":\"c6a441b0-90dd-4289-9dda-6b6bde76864a\",\"Name\":\"de unt\",\"Amount\":10,\"Unit\":\"grame\",\"Order\":15}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"f8a9a094-4e66-40b1-8939-fc02b8caa717\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"Un p\\u0103st\\u00E2rnac * 2 sfecle medii * 1 cartof dulce * 1 ceap\\u0103 ro\\u0219ie * 2 morcovi potrivi\\u021Bi * 50 ml ulei de m\\u0103sline * 1 lingur\\u0103 jum\\u0103tate de o\\u021Bet de cidru de mere sau o\\u021Bet balsamic * Sare, piper * 1 c\\u0103\\u021Bel de usturoi * Condimente dup\\u0103 plac, eu am folosit cimbru, salvie \\u0219i rozmarin * 100 grame m\\u0103lai * 200 ml ap\\u0103 * 200 ml lapte * 50 grame br\\u00E2nz\\u0103 de capr\\u0103 * 10 grame de unt\"},{\"Id\":\"7791fe49-a572-4fc6-a3bf-5d665b49307d\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"\\u00CEn primul r\\u00E2nd am pornit cuptorul, la 190 grade C. Apoi m-am apucat de preg\\u0103tirea condimentelor pentru legume. \\u00CEntr-un castron \\u00EEnc\\u0103p\\u0103tor, am pus uleiul, o\\u021Betul, usturoiul pisat, condimentele, sare \\u0219i piper \\u0219i am amestecat bine.\"},{\"Id\":\"9d5f3b41-a917-40d9-8ccd-314c13e2668a\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Apoi am preg\\u0103tit legumele. Le-am cur\\u0103\\u021Bat \\u0219i le-am t\\u0103iat dup\\u0103 propriul plac. Cartoful dulce l-am t\\u0103iat cuburi, morcovul \\u0219i p\\u0103st\\u00E2rnacul l-am t\\u0103iat pe diagonal\\u0103 \\u0219i apoi pe jum\\u0103tate, ceapa am taiat-o felii \\u0219i sfecla in felii sub\\u021Biri.\"},{\"Id\":\"d824088c-445c-40f8-a505-cf01aea78d6e\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Legumele le-am pus peste condimente \\u0219i le-am amestecat bine. Apoi \\u00EEntr-o tav\\u0103 de cuptor, am pus o h\\u00E2rtie pentru copt, \\u0219i am pus legumele \\u00EEntr-un singur strat, astfel \\u00EEnc\\u00E2t s\\u0103 se coac\\u0103 toate la fel. Le-am pus la cuptor, pentru 40 de minute.\"},{\"Id\":\"a6bff423-bbac-4a15-8a27-588d117a7aab\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"C\\u00E2nd legumele mai aveau 15 minute de stat la cuptor, m-am apucat de m\\u0103m\\u0103lig\\u0103. Pe foc am pus amestecul de ap\\u0103 \\u0219i lapte (se poate \\u0219i f\\u0103r\\u0103 lapte desigur, sau cu sup\\u0103 de pui, sau de legume). Am pus \\u0219i un pic de sare \\u0219i am a\\u0219teptat s\\u0103 fiarb\\u0103. Dup\\u0103 ce a \\u00EEnceput s\\u0103 fiarb\\u0103, am ag\\u0103ugat m\\u0103laiul \\u00EEn ploaie \\u0219i am amestecat cu telul continuu. Am l\\u0103sat s\\u0103 fiarb\\u0103 p\\u00E2n\\u0103 a fost gata, apoi am luat-o de pe foc, \\u0219i am ad\\u0103ugat untul \\u0219i br\\u00E2nza de capr\\u0103.\"},{\"Id\":\"055ac34e-b13e-4568-8f7c-ff987ab8421c\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"Peste m\\u0103m\\u0103liga fierbinte pe care am pus-o pe farfurie, am pus legumele fierbin\\u021Bi direct din cuptor, iar pe deasupra am servit cu pesto verde \\u0219i ro\\u0219u, depinde de care v\\u0103 place mai mult. Se potrive\\u0219te foarte bine cu am\\u00E2ndou\\u0103. Delicios. Poft\\u0103 buna!\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2204905",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2204905"
  },
  {
    "Id": "6A427F73-4C87-4922-BE6E-117279E0940D",
    "Title": "Somon cremos toscan cu unt si usturoi",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Somon_cremos_toscan_cu_unt_si_usturoi.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 1,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"19deb64d-52f1-4765-b0bc-1cb99fd378f1\",\"Name\":\"file somon congelat (decongelat si lasat putin la temperatura camerei)\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"69bb2bdf-d4d9-4b0e-94f1-8438679bcc1e\",\"Name\":\"spanac\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"cub\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"2f1ed939-71c9-4d4e-a67b-17d3415a71e7\",\"Name\":\"Usturoi cat cuprinde\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"a223c5b5-ff01-48c3-b5f3-f74984a8fc2c\",\"Name\":\"vin alb\",\"Amount\":100,\"Unit\":\"ml\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"a2a3e516-651d-4aa4-9df8-a3acc635f466\",\"Name\":\"5-6 rosii cherry\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"7e3babbb-6ec6-4e5c-aa69-ae17a81f7838\",\"Name\":\"unt\",\"Amount\":20,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"7efc141f-1b7a-48b2-998d-45f5c93e7406\",\"Name\":\"smantana\",\"Amount\":100,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"df9f517f-64e6-42a4-878d-1b345f870851\",\"Name\":\"Sare, piper si fulgi de chilli\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":8}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"7ebc8e63-43ac-4c37-8e93-0467412804f4\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"2 buc file somon congelat (decongelat si lasat putin la temperatura camerei) 1 cub spanac Usturoi cat cuprinde 100 ml vin alb 5-6 rosii cherry 20 gr unt 100 gr smantana Sare, piper si fulgi de chilli\"},{\"Id\":\"abd9a47e-ac19-4171-b1f6-41fca2f71a4f\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Pestele se trage la tigaie, pana se obtine o crusta. In aceeasi tigaie se aseaza usturoiul zdrobit pana se rumeneste, apoi se adauga rosiile felii si spanacul dezghetat.\"},{\"Id\":\"b0050fbe-aeb0-4c60-b3b9-5b482ebb51d4\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Vinul, de data aceasta in preparat vine sa completeze perfect usturoiul, se mai lasa 1-2 min pe foc, apoi se adauga smantana. Dupa inca 3 min se adauga pestele, se da la foc mic pentru 5 min, se adauga marar si fulgi de chili\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2205914",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2205914"
  },
  {
    "Id": "6A537C65-32A7-4883-BF13-FBBFB3F47355",
    "Title": "Dovlecei cu ricotta in sos de rosii si ciuperci",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Dovlecei_cu_ricotta_in_sos_de_rosii_si_ciuperci.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"7a540ddb-23f4-4315-8a13-718bdca630cd\",\"Name\":\"dovlecei feliati cu mandolina\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"e9fed4f8-9d92-4abd-901a-3709fa2f28a1\",\"Name\":\"ricotta\",\"Amount\":250,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"b096d1ce-eadb-4a81-9187-458d0fcd2747\",\"Name\":\"ou\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"5481a04c-5f91-4e71-aeb6-7391fd1f1b00\",\"Name\":\"aprox 300 branza rasa la alegere (mozarella\\u002Bemental)\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"a49739b4-aa67-4242-8102-e773e6c2cd28\",\"Name\":\"patrunjel verde\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"1ed2c5ba-1651-4bff-853c-eb4a39139893\",\"Name\":\"500-600 pasta de rosii\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"48ed0f9f-255a-4655-96f9-9a61ab96d158\",\"Name\":\"ardei copt\",\"Amount\":100,\"Unit\":\"pasta\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"41be80d8-6023-4af7-a122-2920e985e1bf\",\"Name\":\"ceapa\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":8},{\"Id\":\"46b36f84-b789-4746-aa93-10ee9f710f73\",\"Name\":\"usturoi\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":9},{\"Id\":\"e41c343b-3367-4645-81f6-ea41d6a3767a\",\"Name\":\"5-6 ciuperci champinion brune\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":10},{\"Id\":\"76524f10-e840-473e-969c-9a35ab674afa\",\"Name\":\"busuioc uscat\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":11},{\"Id\":\"48ebb723-72df-4225-b579-a8d82547da1c\",\"Name\":\"piper\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":12}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"195ec316-0ceb-4bec-96b4-4f108fd35014\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"dovlecei feliati cu mandolina * 250 ricotta * 1 ou * aprox 300 branza rasa la alegere (mozarella\\u002Bemental) * patrunjel verde * 500-600 pasta de rosii * 100 pasta ardei copt * 1 ceapa * usturoi * 5-6 ciuperci champinion brune * busuioc uscat * piper\"},{\"Id\":\"ecb4bef8-7ce8-4019-b611-dc46de6d1985\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Se soteaza ceapa cu ciupercile pana se evapora toata apa. Se adauga usturoiul si se mai soateaza 1 min.\"},{\"Id\":\"4d0e69e2-0a95-41aa-8cf5-15b58fe94896\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Se toarna pasta de rosii, pasta de ardei, busuioc, piper si se lasa la fiert 20-30 min pana se ingroasa sosoul\"},{\"Id\":\"5bf8055d-5fbf-411c-9ca9-826c988e068a\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Se toarna sosul intr-o tava.\"},{\"Id\":\"de95187c-355d-4924-a09a-e99939b221d8\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"In feliile de dovlecei se pune un pic de umplutura, se ruleaza si se pun in sos.\"},{\"Id\":\"fc3e0c77-4fa9-4458-8a49-4815a02cb898\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"Se da la cuptor 180-200 pentru 20-30 min.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2206969",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2206969"
  },
  {
    "Id": "6B5EB36B-7E71-475A-9C48-5E51CFCF70C8",
    "Title": "Clafoutis de banane",
    "Description": "Un desert delicios care combin\u0103 savoarea unic\u0103 a ingredientelor \u00eentr-o re\u021bet\u0103 rafinat\u0103. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Clafoutis_de_banane.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "Desert",
    "IsFavorite": 1,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"fc0f5281-3795-41e3-8017-61c050ec140e\",\"Name\":\"taiate rondele\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"banane\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"314259c6-3cda-46e0-81a8-88b2b9fac66b\",\"Name\":\"oua\",\"Amount\":4,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"1aaaefde-11c9-4da5-92b4-1760bbbd1bcc\",\"Name\":\"unt topit\",\"Amount\":50,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"abd6f8e0-0905-49fc-ac17-d71f73b13c72\",\"Name\":\"faina de grau\",\"Amount\":80,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"81864b81-dd04-47cc-912b-f42950d1d8f4\",\"Name\":\"lapte gras\",\"Amount\":250,\"Unit\":\"ml\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"aac2432d-da0d-4ae1-b5d4-f2f60dc2cca1\",\"Name\":\"unt uns vasele\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"78b5fe87-ed7a-4e29-b8e9-cc0005f1ebf0\",\"Name\":\"sirop avocado/artar\",\"Amount\":5,\"Unit\":\"ml\",\"Order\":7}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"e5b87604-99d5-40cb-b90c-b3684ec12639\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"Se ung vasele cu unt si se pun feliile de banane pe fundul lor.\"},{\"Id\":\"aafc6574-66a9-4b76-9d68-1dfb77913931\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Se amesteca faina cu ou\\u0103le sa nu se formeze cocoloa\\u0219e.\"},{\"Id\":\"4d791b98-7334-4216-a630-62b413fe4d4c\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Se amesteca untul cu oule si laptele.\"},{\"Id\":\"7140596b-9615-4370-8dff-a07035f144bf\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Optional: Putin Sirop de Avocado\"},{\"Id\":\"6e948f9b-ad8c-4025-a20d-f7a9f743c266\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"Se da la cuptor 35-40minute la 180 grade.\"},{\"Id\":\"6fb80d5f-a6f7-415d-a46d-b337bb32c2c8\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"Se imparte continutul in vase.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 15:41:13.4712291",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 15:41:13.4712291"
  },
