    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"3abaf922-bade-4265-97e0-41f3597ad140\",\"Name\":\"fulgi de ovaz\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"815fe03c-91b5-4741-9b28-81fa7b0b30c5\",\"Name\":\"miere\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"21101d26-4de5-4759-baff-ddf03527efbe\",\"Name\":\"unt de arahide\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"3eba82c0-d1ec-4093-b5b5-3ce1d7326256\",\"Name\":\"ciocolata neagra\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"e20a330f-b2b1-457a-9c36-bbf9808fa7b2\",\"Name\":\"fulgi de ciocolata\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":5}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"304fe893-4df4-4a2b-b21c-7d5821436374\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"fulgi de ovaz * miere * unt de arahide * ciocolata neagra * fulgi de ciocolata\"},{\"Id\":\"ee846eef-6d63-44fa-9edc-404da751b051\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Se formeza crusta din fulgi de ovaz, miere si unt arahide, care se pune in tava in forme. Peste se toarna ciocolata neagra topita. Peste se adauga din nou un strat de unt de arahide. Daca se doreste se pun si fulgi de ciocolata pe deasupra.\"},{\"Id\":\"17fdbbad-4148-484c-a5de-3f54bb1366f4\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Se lasa sa se intareasca\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2211236",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2211236"
  },
  {
    "Id": "733D2F7A-7A15-480A-A869-00337D89BD07",
    "Title": "Cozonac",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Cozonac.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"43899d1e-6d7d-4640-b5e0-6f79e3ac0ae8\",\"Name\":\"INGREDIENTE** **UMPLUTURA** \\\\-600 gr faina 000 ( cantitatea ajustabila ) \\\\-250 ml lapte \\\\- 4 galbenusuri \\\\- 80 gr unt moale \\\\- 20 ml rom bun \\\\- 40 ml ulei \\\\- 150 gr zahar \\\\- 30 gr drojdie \\\\- 1/2 lingurita sare \\\\- coaja de la o lamaie \\\\- coaja de la o jumatate portocala \\\\- vanilie de care aveti \\\\- un ou si 2 linguri lapte pentru uns \\\\- 400 gr nuci \\\\- 100 gr zahar \\\\- 30 gr cacao \\\\- 4 albusuri\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"6f8f2e01-9b67-4f36-a7cc-90ade420d13f\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"INGREDIENTE** **UMPLUTURA**\"},{\"Id\":\"c3d00086-ebbe-44b5-8650-0e86c38605a8\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"600 gr faina 000 ( cantitatea ajustabila ) 250 ml lapte 4 galbenusuri 80 gr unt moale 20 ml rom bun 40 ml ulei 150 gr zahar 30 gr drojdie 1/2 lingurita sare coaja de la o lamaie coaja de la o jumatate portocala vanilie de care aveti un ou si 2 linguri lapte pentru uns 400 gr nuci 100 gr zahar 30 gr cacao 4 albusuri\"},{\"Id\":\"36b7e08b-4870-4375-a61b-871b62f44791\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"1 . In bol zaharul , coaja de lamaie si portocala **30 sec / vit 9** rezervati\"},{\"Id\":\"838b3bf1-0b0b-40ee-a117-8967d2cf76b2\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"2.Se pune laptele in vas **2 min / 37 \\u00B0 / vit 1**\"},{\"Id\":\"1fbdfa74-77ed-42b8-8f92-0a6b7cc44010\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"3.Adaugati drojdia **30 sec / vit 3**\"},{\"Id\":\"2bc65e43-4b99-4236-9e4d-86de0f36461d\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"4 . Lasati **5 min** sa se desfaca drojdia\"},{\"Id\":\"a39e9f89-1bda-48fc-b44a-89e43e19d180\",\"StepNumber\":7,\"Text\":\"5 .Adaugati zaharul aromatizat , vanilia , untul moale , galbenusurile , romul **2min / vit 3**\"},{\"Id\":\"12fed715-e429-435d-b412-281eb87b5920\",\"StepNumber\":8,\"Text\":\"6 . Adaugati faina, sarea **30 sec / vit 6**\"},{\"Id\":\"982fa888-aa9c-4e1e-bbd2-77a7f77cf005\",\"StepNumber\":9,\"Text\":\"7 . Dati pe functia framantare **4 min** timp in care se pune uleiul cantarit inainte, pe sus prin orificiul capacului\"},{\"Id\":\"d1d5f222-275b-471e-b460-aacb8952d843\",\"StepNumber\":10,\"Text\":\"8 . Repetati inca **4 min** framantare Daca este nevoie mai puneti faina , aluatul trebuie sa se desprinda de pe peretii vasului.\"},{\"Id\":\"ac3c76a1-1db7-4d9e-832e-41346282c828\",\"StepNumber\":11,\"Text\":\"9 . Lasati la dospit pana isi dubleaza volumul intr - un vas mare uns cu ulei , acoperit cu folie transparenta si un prosop curat , cel mai bine se pune intr - un loc caldut .\"},{\"Id\":\"123e67e6-cbc0-417b-998c-9d88ddaa053f\",\"StepNumber\":12,\"Text\":\"10 . Spalati vasul si preparati umplutura\"},{\"Id\":\"abf76962-aaea-4fa0-b9cd-cf4a6c0802db\",\"StepNumber\":13,\"Text\":\"11 Nucile **2 sec turbo** - rezervati\"},{\"Id\":\"4e39e6b5-6128-4381-b939-2aaf8f7a62b4\",\"StepNumber\":14,\"Text\":\"12 . Spalati vasul ,uscati si montati fluturasul.\"},{\"Id\":\"a8862e7b-a2b7-4b76-aa94-02988be74939\",\"StepNumber\":15,\"Text\":\"13.Albusurile **4 min / vit 3.5**\"},{\"Id\":\"d00786ce-bcae-472a-89ab-0ae7f3682f2b\",\"StepNumber\":16,\"Text\":\"14.Adaugati zaharul **2 min / vit 3.5**\"},{\"Id\":\"87ad00b0-6b5f-4092-bcc0-2042170cb71b\",\"StepNumber\":17,\"Text\":\"15 . Adaugati cacao , nucile **30 sec / vit 3.5**\"},{\"Id\":\"e541fa87-1486-45d6-b23d-b1d5c8f9eccd\",\"StepNumber\":18,\"Text\":\"16 .Pregatim doua tavi potrivite cu hartie de copt si unsa cu unt , tava nu se unge .\"},{\"Id\":\"a83d9262-a58b-4bc9-9a72-8e66aea1506c\",\"StepNumber\":19,\"Text\":\"17 . Impartiti aluatul in patru bile , cantariti daca vreti , aveti cu ce\"},{\"Id\":\"009d1257-4a6e-4438-8aad-349b78429f6f\",\"StepNumber\":20,\"Text\":\"18.Fiecare bila se intinde , se pune un sfert din umplutura se ruleaza cu grija sa nu iasa , mai facem un rulou la fel , le impletim si asezam cozonacul in tava .\"},{\"Id\":\"d76ae820-6e06-4d8e-a9e6-1c2bc510d8bf\",\"StepNumber\":21,\"Text\":\"19 .Procedam la fel si cu cele doua bile ramase formand al doilea cozonac.\"},{\"Id\":\"df6130fd-e526-447f-990b-480d0b133280\",\"StepNumber\":22,\"Text\":\"20 . Lasam la dospit pana ajunge la partea de sus a formei\"},{\"Id\":\"c3c11def-977c-40e4-bbaf-5971466209e1\",\"StepNumber\":23,\"Text\":\"21 . Incalzim cuptorul bine cu **10 - 15 min** inainte\"},{\"Id\":\"3f284800-a555-4b3e-834a-1aadd072a6de\",\"StepNumber\":24,\"Text\":\"22 . Ungem cozonacii cu ou batut cu putin lapte si dupa preferinta presaram mac , susan , zahar\"},{\"Id\":\"ef0a1788-cde5-4655-8ecd-93c404bf5565\",\"StepNumber\":25,\"Text\":\"23 . Coacem **40 - 45 min / 180 \\u00B0**, dupa ce prind culoare ,se acopera cu hartie de copt sau aluminiu .\"},{\"Id\":\"7f1f309e-195f-4c9b-a209-aff13f4cdb38\",\"StepNumber\":26,\"Text\":\"23 . Se scot din cuptor si se lasa 5 min apoi se scot din tavi , se aseaza pe un gratar 5 min pe o parte, apoi se intorc pe cealalta parte .\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2212333",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2212333"
  },
