    "CuisineType": "Mic Dejun",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"461415d9-f91d-4848-8783-a1bc60a7101a\",\"Name\":\"de paine\",\"Amount\":500,\"Unit\":\"faina\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"5c49200c-3c50-4551-8324-7fd30673196c\",\"Name\":\"cald\",\"Amount\":200,\"Unit\":\"lapte\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"5b9f09d4-d13b-4fd0-8038-119e9c8d31d1\",\"Name\":\"gras\",\"Amount\":120,\"Unit\":\"iaurt\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"f48ea34c-4566-41c5-9417-78bedb4afc4c\",\"Name\":\"drojdie uscata\",\"Amount\":10,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"d614c088-2c4d-4640-b15c-72cbbe33db8a\",\"Name\":\"ulei de masline\",\"Amount\":20,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"d88d5f89-fa30-41f2-88a7-c21f30faaccc\",\"Name\":\"Umplutura:\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"5b80f3f7-bf31-4cad-9531-d65c7ba34ffa\",\"Name\":\"branza la alegere (moza,cheddar, burduf)\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"c260a632-a760-4b6f-95b6-8b4846e25e6e\",\"Name\":\"4-5 cate de usturoi pasta\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":8},{\"Id\":\"347050f8-91c0-4a11-86ce-788131a147e4\",\"Name\":\"patrunjel verde\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":9}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"0faa2ad5-d26f-4ae8-a2db-825317418340\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"500 faina de paine * 200 lapte cald * 120 iaurt gras * 10g drojdie uscata * 20g ulei de masline Umplutura: * branza la alegere (moza,cheddar, burduf) * 4-5 cate de usturoi pasta * patrunjel verde\"},{\"Id\":\"de274df5-beed-41ea-a028-7d9b2fe1f9f2\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Se framanta aluatul si se lasa la dospit 45 min.\"},{\"Id\":\"8710c302-89bc-43c0-b8f0-af7a7c4c6432\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Se scoate aluatul, se aplatizeaza, se fac cateva impaturituri dupa care se lasa iaras la dospit 45 min sau pana isi dubleaza volumul.\"},{\"Id\":\"3e977f2e-9d39-4927-bc24-97e190fe96c1\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Se imparte in 8 bile si se mai lasa 45 min\"},{\"Id\":\"2e1fba36-d1ba-40af-bcd2-d4f181152fe0\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"Fiecare bila se aplatizeaza , se pune branza si se aduna aluatul in jur, cu atentie fara gauri.\"},{\"Id\":\"c84a24e2-a6ac-4eb7-9056-eec55b22b21f\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"Se lasa la dospit 15 min\"},{\"Id\":\"669bdda1-7e0a-4739-a95c-febc2f05ea1d\",\"StepNumber\":7,\"Text\":\"Se intinde fiecare bila fara sa intindeti pana in capat, Ca sa nu crape.\"},{\"Id\":\"bfed44ad-4281-4ce5-b5d2-328ea9fdb01d\",\"StepNumber\":8,\"Text\":\"Se prajesc in tigaie incinsa bine pe ambele parti pana capata o culoare aurie\"},{\"Id\":\"cd26899a-1b97-4e3f-b3a9-609e956e9cae\",\"StepNumber\":9,\"Text\":\"Se ung cu amestec de unt si patrunjel verde.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2214391",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2214391"
  },
  {
    "Id": "77C80CDC-E2BB-4F02-AFA3-CD75927FAED0",
    "Title": "Tocanita de miel",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Tocanita_de_miel.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"748dde23-3ae6-452c-baf6-83bf106e2c1d\",\"Name\":\"700-800g carne de miel (eu am avut o pulpa intreaga)\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"de3e0673-8202-4972-8636-d3e1086dbf72\",\"Name\":\"taiati rondele\",\"Amount\":3,\"Unit\":\"morcovi\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"c6955159-d709-466c-b2e7-ec6aec8014ea\",\"Name\":\"mare\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"ceapa\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"47db0d3b-6f52-417f-827f-111229514c14\",\"Name\":\"de dafin\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"foi\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"22ce0720-a4fc-4804-bd00-f1269e3d4d61\",\"Name\":\"300-400g smantana 30-35%\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"f46f00bc-fbfe-4283-8e8b-1c2fa2b5d5a7\",\"Name\":\"amidon (sau 4 daca vreti sosul mai gros)\",\"Amount\":3,\"Unit\":\"tbsp\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"39e08b4b-444b-4082-8360-d674ad70d917\",\"Name\":\"de usturoi facut pasta\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"capatana\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"a9fc3d33-a152-4132-9398-2f370dabc630\",\"Name\":\"Piper\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":8},{\"Id\":\"90eb6ea5-5602-495e-a1d5-70882c81e9a5\",\"Name\":\"Patrunjel verde\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":9}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"5d318c50-46bc-48e8-b576-296c42c4607f\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"700-800g carne de miel (eu am avut o pulpa intreaga) 3 morcovi taiati rondele 1 ceapa mare 2 foi de dafin 300-400g smantana 30-35% 3 linguri amidon (sau 4 daca vreti sosul mai gros) 1 capatana de usturoi facut pasta Piper Patrunjel verde\"},{\"Id\":\"8c711747-dd09-4b0f-88ed-1aaa8a1ffb55\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Pulpa de miel am taiat-o in 4 bucati si le-am adaugat intr-o oala incapatoare impreuna cu foile de dafin, ceapa tocata si rondelele de morcovi. Am adaugat 2L de apa si\"},{\"Id\":\"2a6910e5-3abe-49b0-bce4-a8f70781249c\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"am pus la fiert cu capacul pus, pe foc mic pana s-au fragezit bucatile de miel. A durat in jur de 1,5 ore.\"},{\"Id\":\"dd4e62e0-6d79-45b1-bf5f-2f9bbfbac320\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Completati cu apa daca scade prea mult lichidul din oala si va place tocanita cu mult sos asa cum ne place si noua.\"},{\"Id\":\"11362f5b-4026-490d-ae22-c4703601842b\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"In timp ce fierbea carnea am amestecat smantana cu amidonul, usturoiul si piperul.\"},{\"Id\":\"38b0d0ee-29f8-421e-900c-ccf11047b030\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"Dupa ce s-au fragezit bucatile de carne am luat oala de pe foc si am adaugat 2 polonice din supa fierbinte peste amestecul de smantana si am omogenizat.\"},{\"Id\":\"f2057328-6fdd-457d-84fe-da2e3055f850\",\"StepNumber\":7,\"Text\":\"Am turnat amestecul de smantana in oala si am amestecat. Am pus oala inapoi pe foc mic si am lasat sa dea in clocot in timp ce am amestecat cu grija. Am lasat sa fiarba pana s-a ingrosat sosul dupa care am adaugat patrunjel verde dupa gust, am stins focul si am pus capacul. Dupa 10-15 minute se poate servi.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2215403",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2215403"
  },
  {
    "Id": "7925F564-8077-4022-A87A-D2F82AA6F9B9",
    "Title": "Cus cus cu mazare",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Cus_cus_cu_mazare.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"b1767c71-1fc6-47ab-a18a-015460b9ec7a\",\"Name\":\"mazare (proaspata sau congelata, nu de la conserva/borcan)\",\"Amount\":250,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"873c22f5-964b-4572-ba6c-9bead196a209\",\"Name\":\"cu\\u0219-cu\\u0219\",\"Amount\":150,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"c9a28979-7992-45d0-8285-9bcdb3ca7770\",\"Name\":\"ulei de masline\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"tbsp\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"f7839386-03d0-4baf-8483-b8205b05e06c\",\"Name\":\"1/2 ceapa\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"4be0158f-d04a-43ad-8f17-f980c3384ec6\",\"Name\":\"(se poate omite daca doriti)\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"ou\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"388d56d5-9f19-476c-a815-cc7fe1b47929\",\"Name\":\"parmezan razuit (folositi fulgi de drojdie inactiva pt varianta fara lactate)\",\"Amount\":50,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"21fe2a2b-d273-449c-a4e1-7b612ce18409\",\"Name\":\"sare, piper, 1/2 lgt Adio Sare de la Sonnentor (optional), 1/2 lgt pudra de usturoi\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":7}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"5a17025c-ec08-4f9f-90bf-0c7815092c69\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"250g mazare (proaspata sau congelata, nu de la conserva/borcan) 150g cu\\u0219-cu\\u0219 2 lg ulei de masline 1/2 ceapa 1 ou (se poate omite daca doriti) 50g parmezan razuit (folositi fulgi de drojdie inactiva pt varianta fara lactate) sare, piper, 1/2 lgt Adio Sare de la Sonnentor (optional), 1/2 lgt pudra de usturoi\"},{\"Id\":\"201df1a9-7d62-4ce1-a168-50fa9e476717\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Calim ceapa in ulei (adaugati putina apa cand caliti pt varianta healthy).\"},{\"Id\":\"6355a93e-494a-4ca3-bb35-fe6119648562\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Agaugam mazarea si apa cat sa depaseasca cu un deget nivelul de mazare din cratita.\"},{\"Id\":\"5a3ce5d0-16ea-4908-999b-4a7320e05a1f\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Dupa ce a fiert, scoatem jumatate din continut si blenduim fin, pe urma turnam inapoi in cratita.\"},{\"Id\":\"4b05e387-2e19-4118-8369-71761df64bf9\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"Adaugam cus-cus-ul, apa cat sa acopere si fierbem amestecand des. Mai tot adaugam cata putina apa la nevoie.\"},{\"Id\":\"b61c30cb-f31e-4313-a17a-6fdbd225cd2f\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"Intre timp batem 1 ou si il amestecam cu parmezanul. Cand cus-cus-ul e fiert, adaugam oul cu parmezanul si continuam gatirea pe foc pt 2 min, amestecand continuu.\"},{\"Id\":\"7bce5944-3c95-4100-85d0-926b48fea3d1\",\"StepNumber\":7,\"Text\":\"Daca nu doriti sa folositi ou, pur si simplu il omiteti si puneti direct parmezanul (sau drojdia inactiva).\"},{\"Id\":\"45ee1175-fc0c-4d03-b87b-b530b86005f4\",\"StepNumber\":8,\"Text\":\"Nu uita sa omiti sarea si parmezanul pt copii sub 2 ani.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2216444",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2216444"
  },
  {
    "Id": "795265E6-3414-4B86-A9D8-B20C38A46183",
    "Title": "Arpacas cu legume",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Arpacas_cu_legume.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 0,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"d4e72f51-b862-48fa-9181-c0ef7005b03e\",\"Name\":\"o cana de arpacas\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"1d67ae65-b479-43cb-ab47-9e56cc90bfb1\",\"Name\":\"morcov\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"05d18272-54dd-41e9-a443-e3473f89b5fd\",\"Name\":\"cepe\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"9eb6d430-1909-4a40-8e61-567a68ac5d72\",\"Name\":\"sare, piper\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"3e822daf-c13d-4629-bd45-6ac5d1b7d3ad\",\"Name\":\"chimen, busuioc, oregano sau orice alte arome\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":5}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"bf8d5545-b012-4ce4-bb94-60411e2671cf\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"o cana de arpacas * 1 morcov * 2 cepe * sare, piper * chimen, busuioc, oregano sau orice alte arome\"},{\"Id\":\"9601b1c9-987e-4e8d-a888-fbfa4c3fce59\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Arpacasul se spala in mai multe ape, apoi se lasa la hidratat cel putin 3 ore, preferabil peste noapte.\"},{\"Id\":\"6cdd8e0e-ebf1-4d14-ac28-15a5646956fd\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Se schimba apa si se pune la fiert cel putin 40 minute. Legumele se taie si se calesc. Cand e fiert arpacasul se pune peste legume, se condimenteaza.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2217453",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2217453"
  },
  {
    "Id": "79A7CA70-6E5F-44ED-ADFB-0E042B53516F",
    "Title": "Tarta Banoffee - cu banan si dulce de leche",
    "Description": "Un desert delicios care combin\u0103 savoarea unic\u0103 a ingredientelor \u00eentr-o re\u021bet\u0103 rafinat\u0103. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Tarta_Banoffee_-_cu_banan_si_dulce_de_leche.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "Desert",
    "IsFavorite": 1,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"34e0575b-efd6-4aec-9c04-62f80f56c141\",\"Name\":\"de biscui\\u021Bi digestivi\",\"Amount\":200,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"a8152b41-d872-4436-a979-96250db70546\",\"Name\":\"unt \\u00EEn buc\\u0103\\u021Bi\",\"Amount\":80,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"6ef9b6e6-669e-45bf-9163-4a717a248074\",\"Name\":\"dulce de leche\",\"Amount\":300,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"bb132f16-b018-4811-bf4e-12f76b4a990d\",\"Name\":\"coapte (feliate aproximativ 5 mm)\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"banane\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"78e917be-1878-4d09-9160-8b4c648f68fa\",\"Name\":\"sm\\u00E2nt\\u00E2n\\u0103 (35% gr\\u0103sime)\",\"Amount\":400,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"d726b890-8fc6-4b71-bef8-9fd62de3a09c\",\"Name\":\"br\\u00E2nz\\u0103 sm\\u00E2nt\\u00E2n\\u0103 (tip Philadelphia\\u00AE)\",\"Amount\":100,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"6cc34080-fbb9-48b6-8888-f04ff85d28d2\",\"Name\":\"zah\\u0103r pudra\",\"Amount\":50,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"b393d0a1-a2ec-47d5-8344-2518a33a85ff\",\"Name\":\"10-15 g ciocolata\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":8}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"5a72613b-982f-41a7-b507-4118d0a13489\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"Ingrediente: 200 g de biscui\\u021Bi digestivi 80 g unt \\u00EEn buc\\u0103\\u021Bi 300 g dulce de leche 2 banane coapte (feliate aproximativ 5 mm) 400 g sm\\u00E2nt\\u00E2n\\u0103 (35% gr\\u0103sime) 100 g br\\u00E2nz\\u0103 sm\\u00E2nt\\u00E2n\\u0103 (tip Philadelphia\\u00AE) 50 g zah\\u0103r pudra 10-15 g ciocolata\"},{\"Id\":\"7d8c73e2-02ff-4682-8c23-a6c72c38cb52\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"1.Pune\\u021Bi biscuitii \\u0219i untul \\u00EEn pahar \\u0219i zdrobi\\u021Bi 20 sec / vit 7. Turna\\u021Bi amestecul \\u00EEntr-o forma deta\\u0219abil\\u0103 de \\u00D8 22 cm \\u0219i \\u00EEntinde\\u021Bi 3 linguri de dulce de leche peste. Pune\\u021Bi feliile de banan\\u0103 deasupra \\u0219i acoperi\\u021Bi cu dulce de leche r\\u0103mas.\"},{\"Id\":\"81291691-f5ac-4586-818a-71c5f4f080ae\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"2.A\\u0219eza\\u021Bi fluturele pe lame. Pune\\u021Bi \\u00EEn pahar sm\\u00E2nt\\u00E2na, crem\\u0103 de br\\u00E2nz\\u0103 \\u0219i zah\\u0103rul pudra. Programeaz\\u0103 vit 3.5 p\\u00E2n\\u0103 c\\u00E2nd se monteaz\\u0103 crema (ave\\u021Bi grij\\u0103 s\\u0103 nu bate\\u021Bi excesiv). Scoate\\u021Bi fluturele, turna\\u021Bi crema montat\\u0103 peste tarta \\u0219i netezi\\u021Bi suprafa\\u021Ba cu spatula. Cu ajutorul unei razatoare sau unui curatator de legume, distribui\\u021Bi bucati de ciocolat\\u0103 pe suprafa\\u021Ba tartei. Lasati minim 20 de minute la frigider. Se taie \\u00EEn por\\u021Bii \\u0219i se serve\\u0219te.\"},{\"Id\":\"9ed00ef0-5f03-46ad-a664-bf2c35c03ac0\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"1000 ml lapte integral la temperatura camerei\"},{\"Id\":\"ffb264a6-c41f-4cf1-b94a-43bfa71d6784\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"200 g sm\\u00E2nt\\u00E2n\\u0103 (35% gr\\u0103sime) la temperatura camerei\"},{\"Id\":\"d6f4bfce-197f-4bbe-a9b9-15bf709e8dff\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"\\u00BD linguri\\u021B\\u0103 de bicarbonat de copt\"},{\"Id\":\"4aa861a0-3a35-4b7e-8a93-636e516bfb13\",\"StepNumber\":7,\"Text\":\"1.Pune\\u021Bi toate ingredientele \\u00EEn vas. Pune\\u021Bi co\\u0219ul pe capac \\u00EEn loc de pahar \\u0219i pune\\u021Bi 55-58 min / Varoma / vit 5. In reteta zic sa il lasi 50 min dar mie mi se pare prea moale ptr tarta. Turna\\u021Bi dulce de leche rapid \\u00EEntr-un borcan de sticl\\u0103 \\u0219i l\\u0103sa\\u021Bi s\\u0103 se r\\u0103ceasc\\u0103 (aproximativ 2 ore).\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2218565",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2218565"
  },
  {
    "Id": "7A9E5A84-937A-4699-9889-64546302629A",
    "Title": "Dry Rub BBQ (costite)",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Dry_Rub_BBQ_(costite",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"6911b52e-267f-4821-9b8d-b4a1005749bf\",\"Name\":\"Cate o lingurita de:\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"f4509d4c-b48b-4d98-a78e-40ed34ab1e55\",\"Name\":\"cimbru\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"03bccaf7-af3b-417a-a696-4893e6c77af7\",\"Name\":\"oregano\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"d423068a-25f0-4b8f-b986-7f30efad5be0\",\"Name\":\"busuioc\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"4f5b12eb-c3ad-4afb-9737-7cdfb4a2d3e6\",\"Name\":\"rozmarin\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"0aa18316-f7e9-4fdb-acd7-2023c05cfedf\",\"Name\":\"cimbrisor\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"b63d0623-887d-48a1-a85f-337c6162359b\",\"Name\":\"cardamom\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"96784d6e-4f6c-4bdd-b3b9-bce8999bf595\",\"Name\":\"maghiran\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":8},{\"Id\":\"5752f873-c509-4c9b-a6cb-089eb2a74ae1\",\"Name\":\"salvie\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":9},{\"Id\":\"00565a7c-23fe-4a16-ac16-f7c9edec7cbd\",\"Name\":\"nucsoara rasa\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":10},{\"Id\":\"91b71d61-0be8-41b3-9fc4-944786cc8d04\",\"Name\":\"coaja de nucsoara (macis)\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":11},{\"Id\":\"4244e305-4d92-4e68-ad1f-2a7fa9a679f0\",\"Name\":\"enibahar\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":12},{\"Id\":\"cc4746c6-7bd8-4bfc-aa5b-080aa7f06d0a\",\"Name\":\"mustar pudra\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":13},{\"Id\":\"63ab99e8-4f15-451e-b5a7-61936ae13957\",\"Name\":\"boabe de ienupar\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":14},{\"Id\":\"5ecf6c77-57fc-4c90-a2ef-1a01152620be\",\"Name\":\"Cate 2 lingurite de:\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":15},{\"Id\":\"885653b4-d699-4f92-927d-26f01475462d\",\"Name\":\"chimen macinat\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":16},{\"Id\":\"6bbbff99-0b63-4065-bc34-c6b93d37e03d\",\"Name\":\"chimen seminte\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":17},{\"Id\":\"aca83219-8153-4490-8aae-b07e1046f858\",\"Name\":\"piper negru\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":18},{\"Id\":\"007d4f44-d4d3-467c-bef0-6a4e6b316584\",\"Name\":\"piper verde\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":19},{\"Id\":\"8229b0ba-1b7d-4d80-b84b-7bb7169ab5b4\",\"Name\":\"piper szechuan\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":20}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"06f572f5-0bf0-422e-835f-b8b18a1858b6\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"Cate o lingurita de:** * cimbru * oregano * busuioc * rozmarin * cimbrisor * cardamom * maghiran * salvie * nucsoara rasa * coaja de nucsoara (macis) * enibahar * mustar pudra * boabe de ienupar **Cate 2 lingurite de:** * chimen macinat * chimen seminte * piper negru * piper verde * piper szechuan * boia iute * fulgi de ardei iute **Cate 4 lingurite de:** * boia dulce (paprika) * boia afumata (smoked paprika) * fulgi de usturoi * fulgi de ceapa * fulgi de telina **Cate 2 linguri mari de:** * ...\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.221969",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.221969"
  },
  {
    "Id": "7F87A5D0-2875-4CFB-B787-7DA528E0722A",
    "Title": "Legume de vara",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Legume_de_vara.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"3fc0ac14-5781-4fb6-aa2f-9b85f9f026cb\",\"Name\":\"cartofi\",\"Amount\":500,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"a0f1d560-8e37-4056-a652-995c0810c86a\",\"Name\":\"dovlecei\",\"Amount\":300,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"14ff7cf1-28df-43e2-a1b3-420f5eabc56f\",\"Name\":\"vinete (eu nu am avut)\",\"Amount\":300,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"08ceced2-693f-4999-9562-27d00f29b4bb\",\"Name\":\"ciuperci\",\"Amount\":150,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"38bc68d2-a0b1-4b8c-8f4d-12a350019285\",\"Name\":\"ceap\\u0103\",\"Amount\":300,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"8a3111b8-646c-45f4-9f54-3b29f59c7266\",\"Name\":\"4-5 c\\u0103\\u021Bei de usturoi\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"9a1521fe-90ed-4cdc-b789-a4531069bf65\",\"Name\":\"2-3 ardei kapia\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"49fffec3-0b1b-4fc0-bd82-f7aec30bd6af\",\"Name\":\"de ulei de m\\u0103sline\",\"Amount\":3,\"Unit\":\"tbsp\",\"Order\":8},{\"Id\":\"5a6ec8d2-1754-4cec-884e-805d0e88202d\",\"Name\":\"sare\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":9},{\"Id\":\"e52902f3-a999-4fa2-bded-53fad354e546\",\"Name\":\"\\u00CEn plus:\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":10},{\"Id\":\"53c76039-3023-4e37-85c6-7bcf47ce5439\",\"Name\":\"mujdei cu ro\\u0219ii\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":11}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"c667c3db-8b5e-4cff-8567-80953e211a4d\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"Ingrediente** * 500 g cartofi * 300 g dovlecei * 300 g vinete (eu nu am avut) * 150 g ciuperci * 300 g ceap\\u0103 * 4-5 c\\u0103\\u021Bei de usturoi * 2-3 ardei kapia * 3 linguri de ulei de m\\u0103sline * sare **\\u00CEn plus:** * mujdei cu ro\\u0219ii\"},{\"Id\":\"ad228ae5-6e7c-4f87-9931-4990aa7ebd9f\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Se feliaza toate legumele si se sareaza. Cartofii si dovleceii se lasa in strecuratoare pentru a se scurge.\"},{\"Id\":\"72495013-168b-45cf-81e1-99503fd2fb1a\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Se incinge cuptorul la **220 grade** cu ventilatie\"},{\"Id\":\"3d07446a-37c8-42a8-89f8-7515c39e7845\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Se aseaza ceapa si ardeiul kapia si se dau la cuptor pentru **7 minute**\"},{\"Id\":\"0244737e-5eb0-4851-b16d-d14d53948e6e\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"Se storc cartofii si dovleceii de apa lasata (e bine sa fie cat mai uscate pentru a se rumeni si nu pentru a fi inabusite)\"},{\"Id\":\"c0127eef-554b-4c63-8ccc-44494a250b97\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"Apoi se aseaza restul legumelor, se stropesc cu doua linguri de ulei de masline si se dau la cuptor pentru **20 de minute**.\"},{\"Id\":\"ec0eefaa-a1e4-4d57-95ab-45202280a0ce\",\"StepNumber\":7,\"Text\":\"Se reduce temperatura la **200 de grade** si se mai lasa **15-20 de minute** pana se rumenesc frumos.\"},{\"Id\":\"8c5c3dbd-f3de-4785-8a17-cbc4b8298a2c\",\"StepNumber\":8,\"Text\":\"Se da o rosie faina si zemoasa pe razatoarea mica, plus 3 catei de usturoi. Se adauga sare si 1-2 lingurite de ulei.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2220744",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2220744"
  },
  {
    "Id": "802C3055-C58D-419D-9607-DF0E868A1CA1",
    "Title": "Sos din legume pentru paste",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Sos_din_legume_pentru_paste.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 1,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"569098f8-7863-4841-82d7-90970a44135f\",\"Name\":\"ardei\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"aca15a2e-ba57-4490-a303-57a97e5c54f9\",\"Name\":\"2-3 rosii\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"845ac8a7-5482-4a60-835f-70bc6cbf0cde\",\"Name\":\"rosie\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"ceapa\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"3afdac6a-ba39-477b-99a6-87ef96b242d4\",\"Name\":\"de usturoi\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"catei\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"923b6dd2-a3d0-4f81-beb9-c05f68854155\",\"Name\":\"sare, piper\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"4ad5c12e-411e-49cc-a324-cbf64580585b\",\"Name\":\"ulei de masline\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"deace447-a6a0-4b8e-a1d3-7346d53e6a7b\",\"Name\":\"oregano\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":7}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"3d0654e8-d82c-40e2-b040-5f92f396b60d\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"1 ardei * 2-3 rosii * 1 ceapa rosie * 2 catei de usturoi * sare, piper * ulei de masline * oregano\"},{\"Id\":\"78932502-7e0d-4301-862f-02426ebd7acf\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Se curata si se taie luegumele in bucati mari. Se stropesc cu ulei si se condimenteaza. Se dau la cuptor si se coc. Dupa ce s-au copt se pun n blender impreuna cu sucurile lasate si cu smanatana de gatit. Se blendeaza si se folosesc pe post de sos pentru paste.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2221689",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2221689"
  },
  {
    "Id": "80AC9E3F-EA11-4D8E-93F7-6802C5553BF0",
    "Title": "Magdalene (briose)",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Magdalene_(briose",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"71c2dd37-7857-452a-b306-d55af6db65c2\",\"Name\":\"zahar\",\"Amount\":200,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"c3377cf6-b470-4b54-9391-b453b3e78918\",\"Name\":\"esenta de lamaie (sau coaja de lamaie)\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"83492a2e-bb39-46ce-8edd-87bf29bbdb7f\",\"Name\":\"oua\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"a2bede28-ba78-41ed-9b86-79b7ef9cda0b\",\"Name\":\"lapte\",\"Amount\":170,\"Unit\":\"ml\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"80d5bd1e-f572-4702-b1b6-b8e045d0e8d0\",\"Name\":\"ulei de floarea sorelui\",\"Amount\":170,\"Unit\":\"ml\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"45c03d10-407b-4963-a9df-b0bb201e0ea1\",\"Name\":\"faina\",\"Amount\":270,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"c1862129-1914-43ef-b5d1-b2840a1545a5\",\"Name\":\"de copt\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"praf\",\"Order\":7}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"0cc86544-a254-4075-bd68-55eaa359dd0a\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"200 gr zahar * esenta de lamaie (sau coaja de lamaie) * 2 oua * 170 ml lapte * 170 ml ulei de floarea sorelui * 270 gr faina * 1 praf de copt\"},{\"Id\":\"4c446f36-2914-4dff-946a-207b05030d26\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"1. Pre-heat oven to 180\\u00B0C. Place 12 paper muffin cases in a muffin tray.\"},{\"Id\":\"ceb56625-4c6f-47de-ba75-e08912725eb0\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"2. Place sugar and lemon zest into mixing bowl and grind **30 sec/speed 10**.\"},{\"Id\":\"b19468cd-f889-49f3-a589-01ec6c303cd2\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"3. Add eggs. Mix **2 min/37\\u00B0C/speed 5**.\"},{\"Id\":\"e9852530-0002-4edf-8671-3e4d8aa93c4e\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"4. Add milk and sunflower oil into mixing bowl. Mix **10 sec/speed 5**.\"},{\"Id\":\"395f753b-327b-42b1-9f75-36d203dcfd74\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"5. Add flour and baking powder. Mix **10 sec/speed 3**.\"},{\"Id\":\"9dc56dbc-c234-453e-afc7-42cb2817a4b0\",\"StepNumber\":7,\"Text\":\"6. Fill \\u00BE of each of the paper muffin cases with the mixture.\"},{\"Id\":\"9646cf48-00eb-4aff-94d4-653f4a7859f7\",\"StepNumber\":8,\"Text\":\"7. Sprinkle with sugar and bake 20 minutes (180\\u00B0C). Remove magdalenas from the muffin tray. Place another 12 paper muffin cases in the tray, fill them with the rest of the mixture and bake 20 minutes (180\\u00B0C). Allow to cool before serving or place in an air-tight container to avoid drying.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2222727",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2222727"
  },
  {
    "Id": "82BF712E-7C1E-4A9B-92BB-B6A4528655D3",
    "Title": "Patratele cu merisoare",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Patratele_cu_merisoare.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"29428d9d-7066-4356-b363-a408d0a11d26\",\"Name\":\"Cranberry sauce\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"942037fe-60dd-4a71-9dfa-455804d5c91a\",\"Name\":\"12 oz package of cranberries (if using cranberry sauce, refer to notes section below)\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"515bde0e-b0d6-46a7-8e0a-841fd5088e8d\",\"Name\":\"sugar\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"cup\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"be6a625d-906f-4f54-b6d5-291c43a5ae46\",\"Name\":\"3/4 cup water\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"28fe8fe7-0ebf-495e-bf71-294f01c40926\",\"Name\":\"flour\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"cups\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"f6c635a0-acf7-4777-938b-d3a7f64c7376\",\"Name\":\"sugar\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"cup\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"1ced0554-a610-4f0b-9c19-d371dfe96f8c\",\"Name\":\"baking powder\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"tsp\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"6dde0fcd-ddaa-4929-abd9-f3a1ec738fff\",\"Name\":\"1/2 tsp salt\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":8},{\"Id\":\"f88e1e7b-aa33-4219-82f8-6a913debf06a\",\"Name\":\"3/4 cup butter; room temp.\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":9},{\"Id\":\"a70d9299-5c0a-405e-8352-548f667d6f50\",\"Name\":\"egg; beaten\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":10}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"9a8e23e3-1be5-413d-adf3-5b078b624f54\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"Cranberry sauce * 1 12 oz package of cranberries (if using cranberry sauce, refer to notes section below) * 1 cup sugar * 3/4 cup water * 2 cups flour * 1 cup sugar * 2 tsp baking powder * 1/2 tsp salt * 3/4 cup butter; room temp. * 1 egg; beaten\"},{\"Id\":\"5bef5ce6-d95a-47e2-a3c3-d078cbdee190\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"1. Cook cranberries, sugar, and water in a pot. Stirring frequently for about 15 minutes until they thicken up. Let cool.\"},{\"Id\":\"723a2605-360f-4918-abe2-09358379162d\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"2. In a bowl, mix sugar, flour, baking powder, and salt.\"},{\"Id\":\"787839ba-a167-41cc-bd9a-7c0e1027d21d\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"3. Cut in butter until the texture is crumbly then add the egg.\"},{\"Id\":\"cd55c9a3-5651-473a-a500-b8f34a3d8ed5\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"4. Sprinkle just over half of the mixture into a 9\\u00D713 pan then pack down into a solid crust.\"},{\"Id\":\"a44bf5d0-5f26-4c94-b1a3-16cadfa48c12\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"5. Spread the cooled cranberry sauce over top of the crust then sprinkle the remaining crumb over top.\"},{\"Id\":\"8bcc6833-9d00-4e24-be84-5fee6c4929c8\",\"StepNumber\":7,\"Text\":\"6. Bake in 350\\u00B0F oven for 40 minutes until the top is golden.\"},{\"Id\":\"ae1a84e8-ec09-4700-b511-17177ece5c67\",\"StepNumber\":8,\"Text\":\"7. Cool, then slice into squares.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2223746",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2223746"
  },
  {
    "Id": "855D4EE3-74A5-425A-BE95-0651BCB73BAE",
    "Title": "Cremes final",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Cremes_final.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 1,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"5b90bf00-1748-4efb-a8b1-24ddd6766c9d\",\"Name\":\"lapte Un baton de vanilie 5 oua \\u00EEntregi 180 g zah\\u0103r 90 g f\\u0103ina 200 g unt la temperatura camerei.\",\"Amount\":600,\"Unit\":\"ml\",\"Order\":1}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"d18a5f91-7105-4a51-87bf-65a6641b4dc5\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"150-200 gr. F\\u0103in\\u0103 (6-8 linguri)\"},{\"Id\":\"14edad97-c19a-4f99-9fc9-5d712542dcfe\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"300 gr. Zah\\u0103r (10 linguri)\"},{\"Id\":\"04bda215-34de-490a-add7-9272f358d21f\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"4 plicuri zah\\u0103r vanilat\"},{\"Id\":\"b84a077a-b2e3-4437-9404-58bfa72ac824\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Se pune laptele la fiert. Se p\\u0103streaz\\u0103 o can\\u0103 pentru mai t\\u00E2rziu. G\\u0103lbenu\\u0219urile se freac\\u0103 cu zah\\u0103rul, vanilia, f\\u0103ina \\u0219i cana de lapte rece. Albu\\u0219urile se bat spum\\u0103 si se adaug\\u0103 c\\u00E2te un pic \\u00EEn crema de g\\u0103lbenu\\u0219uri. Se amestec\\u0103 de sus \\u00EEn jos s\\u0103 nu se taie albu\\u0219urile.\"},{\"Id\":\"14d7f20c-5627-4d3e-abf9-36319bdd53ad\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"Compozi\\u021Bia se pune \\u00EEn laptele fiert \\u0219i se amestec\\u0103 \\u00EEn continuu la foc potrivit.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2224854",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2224854"
  },
  {
    "Id": "864771C6-18B8-444C-BBBE-7B29CC370D1F",
    "Title": "Aripioare glazurate",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Aripioare_glazurate.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"b0c75dc2-92c6-47ea-b0eb-b88333b3a727\",\"Name\":\"de aripioare (aprox 800g)\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"caserola\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"4cc306da-d6a9-4b0e-9ccd-1f4e1149313c\",\"Name\":\"de miere si 1 lg de sirop de curmale (pt varianta baby friendly folositi doar sirop de curmale)\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"tbsp\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"30bbedff-58b0-4af3-8430-c8848badcbb1\",\"Name\":\"pasta de rosii\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"ceasca\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"b67be64a-dda0-4848-b7e7-7478f3ffb511\",\"Name\":\"pudra de usturoi\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"lgt\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"8f0589e1-7dd7-4beb-a039-9cc42e8e67e2\",\"Name\":\"boia\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"lgt\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"0a192685-ea29-411a-947c-d31be93b8849\",\"Name\":\"zeama de lamaie\",\"Amount\":3,\"Unit\":\"tbsp\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"13dfc1f9-6e55-44b7-b5a0-1a43d22ad6ed\",\"Name\":\"albi\",\"Amount\":3,\"Unit\":\"cartofi\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"2f24baf2-a2e1-4338-9078-9ff8f55202cd\",\"Name\":\"1/2 cartof mare dulce\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":8},{\"Id\":\"809bf1cc-2dfe-4c1b-98d1-8d41f0dbcd6f\",\"Name\":\"de usturoi\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"capatana\",\"Order\":9},{\"Id\":\"6491d8a1-b68f-4cb6-bb9f-8de42756aace\",\"Name\":\"15-20g unt\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":10}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"5d37ce9a-7f0c-4399-bf44-de390beeddfc\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Cum procedam cu aripioarele?\"},{\"Id\":\"5ab39e6b-c708-4ec1-a7e5-efbc5486f66f\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"prefierbem aripioarele pt 5min si amestecam restul ingredientelor de mai\"},{\"Id\":\"5bd51dc4-4bfe-4d24-8113-7ffff033b660\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Punem aripioarele intr-o tava termorezistenta (sau in oala de la Ninja) si turnam sosul peste ele. Le amestecam bine\"},{\"Id\":\"5842a5fc-aa1d-441b-bf7b-dc4a9e7859e3\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"Le coacem cam 20-25min la 200 grade, amestecand la jumtatatea timpului. La Ninja le gatiti pe Bake, 190 grade, 15-20 min\"},{\"Id\":\"40804c09-5b32-442a-b36f-985343395b1a\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"Cum procedam cu piureul?\"},{\"Id\":\"96656ecd-cac5-458c-8e6a-dbd85db5ce6d\",\"StepNumber\":7,\"Text\":\"cartofii se curata de coaja si se fierb (cartoful dulce fierbe mai repede asa ca il taiati mai mare fata de cel alb)\"},{\"Id\":\"dce36d3f-6bf7-4327-8839-97b92fb91885\",\"StepNumber\":8,\"Text\":\"Usturoiul se taie la varf astfel incat sa se vada toti cateii de usturoi. Se infasoara usturoiul in hartie de copr apoi in folie de aluminiu si se coace la cuptor cam 20 min (il puteti pune deodata cu aripioarele)\"},{\"Id\":\"f16ef0e3-1833-4def-a26e-28c81b51d1a5\",\"StepNumber\":9,\"Text\":\"Cartofii fierti se blenduiesc sau se zdrobesc (in functie de consistenta dorita) impreuna cu untul si usturoiul. Nu uitati de sare (2ani\\u002B)\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.222589",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.222589"
  },
  {
    "Id": "8F2D6EB5-53B9-4E6D-9873-6AF37A56DB77",
    "Title": "Fursecuri cu miere si unt de arahide",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Fursecuri_cu_miere_si_unt_de_arahide.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"9c950429-b4b6-4d09-af86-e441a38c4769\",\"Name\":\"unt de arahide\",\"Amount\":100,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"5462a748-1506-40c2-b504-ae40010cd4a5\",\"Name\":\"miere\",\"Amount\":100,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"987d0b8e-3e82-4b25-8d4d-33de19f777b3\",\"Name\":\"ou\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"ea3262ee-7e39-43fa-b406-d92cde08f2de\",\"Name\":\"faina\",\"Amount\":200,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":4}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"77dbbc54-718b-4632-85c2-930402f2d4a3\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Ingredientele se amesteca in ordinea de mai sus. Va iesi un aluat modelabil.\"},{\"Id\":\"c69f8da5-2a5c-4651-8e3a-72225331e23e\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Se ia cate o lingurita de aluat si se ruleaza, lasand capetele putin mai subtiri decat mijlocul, dupa care dati forma de semiluna\"},{\"Id\":\"b090788c-e5a0-405d-82b9-cb1b6dc28b4c\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Coceti fursecurile pe hartie de copt, la cuptorul preincalzit la **180 grade pentru aprox 10 min**. Cand marginile devin aurii, ei sunt gata.\"},{\"Id\":\"24abd9ea-ccc2-428a-804f-a7d8825f1b47\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"Ii puteti pudra cu eritritol pudra sau cu faina de cocos\"},{\"Id\":\"b367c763-2a0d-4e32-ab34-a0ae4979fb33\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"Tinuti pe o farfurie, ei raman crocanti. Daca ii tineti intr-o cutie ermetica, se vor inmuia.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2226828",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2226828"
  },
  {
    "Id": "9276BE97-C0E5-4417-B56C-EB1164D234CA",
    "Title": "Pui cu garam masala",
    "Description": "Un preparat indian aromat cu condimente tradi\u021bionale \u0219i savori intense. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Pui_cu_garam_masala.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "Indian\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"e5988066-741e-46b7-8240-cdf0cefbd71e\",\"Name\":\"Marinada:\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"2e4941a3-c661-4c78-a638-b9c0ab9a1691\",\"Name\":\"1/3 cup iaurt\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"d8343a5d-8ae2-43a8-9704-2385f11a1c61\",\"Name\":\"3/4 lingurita turmeric\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"d1a05bf9-0fd1-41b8-8be6-d08c0386a356\",\"Name\":\"chilli\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"tsp\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"306d9706-430c-423d-957b-bb6844a7f42d\",\"Name\":\"garam masala\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"lgt\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"d91dde7c-96f0-41a7-820a-858b4996a624\",\"Name\":\"pasta de ghimbir si usturoi\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"tbsp\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"069e224a-9cd8-4627-81d6-93d429a95b1c\",\"Name\":\"unt topit\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"tbsp\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"a499d66a-9fe8-459e-8952-9b4e2fe3bacc\",\"Name\":\"sare\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"tbsp\",\"Order\":8},{\"Id\":\"1fbb645f-6b5a-4599-86bb-5565ec2b4c1b\",\"Name\":\"Se pun toate peste bucatile de pui si se lasa la marinat (fie 2 ore pe masa in bucatarie, fie peste noapte in frigider)\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":9},{\"Id\":\"8633581a-ded2-475a-9bd2-8bb7458f2f3e\",\"Name\":\"ce ramane de la marinada\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":10},{\"Id\":\"cff00be0-ff95-40da-9356-0eff6f658a98\",\"Name\":\"unt\",\"Amount\":75,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":11},{\"Id\":\"554f09d1-4a87-44c5-a441-de6d3f8a96b6\",\"Name\":\"pasta usturoi si ghimbir\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"tbsp\",\"Order\":12},{\"Id\":\"04365445-8b3e-49b0-911f-a5da5b662c6c\",\"Name\":\"turmeric\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"lgt\",\"Order\":13},{\"Id\":\"f39dcc75-fbd2-4f99-bf23-e4df527c6661\",\"Name\":\"garam masala\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"lgt\",\"Order\":14},{\"Id\":\"745087e1-578e-4c36-87b3-018565994149\",\"Name\":\"1/2 cup nuci caju hidratate\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":15},{\"Id\":\"f090d0a0-fbc0-4b73-b6d4-d3df7febf893\",\"Name\":\"sos rosii\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"cup\",\"Order\":16},{\"Id\":\"4f8c261c-73c8-4851-a218-1d837fb3609d\",\"Name\":\"miere\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"tbsp\",\"Order\":17},{\"Id\":\"c0f06cef-c569-41b7-82c8-b73ecd6ada6d\",\"Name\":\"smantana\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"tbsp\",\"Order\":18},{\"Id\":\"58cd9cc7-adb3-49e0-ae55-dff6961f0d4a\",\"Name\":\"sare\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":19}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"b2336d09-70e2-4759-8bab-ca84dba80b8f\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"Marinada: * 1/3 cup iaurt * 3/4 lingurita turmeric * 1 lingurita chilli * 1 lgt garam masala * 1 lg pasta de ghimbir si usturoi * 1 lg unt topit * 1 lg sare Se pun toate peste bucatile de pui si se lasa la marinat (fie 2 ore pe masa in bucatarie, fie peste noapte in frigider) Pentru sos: * ce ramane de la marinada * 75g unt * 1 lg pasta usturoi si ghimbir * 1 lgt turmeric * 1 lgt garam masala * 1/2 cup nuci caju hidratate * 1 cup sos rosii * 2 lg miere * 1 lg smantana * sare\"},{\"Id\":\"89f887f2-bfc2-4acc-8c97-4e110ffd9b6a\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Dupa ce s-au marinat, bucatile de pui se fac la grill sau in tigaie antiaderenta. Se scot si se tin la cald\"},{\"Id\":\"cb30ddbe-d35d-4eaf-a218-113254160eef\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Din nucile caju se face o pasta cu putin apa.\"},{\"Id\":\"1285d8e3-dcf7-4a5a-8eab-91279d32783d\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Se pune untul, ghimbirul si usturoiul intr-o cratita pe foc. Se adauga turmeric si chilli. Dupa ce se soteaza un pic se adauga sosul de rosii.\"},{\"Id\":\"e7b0c7c3-20f5-4684-bca5-80a4e348b577\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"Se adauga ce a ramas din marinada si garam-masala, apoi pasta de caju si mierea. Se amesteca bine sosul format si se blendeaza putin. Se lasa sa fiarba 3-4 minute.\"},{\"Id\":\"251ba448-cef1-4dda-9971-c9bf155def41\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"Se adauga lingura de smanatana si puiul. Se mai lasa 5 minute.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2226828",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2226828"
  },
  {
    "Id": "933CC5B9-011F-4A9B-BB3B-8FCC04BB3B0E",
    "Title": "Pulpe pui marinate la airfry",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Pulpe_pui_marinate_la_airfry.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 1,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"e7140245-77e6-4797-9c97-e4b45b90f897\",\"Name\":\"pulpe puiu superioare\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"5d0e3f9f-df7e-4b0a-99e7-590ba06ed767\",\"Name\":\"iaurt grecesc\",\"Amount\":150,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"14036e66-b965-46db-b70b-fa0b8746c5a7\",\"Name\":\"mustar\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"lgt\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"bbfccd91-1663-427d-a5c2-6e154c2dfc46\",\"Name\":\"4-5 catei usturoi\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"da9a92b6-cfb6-4ddc-ba13-246a455f0fbc\",\"Name\":\"sare, piper, boia,\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"166bd82b-4335-4edf-adc7-25e535c55967\",\"Name\":\"verdeturi (optional)\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":6}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"2920604b-1acc-4ce6-8ee1-c35f3ff93ac7\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"pulpe puiu superioare * 150g iaurt grecesc * 2 lgt mustar * 4-5 catei usturoi * sare, piper, boia, * verdeturi (optional)\"},{\"Id\":\"2dde092f-672a-49ed-ac07-9b67c196cbf5\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Se curata carnea. Separat se face marinada si se acopera pulpele. Se lasa la rece 2-3 ore sau peste noapte (sau pe masa in bucatarie pentru 1 ora)\"},{\"Id\":\"6eaff883-e617-4746-8359-6e8e5c3d9691\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Se pun in multicooker, 15 min la presiune. Se mai lasa 10 minute NR si apoi se deschide supapa.\"},{\"Id\":\"29c6adcf-ce9b-4246-94df-104d316273fe\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Se da drumul pentru 5-7 min la airfry pentru a capata crusta.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2227797",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2227797"
  },
  {
    "Id": "937AB422-5F17-436E-A7A3-CB436E802FE0",
    "Title": "Painici naan cu multa branza",
    "Description": "Un mic dejun hr\u0103nitor \u0219i s\u0103n\u0103tos, ideal pentru a \u00eencepe ziua. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Painici_naan_cu_multa_branza.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "Mic Dejun",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"e8e610cc-2385-49af-b02a-65d735b7e34c\",\"Name\":\"Aluat:\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"3973aefc-1c20-4aa2-abf1-07b7e28991d4\",\"Name\":\"faina pt paine\",\"Amount\":500,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"f13e1219-79da-4418-a5e8-3d610c188872\",\"Name\":\"lapte caldut\",\"Amount\":200,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"978e2ef9-c446-4011-8899-f0a948c24720\",\"Name\":\"iaurt gras\",\"Amount\":120,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"591b48bf-9507-4f62-be37-30e6182fb6d0\",\"Name\":\"drojdie uscat\\u0103\",\"Amount\":10,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"f41f0e76-fb96-4785-a584-c75555774549\",\"Name\":\"ulei de masline\",\"Amount\":20,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"f37a200a-35bb-4d1c-80da-cc5d2c666be2\",\"Name\":\"Umplutura, se amesteca toate:\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"0d05b5eb-2459-4e0e-b37c-1440586aa2dd\",\"Name\":\"br\\u00E2nz\\u0103 ras\\u0103 la alegere \\u00EEn func\\u021Bie de v\\u00E2rsta celor mici (eu am folosit Cheddar, Mozzarella \\u0219i burduf dar ai mei sunt mari deja)\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":8},{\"Id\":\"ec2a2085-4f22-4d94-8455-b2b60f0a5687\",\"Name\":\"4-5 c\\u0103\\u021Bei de usturoi f\\u0103cut past\\u0103\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":9},{\"Id\":\"b1b550b9-5c35-4620-b0d4-d36ef6e3d0d7\",\"Name\":\"Patrunjel verde\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":10}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"b72af0ff-0405-48cd-a824-3dd3a782a1d1\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"Aluat: 500g faina pt paine 200g lapte caldut 120g iaurt gras 10g drojdie uscat\\u0103 20g ulei de masline Umplutura, se amesteca toate: br\\u00E2nz\\u0103 ras\\u0103 la alegere \\u00EEn func\\u021Bie de v\\u00E2rsta celor mici (eu am folosit Cheddar, Mozzarella \\u0219i burduf dar ai mei sunt mari deja) 4-5 c\\u0103\\u021Bei de usturoi f\\u0103cut past\\u0103 Patrunjel verde\"},{\"Id\":\"168ba520-117c-49c3-bdb9-62d1c4af6abb\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"~Se framanta un aluat elastic \\u0219i nelipicios care se las\\u0103 la dospit 45 min.\"},{\"Id\":\"34d3e7ac-2fb7-4643-971f-99edd53295b7\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"~Se scoate aluatul din bol, se degazeaz\\u0103 (aplatizeaza) se fac c\\u00E2teva impaturiri dup\\u0103 care se las\\u0103 iar la dospit 45 min sau p\\u00E2n\\u0103 \\u00EE\\u0219i dubleaz\\u0103 volumul.\"},{\"Id\":\"83c1a5da-8b55-4ed4-b5f0-c0e48f78b3dc\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"~Se \\u00EEmparte aluatul \\u00EEn 8 bile \\u0219i se las\\u0103 la dospit 30 min.\"},{\"Id\":\"4a622cdc-4f50-4407-bf37-3a6f11bf0baa\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"~Fiecare bila de aluat se aplatizeaza, se a\\u0219eaz\\u0103 \\u00EEn mijloc br\\u00E2nza ras\\u0103 f\\u0103cut\\u0103 bilu\\u021Be \\u0219i se aduna aluatul \\u00EEn jurul br\\u00E2nzei, cu grija sa nu se gaureasca.\"},{\"Id\":\"f9a60800-315c-49b7-925f-79423c8b9b6c\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"~Se las\\u0103 la dospit 15 min (nu s\\u0103ri\\u021Bi peste acest pas! )\"},{\"Id\":\"96d7b140-2dc6-4463-8388-010a0c10652d\",\"StepNumber\":7,\"Text\":\"~Se \\u00EEntinde fiecare bila cu grija f\\u0103r\\u0103 sa \\u00EEntinde\\u021Bi pana \\u00EEn cap\\u0103t (asa evita\\u021Bi sa se gaureasca).\"},{\"Id\":\"c57b019f-6c34-4645-9b57-d0ca403e88ca\",\"StepNumber\":8,\"Text\":\"~ Se prajesc in tigaia \\u00EEncins\\u0103 pe foc mediu pe ambele p\\u0103r\\u021Bi pana cap\\u0103t\\u0103 o culoare aurie.\"},{\"Id\":\"331426d6-e013-490b-bb0a-98ee6f71a137\",\"StepNumber\":9,\"Text\":\"C\\u00E2nd au fost gata am uns fiecare panica cu un amestec din unt topit \\u0219i p\\u0103trunjel verde.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2228178",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2228178"
  },
  {
    "Id": "978E4292-F392-4EC5-9561-B051E142703D",
    "Title": "Tocana de legume",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Tocana_de_legume.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"205a1c4b-c6ba-40bf-a884-1f6db5bd36d3\",\"Name\":\"\\u27A2 1 leg\\u0103tur\\u0103 frunze de p\\u0103trunjel verde\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"b592650c-5311-4cc9-9923-951f5f2093d8\",\"Name\":\"\\u27A2 1 leg\\u0103tur\\u0103 m\\u0103rar verde\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"291cb34a-5fbb-4e8f-bb86-0435c7eb1b52\",\"Name\":\"\\u27A2 200g ro\\u0219ii\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"e78d36d1-c04a-477c-968d-7c829ecfb748\",\"Name\":\"\\u27A2 150g ceap\\u0103 t\\u0103iat\\u0103 sferturi\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"1b62dc72-bf96-42f3-aefa-f957e7698653\",\"Name\":\"\\u27A2 60g ulei\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"fb7ba55c-f2f7-4eaf-8646-daedc459fa4b\",\"Name\":\"\\u27A2 450g ap\\u0103\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"34861a0c-350e-4893-8c49-a91f89480cf2\",\"Name\":\"\\u27A2 70g past\\u0103 de tomate\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"04e657a3-e50c-4885-b008-751b94cfa70a\",\"Name\":\"\\u27A2 2 linguri\\u021Be sare\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":8},{\"Id\":\"2af1a4d2-b0dd-4b99-bfcb-e338d6d64547\",\"Name\":\"\\u27A2 \\u00BD linguri\\u021B\\u0103 piper\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":9},{\"Id\":\"2654b4f8-e2a2-40ae-9514-893c1afdcfd1\",\"Name\":\"\\u27A2 200g fasole verde congelat\\u0103\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":10},{\"Id\":\"91ff4476-217c-402d-8d2c-43ef0f679995\",\"Name\":\"\\u27A2 100g morcovi t\\u0103ia\\u021Bi rondele\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":11},{\"Id\":\"b4c3800e-a77c-42e6-ae47-66e9a04405b0\",\"Name\":\"\\u27A2 300g cartofi t\\u0103ia\\u021Bi cubule\\u021Be\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":12},{\"Id\":\"73a4420c-904d-4be0-83c4-18daeaba64cf\",\"Name\":\"\\u27A2 100g ardei gras ro\\u0219u t\\u0103iat cubule\\u021Be\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":13},{\"Id\":\"4c669cc6-433c-48a5-925c-681795aebee9\",\"Name\":\"\\u27A2 80g praz t\\u0103iat rondele\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":14},{\"Id\":\"31ab4816-0995-445e-abd6-38914c74fff5\",\"Name\":\"\\u27A2 200g dovlecel t\\u0103iat cubule\\u021Be\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":15},{\"Id\":\"49e1254e-16e7-4e2a-8c99-e198512d25f9\",\"Name\":\"\\u27A2 150g brocoli buche\\u021Bele mici\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":16},{\"Id\":\"729dead7-d85e-475a-a123-d88ca0270531\",\"Name\":\"\\u27A2 200g vinete t\\u0103iate cubule\\u021Be\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":17}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"6d04467d-7c36-4db7-afc4-2e93287a5fed\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"Ingrediente: \\u27A2 1 leg\\u0103tur\\u0103 frunze de p\\u0103trunjel verde \\u27A2 1 leg\\u0103tur\\u0103 m\\u0103rar verde \\u27A2 200g ro\\u0219ii \\u27A2 150g ceap\\u0103 t\\u0103iat\\u0103 sferturi \\u27A2 60g ulei \\u27A2 450g ap\\u0103 \\u27A2 70g past\\u0103 de tomate \\u27A2 2 linguri\\u021Be sare \\u27A2 \\u00BD linguri\\u021B\\u0103 piper \\u27A2 200g fasole verde congelat\\u0103 \\u27A2 100g morcovi t\\u0103ia\\u021Bi rondele \\u27A2 300g cartofi t\\u0103ia\\u021Bi cubule\\u021Be \\u27A2 100g ardei gras ro\\u0219u t\\u0103iat cubule\\u021Be \\u27A2 80g praz t\\u0103iat rondele \\u27A2 200g dovlecel t\\u0103iat cubule\\u021Be \\u27A2 150g brocoli buche\\u021Bele mici \\u27A2 200g vinete t\\u0103iate cubule\\u021Be\"},{\"Id\":\"9f6bebac-cbb8-462d-88b5-0c0c05dbc4c4\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"1 . Pune\\u0163i \\u00EEn bol verdea\\u0163a sp\\u0103lat\\u0103 \\u015Fi zv\\u00E2ntat\\u0103 cu ajutorul unui prosop absorbant \\u015Fi m\\u0103run\\u0163i\\u0163i 3 sec./viteza 8. Transfera\\u0163i \\u00EEntr-un vas \\u015Fi da\\u0163i deoparte.\"},{\"Id\":\"d1354d57-ab04-4436-b19a-1331a28c1cd9\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"2 . Pune\\u021Bi \\u00EEn bol ro\\u0219iile \\u0219i m\\u0103run\\u021Bi\\u021Bi 5 sec./viteza 9. Transfera\\u021Bi \\u00EEntr-un vas \\u0219i da\\u021Bi deoparte.\"},{\"Id\":\"58eaf08d-cc72-4945-9290-f5be96ff5b01\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"3 . Pune\\u021Bi \\u00EEn bol ceapa \\u0219i toca\\u021Bi 5 sec./viteza 5.\"},{\"Id\":\"2f012c94-5276-4ce7-91d5-ee36169c1441\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"4 . Cur\\u0103\\u021Ba\\u021Bi pere\\u021Bii bolului \\u0219i aduna\\u021Bi la baza bolului cu ajutorul spatulei, ad\\u0103uga\\u021Bi uleiul \\u0219i sotati 5 min./120\\u2103/viteza 1.\"},{\"Id\":\"a794fbb6-9a72-4b4a-beb1-9310a1340ff5\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"5 . Ad\\u0103uga\\u021Bi \\u00EEn bol apa, pasta de tomate, ro\\u0219iile m\\u0103run\\u021Bi\\u021Be sarea, piperul, pozi\\u021Biona\\u021Bi recipientul varoma \\u00EEn care ad\\u0103uga\\u021Bi fasolea verde congelat\\u0103, morcovii, cartofii, ardeiul gras ro\\u0219u, prazul, apoi pozi\\u021Biona\\u021Bi tava varoma peste recipientul varoma \\u00EEn care ad\\u0103uga\\u021Bi dovlecelul, brocoli, vinetele, acoperi\\u021Bi ansamblul varoma cu capacul varoma \\u0219i g\\u0103ti\\u021Bi 30 min./Varoma/viteza 0,5.\"},{\"Id\":\"ec7826d1-50e9-4758-97e0-6c58b6145061\",\"StepNumber\":7,\"Text\":\"6 . Transfera\\u021Bi legumele din tava \\u0219i recipientul varoma \\u00EEn bolul de mixare, amesteca\\u021Bi bine cu ajutorul spatulei \\u0219i regla\\u021Bi 5 min./100\\u2103/\\u27F2/viteza lingur\\u0103, ajut\\u00E2ndu-v\\u0103 de spatul\\u0103.\"},{\"Id\":\"b1267447-beb2-49f8-b7a9-70480dddafbe\",\"StepNumber\":8,\"Text\":\"7 . Ad\\u0103uga\\u021Bi verdea\\u021Ba m\\u0103run\\u021Bit\\u0103, amesteca\\u021Bi cu ajutorul spatulei \\u0219i servi\\u021Bi dup\\u0103 preferin\\u021Be.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2228582",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2228582"
  },
  {
    "Id": "97B04729-1D97-4C04-898C-100E88F27B3B",
    "Title": "Biscuiti cu ciocolata si portocala",
    "Description": "Un desert delicios care combin\u0103 savoarea unic\u0103 a ingredientelor \u00eentr-o re\u021bet\u0103 rafinat\u0103. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Biscuiti_cu_ciocolata_si_portocala.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "Desert",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"c9c1c1b8-9972-41ba-b8d0-a8107f7ba0ad\",\"Name\":\"de f\\u0103in\\u0103\",\"Amount\":200,\"Unit\":\"grame\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"23b129de-2415-45fa-adb9-02bee07df775\",\"Name\":\"de zah\\u0103r brun\",\"Amount\":40,\"Unit\":\"grame\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"913c7d19-573b-47a4-856e-8f4d62b2b442\",\"Name\":\"de unt la temperatura camerei\",\"Amount\":140,\"Unit\":\"grame\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"7b254508-b401-47e9-9d04-a76854146b44\",\"Name\":\"portocal\\u0103\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"c2e3f1c9-971e-49df-93d6-273cc0845a61\",\"Name\":\"coaj\\u0103 de portocal\\u0103 uscat\\u0103 ( op\\u021Bional, pute\\u021Bi folosi doar coaj\\u0103 de portocal\\u0103 proasp\\u0103t\\u0103)\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"f064d791-689c-4846-bd96-92f27070259c\",\"Name\":\"ciocolat\\u0103 alba\",\"Amount\":30,\"Unit\":\"grame\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"5b634d3c-46a9-47e0-9391-320124534334\",\"Name\":\"sos de ciocolat\\u0103 -eu aveam deja f\\u0103cut, \\u00EEns\\u0103 \\u00EEl pute\\u021Bi face rapid din 50 ml sm\\u00E2nt\\u00E2n\\u0103 lichid\\u0103 \\u0219i 30 grame ciocolat\\u0103 neagr\\u0103\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":7}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"2cecd9f5-1bed-43a9-941b-dd1f1f23848c\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"200 grame de f\\u0103in\\u0103 * 40 grame de zah\\u0103r brun * 140 grame de unt la temperatura camerei * 1 portocal\\u0103 * coaj\\u0103 de portocal\\u0103 uscat\\u0103 ( op\\u021Bional, pute\\u021Bi folosi doar coaj\\u0103 de portocal\\u0103 proasp\\u0103t\\u0103) * 30 grame ciocolat\\u0103 alba * sos de ciocolat\\u0103 -eu aveam deja f\\u0103cut, \\u00EEns\\u0103 \\u00EEl pute\\u021Bi face rapid din 50 ml sm\\u00E2nt\\u00E2n\\u0103 lichid\\u0103 \\u0219i 30 grame ciocolat\\u0103 neagr\\u0103\"},{\"Id\":\"7eb99212-cd08-47e4-bb11-b6e031ba355d\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"\\u00CEntr-un vas am ad\\u0103ugat unt \\u0219i zah\\u0103rul \\u0219i am mixat cu un tel c\\u00E2teva minute. Am ad\\u0103ugat \\u0219i coaja de portocala \\u0219i faina \\u0219i am \\u00EEnceput s\\u0103 fr\\u0103m\\u00E2nt u\\u0219or p\\u00E2n\\u0103 am avut un amestec nisipos. Am ad\\u0103ugat \\u0219i cubuletele de ciocolata alba \\u0219i am mai fr\\u0103m\\u00E2ntat pu\\u021Bin.\"},{\"Id\":\"b80475bf-6a81-4f25-b1de-60aafcd78e94\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Am tapetat o tav\\u0103 mic\\u0103 cu h\\u00E2rtie de copt \\u0219i am ad\\u0103ugat aluatul, pe care l-am aplatizat u\\u0219or \\u00EEn tav\\u0103, dup\\u0103 care l-am \\u00EEn\\u021Bepat pe alocuri cu o furculi\\u021B\\u0103.\"},{\"Id\":\"c566b842-e315-452f-902a-e186331f65aa\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Am b\\u0103gat tava la cuptorul pre\\u00EEnc\\u0103lzit la 200 de grade, timp de 22 de minute. Dup\\u0103 ce l-am scos, am mai pres\\u0103rat pu\\u021Bin zah\\u0103r brun \\u0219i am l\\u0103sat la r\\u0103cit complet p\\u00E2n\\u0103 am t\\u0103iat biscui\\u021Bii.\"},{\"Id\":\"8cead777-4863-4bcf-984c-ba42937bb88f\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"Pentru sosul de ciocolat\\u0103, am \\u00EEnc\\u0103lzit bine sm\\u00E2nt\\u00E2n\\u0103 lichid\\u0103, dup\\u0103 am ad\\u0103ugat-o peste ciocolat\\u0103 \\u0219i am amestecat p\\u00E2n\\u0103 s-a topit complet.\"},{\"Id\":\"4809c313-dd3a-4a39-b228-71e24202cd2d\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"Cu ajutorul unei furculi\\u021Be am stropit biscui\\u021Bii cu ciocolat\\u0103, am ad\\u0103ugat coaja de portocal\\u0103, iar pentru un plus de culoare, eu am ad\\u0103ugat \\u0219i pu\\u021Bin fistic m\\u0103run\\u021Bit.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2228971",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2228971"
  },
  {
    "Id": "9A4163B3-4C2F-416D-B2AA-44597313D95C",
    "Title": "Salata de lugume coapate",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
