    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"ef7e5eae-8938-4ceb-9eb1-3521c73b1362\",\"Name\":\"apa\",\"Amount\":250,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"2877bfdc-4ae1-47f9-ba70-33fda88d6512\",\"Name\":\"ulei de m\\u0103sline\",\"Amount\":75,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"4361412b-20fe-4274-aea1-fc3e8946537c\",\"Name\":\"zah\\u0103r\",\"Amount\":25,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"6115f169-602d-4455-bc48-47a737786f2f\",\"Name\":\"un cubule\\u021B de drojdie\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"cb01cf8f-e298-40c7-99e4-d23807a53730\",\"Name\":\"f\\u0103ina\",\"Amount\":500,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"159ac571-9e07-49b3-b5f1-f67ac1b36d38\",\"Name\":\"o linguri\\u021Ba de sare.\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":6}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"12559132-a697-4d0d-a1f5-6920e75b751c\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"250 g apa * 75 g ulei de m\\u0103sline * 25 g zah\\u0103r * un cubule\\u021B de drojdie * 500 g f\\u0103ina * o linguri\\u021Ba de sare.\"},{\"Id\":\"1b8f6c36-96c9-4ce7-a47c-1379b42cbae9\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"In bol lichidele apoi zaharul, sarea,f\\u0103ina \\u0219i ultima drojdia 3 min/ fr\\u0103m\\u00E2ntare .\"},{\"Id\":\"c6f5e8bf-cc8b-4b01-bf05-ee7c844104f4\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Se las\\u0103 la crescut cel pu\\u021Bin o ora, eu \\u00EEl las mult mai mult .\"},{\"Id\":\"c3765c1f-a934-4815-82e4-b34c9e6e1c40\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Se formeaz\\u0103 bilu\\u021Be , se aseaza in tava tapetata cu h\\u00E2rtie de copt \\u0219i se mai las\\u0103 o ora la crescut .\"},{\"Id\":\"ff2873ed-8f05-404e-883c-f8682d193b5a\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"Se ung cu ou, se presar\\u0103 semin\\u021Be \\u0219i se coc in cuptorul pre\\u00EEnc\\u0103lzit la 200 grade pt circa 15-20 min.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.22301",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.22301"
  },
  {
    "Id": "9CA8016C-7AFE-42AA-8CB0-96BBE1FFCC08",
    "Title": "Brownie cu capsuni (fara zahar adaugat)",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Brownie_cu_capsuni_(fara_zahar_adaugat",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"3dc06c09-f768-4ccb-bdbe-8acf13a4bd67\",\"Name\":\"f\\u0103in\\u0103\",\"Amount\":80,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"7365a121-7655-41df-ad3f-17aa4e822863\",\"Name\":\"ciocolat\\u0103 (eu am folosit ciocolat\\u0103 neagr\\u0103)\",\"Amount\":110,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"27edff17-2496-4233-b6e7-65d73b427628\",\"Name\":\"curmale\",\"Amount\":100,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"d6d45893-ac67-4a8a-8dc5-ee72d19b877f\",\"Name\":\"lapte vegetal (sau lapte de vaca)\",\"Amount\":50,\"Unit\":\"ml\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"2cfb4059-0a2e-4d9d-9828-8439c679cf06\",\"Name\":\"ou\\u0103 mici\",\"Amount\":3,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"9a2a9a81-62b9-4c06-a83a-6904ff4d78ac\",\"Name\":\"unt\",\"Amount\":90,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"2a620850-a48b-4d96-b055-82be49bec4a2\",\"Name\":\"pudr\\u0103 de cacao crud\\u0103\",\"Amount\":40,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"03c3fc6f-257c-4e37-a6e1-dead0552410f\",\"Name\":\"aprox. 50g c\\u0103p\\u0219uni\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":8}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"c639f632-17a0-4ced-9e80-d289de3f8fa0\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"80g f\\u0103in\\u0103 * 110g ciocolat\\u0103 (eu am folosit ciocolat\\u0103 neagr\\u0103) * 100g curmale * 50ml lapte vegetal (sau lapte de vaca) * 3 ou\\u0103 mici * 90g unt * 40g pudr\\u0103 de cacao crud\\u0103 * aprox. 50g c\\u0103p\\u0219uni\"},{\"Id\":\"993dfc77-ebf0-43f4-ada8-5d564c4cb84c\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Untul \\u0219i ciocolata le-am topit la _bain-marie_.\"},{\"Id\":\"3f9a583b-0600-4901-ac8d-cb62dd599a18\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Curmalele inmuiate si stoarse, laptele \\u0219i ou\\u0103le le-am mixat \\u00EEn blender.\"},{\"Id\":\"e3e8b8d9-a6ad-402f-870c-0a417f6f5238\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"\\u00CEn amestecul lichid de la pasul 2 am ad\\u0103ugat ingredientele uscate, f\\u0103ina \\u0219i pudra de cacao amestecate \\u00EEn prealabil. Cu ajutorul unui tel, am amestecat p\\u00E2n\\u0103 am ob\\u021Binut o compozi\\u021Bie omogen\\u0103.\"},{\"Id\":\"3b30bdbd-2f63-4611-8a48-b8fedeb00635\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"Am \\u00EEncorporat untul \\u0219i ciocolata topite (dup\\u0103 ce s-au r\\u0103corit pu\\u021Bin) \\u0219i c\\u0103p\\u0219unile t\\u0103iate \\u00EEn buc\\u0103\\u021Bele.\"},{\"Id\":\"6a8a88e2-f18c-4a75-9e3e-2b50ef4c098e\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"Am pus h\\u00E2rtie de copt \\u00EEntr-o tav\\u0103 cu dimensiunile de 17 x 13 cm\"},{\"Id\":\"f17bf33c-529a-4bad-bbf2-844cff32d324\",\"StepNumber\":7,\"Text\":\"Am dat pr\\u0103jitura la copt \\u00EEn cuptorul pre\\u00EEnc\\u0103lzit la 190\\u00B0 Celsius, timp de 20 de minute\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2230472",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2230472"
  },
  {
    "Id": "9D1AEFB4-CDD2-470A-9379-A3BA1B43D6E7",
    "Title": "Tiramisu oua la abur",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Tiramisu_oua_la_abur.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 1,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"081249c6-4638-4d9c-842f-f42953da1d88\",\"Name\":\"intregi\",\"Amount\":3,\"Unit\":\"oua\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"7abd3fcf-aab1-48c9-bc0b-9b196f35d025\",\"Name\":\"galbenusuri\",\"Amount\":3,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"60880d66-7267-4859-bf9a-1f35d5be0f29\",\"Name\":\"zahar tos\",\"Amount\":175,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"38907e8f-4c98-4f45-8ef8-57cf256132fd\",\"Name\":\"mascarpone\",\"Amount\":500,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"35e6bb3a-78bc-45da-b9f3-491fee995414\",\"Name\":\"cafea tare - espresso - sau suc de fructe\",\"Amount\":350,\"Unit\":\"ml\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"8d66c8d9-27a6-4f97-add3-b1ccc35f31f4\",\"Name\":\"vin licoros Marsala sau lichior Amaretto\",\"Amount\":30,\"Unit\":\"ml\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"24a681a1-2503-44ff-840e-9eec19685eec\",\"Name\":\"piscoturi\",\"Amount\":25,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"fcaaa511-4d7b-4bdf-a95b-02fc390dddf0\",\"Name\":\"pudra cacao\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":8}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"91777e6b-7cfb-40b3-b3df-8f4a2f3240cb\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"Ingrediente** * 3 oua intregi * 3 galbenusuri * 175 g zahar tos * 500 g mascarpone * 350 ml cafea tare - espresso - sau suc de fructe 30 ml vin licoros Marsala sau lichior Amaretto * 25 buc piscoturi * pudra cacao\"},{\"Id\":\"ae85c127-9aab-4a8b-9f09-9ed12354a85f\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Ouale cu zaharul se amesteca bine si se gatesc pe baie de aburi pana ating temperatura de 75o. Se lasa sa ajunga la temperatura camerei\"},{\"Id\":\"fc6ad042-daac-49c7-92f0-e77fa7735fc4\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Mascarponele se bate usor. Dupa ce s-a inmuiat, se adauga crema de oua si se bate pana se omogenizeaza.\"},{\"Id\":\"28c664dc-d8f1-414b-b00f-9129917db6a8\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Piscoturile se inmoaie in cafea/suc si se aseaza intr-o tava, peste crema, apoi iar piscoturi si iar crema. La final se pudreaza cu cacao (optional)\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2230875",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2230875"
  },
  {
    "Id": "9F448AAA-D7CD-4A32-966B-658B80647D5B",
    "Title": "Varza calita cu kaiser",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Varza_calita_cu_kaiser.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"9e041067-e808-4eb4-8cbe-ca30dedb438f\",\"Name\":\"kaizer afumat, chiar mai pu\\u021Bin dup\\u0103 spusele so\\u021Bului\",\"Amount\":300,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"da6fa483-2016-4be9-a6db-95b0e3e46cd1\",\"Name\":\"varza crud\\u0103 tocata (sweetheart cabbage)\",\"Amount\":700,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"652c7556-03d9-4880-b14f-7ef0cf0d302a\",\"Name\":\"(de m\\u0103rimea unui ou)\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"cepe\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"c78a30f1-2976-475b-b910-3dc11d675d6f\",\"Name\":\"stock de legume\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"644575a7-a65c-4d8e-87e7-c2deeafbd84d\",\"Name\":\"linguri\\u021Be de piure de tomate concentrat\",\"Amount\":3,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"b1de544c-dbd5-48b7-a04c-23816241fc18\",\"Name\":\"ap\\u0103\",\"Amount\":220,\"Unit\":\"ml\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"39e447a6-e6a4-433c-a24b-56426b8b36e6\",\"Name\":\"piper, m\\u0103rar verde\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":7}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"28f1a6b7-2ab3-4d8a-b7a0-348c5749b232\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"300g kaizer afumat, chiar mai pu\\u021Bin dup\\u0103 spusele so\\u021Bului 700g varza crud\\u0103 tocata (sweetheart cabbage) 2 cepe (de m\\u0103rimea unui ou) stock de legume 3 linguri\\u021Be de piure de tomate concentrat 220 ml ap\\u0103 piper, m\\u0103rar verde\"},{\"Id\":\"2a5737a9-8348-43cc-b7fa-e7e9e284b139\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Am preg\\u0103tit sosul din ap\\u0103 fierbinte, stockul de legume \\u0219i pasta de tomate, cantitatea total\\u0103 a fost de 250 ml, am amestecat p\\u00E2n\\u0103 la omogenizare.\"},{\"Id\":\"148524ea-5298-449f-af4a-efb10b7bea76\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Pentru siguran\\u021Ba adaug\\u0103 mai mult\\u0103 ap\\u0103 dac\\u0103 folose\\u0219ti alt tip de varz\\u0103.\"},{\"Id\":\"ba00d06b-3c14-4dd4-8543-6ef49e8c3496\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Am pus ceapa tocata \\u0219i kaizerul cuburi pe Saut\\u00E9 p\\u00E2n\\u0103 c\\u00E2nd ceapa a devenit sticloasa, a durat 7 min.\"},{\"Id\":\"ac234b94-2903-4b20-aee3-febb807a769d\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"Am ad\\u0103ugat varza tocat\\u0103 \\u0219i peste ea sosul de ro\\u0219ii \\u0219i am amestecat.\"},{\"Id\":\"274bfb91-641a-4d3d-8590-7e9486e199b6\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"Am pornit programul LP 2 minute.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2231229",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2231229"
  },
  {
    "Id": "A20EF75D-5470-4791-B91D-FAC994362BD3",
    "Title": "Rulada de biscuiti cu cocos",
    "Description": "Un desert delicios care combin\u0103 savoarea unic\u0103 a ingredientelor \u00eentr-o re\u021bet\u0103 rafinat\u0103. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Rulada_de_biscuiti_cu_cocos.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "Desert",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"ed075491-fad1-4756-9c4f-b2752cf6d98a\",\"Name\":\"Rulada\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"b107e2db-6bea-4811-8db4-e1e3d1d173f9\",\"Name\":\"biscui\\u021Bi simpli (eu am folosit petit beurre, \\u00EEns\\u0103 se poate folosi orice fel de biscui\\u021Bi)\",\"Amount\":400,\"Unit\":\"grame\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"fc2e45d7-d2fc-44a4-afd3-86a6811c59e0\",\"Name\":\"zah\\u0103r\",\"Amount\":65,\"Unit\":\"grame\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"428204ae-5090-4f75-88be-4877c09ff5f8\",\"Name\":\"de cacao\",\"Amount\":20,\"Unit\":\"grame\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"623b235c-40fe-43c5-ab7d-1c818f9247dc\",\"Name\":\"lapte\",\"Amount\":300,\"Unit\":\"ml\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"66f0898e-b26f-4ce9-8b77-0bc5cffc1320\",\"Name\":\"unt\",\"Amount\":100,\"Unit\":\"grame\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"2d2564ef-0192-4194-b023-8d44663c04a3\",\"Name\":\"Un pic de sare\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"0b73574d-5b3f-4e2f-a35f-2ca5a9ad9b3c\",\"Name\":\"Esen\\u021B\\u0103 de rom\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":8},{\"Id\":\"56894c64-d86d-494c-a2c7-c4dd8ddfb307\",\"Name\":\"Umplutura\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":9},{\"Id\":\"7bfcbfa1-e853-421f-b3cf-c9f6ffedd0ef\",\"Name\":\"mascarpone\",\"Amount\":250,\"Unit\":\"grame\",\"Order\":10},{\"Id\":\"fd71c25a-33d3-4e30-817c-5bfda68fc322\",\"Name\":\"fulgi de cocos\",\"Amount\":100,\"Unit\":\"grame\",\"Order\":11},{\"Id\":\"5b53ee1e-8ae6-4944-a089-8ff9d245a65e\",\"Name\":\"2-3 linguri de zah\\u0103r (\\u00EEn func\\u021Bie de c\\u00E2t de dulce prefera\\u021Bi)\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":12}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"62046493-0178-4217-8889-d65065365a9f\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"Rulada * 400 grame biscui\\u021Bi simpli (eu am folosit petit beurre, \\u00EEns\\u0103 se poate folosi orice fel de biscui\\u021Bi) * 65 grame zah\\u0103r * 20 grame de cacao * 300 ml lapte * 100 grame unt * Un pic de sare * Esen\\u021B\\u0103 de rom Umplutura * 250 grame mascarpone * 100 grame fulgi de cocos * 2-3 linguri de zah\\u0103r (\\u00EEn func\\u021Bie de c\\u00E2t de dulce prefera\\u021Bi)\"},{\"Id\":\"bf5e4606-a99e-469f-85b8-c37e900092f0\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"\\u00CEn primul r\\u00E2nd am pus \\u00EEntr-o crati\\u021B\\u0103 mic\\u0103, la topit, untul, laptele, zah\\u0103rul \\u0219i cacaoa. Dup\\u0103 ce s-a topit untul \\u0219i zah\\u0103rul, le-am dat la o parte de pe foc, le-am amestecat \\u0219i le-am l\\u0103sat la r\\u0103cit.\"},{\"Id\":\"fff09203-0f14-4a7c-a368-838e2cb361d7\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"\\u00CEntre timp am f\\u0103cut \\u0219i crema. \\u00CEntr-un castron am pus ingredientele pentru crem\\u0103 \\u0219i le-am amestecat bine, p\\u00E2n\\u0103 zah\\u0103rul s-a topit. Am pus deoparte.\"},{\"Id\":\"25d3024b-9f58-4356-b485-eb24e3b7a508\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Apoi, cu ajutorul unui blender sau cum dore\\u0219te fiecare, m\\u0103run\\u021Bim foarte fin biscui\\u021Bii, pe care \\u00EE\\u00EE punem \\u00EEntr-un castron \\u00EEnc\\u0103p\\u0103tor.\"},{\"Id\":\"d90a1ea1-1dc9-4f15-94b5-1aa2d56ebc7f\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"Dup\\u0103 ce laptele s-a r\\u0103cit, am ad\\u0103ugat \\u00EEn el esen\\u021Ba de rom \\u0219i un praf de sare. Am amestecat \\u0219i am pus peste biscui\\u021Bi.\"},{\"Id\":\"425385d7-2018-4f3c-9240-71c5ff3b5dcd\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"Le-am \\u00EEncorporat bine, p\\u00E2n\\u0103 s-a format un aluat tare \\u0219i nelipicios.\"},{\"Id\":\"d492f08c-f813-4463-b2ec-8064d9f98399\",\"StepNumber\":7,\"Text\":\"Pe masa de lucru am pus dou\\u0103 folii transparente, c\\u00E2t s\\u0103 o ocupe o suprafa\\u021B\\u0103 mai mare. Peste am pus aluatul de biscui\\u021Bi, iar deasupra \\u00EEnc\\u0103 dou\\u0103 folii. Apoi cu ajutorul unui f\\u0103c\\u0103le\\u021B am \\u00EEntins aluatul sub\\u021Bire.\"},{\"Id\":\"80c0b769-e739-4097-ad4e-c796a8447b24\",\"StepNumber\":8,\"Text\":\"Peste, am \\u00EEntins crema de cocos cu groij\\u0103 s\\u0103 nu rupem aluatul de biscui\\u021Bi.\"},{\"Id\":\"fb7b5561-c336-4875-b8cb-265c86244a9a\",\"StepNumber\":9,\"Text\":\"Am rulat apoi cu grij\\u0103, ajut\\u00E2ndu-m\\u0103 de folia alimentar\\u0103. Dup\\u0103 ce am rulat rulada cu cocos, mi-am dat seama c\\u0103 este foarte lung\\u0103. Dac\\u0103 nu v\\u0103 place a\\u0219a, pute\\u021Bi \\u00EEmp\\u0103r\\u021Bi \\u00EEn 2 compozi\\u021Bia, si face 2 rulade.\"},{\"Id\":\"06a58caf-a059-41fe-a810-7703c6abf931\",\"StepNumber\":10,\"Text\":\"Am pus la frigider p\\u00E2n\\u0103 a doua zi, s\\u0103 fiu sigur\\u0103 c\\u0103 iese ceea ce trebuie.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2231633",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2231633"
  },
  {
    "Id": "A2E1B4E2-4A0D-481A-8F90-E40C73CCCFD8",
    "Title": "Sarmale",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 tradi\u021bional\u0103 rom\u00e2neasc\u0103, preg\u0103tit\u0103 dup\u0103 re\u021beta clasic\u0103. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Sarmale.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 1,
    "CuisineType": "Rom\u00e2neasc\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"76a10173-4609-41e9-ba36-fd302505bf44\",\"Name\":\"varza\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"6b498458-b9b7-4d9b-a54a-c151f8cfe879\",\"Name\":\"carne tocata \\u002B slanina (sau carne afumata)\",\"Amount\":500,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"33d398d3-4809-4b91-ab84-25520a49f77e\",\"Name\":\"60-75gr orez cu bob rotund\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"a4c3a5dc-dd46-4a99-8e8f-a7c1e6eddcc9\",\"Name\":\"ceapa\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"8f066dc4-1095-45df-864c-8339c00cea36\",\"Name\":\"cimbru\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"ab2b5176-4fea-4711-9df7-2dcd829fb13f\",\"Name\":\"sare, piper, boia\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"ec75cec3-895e-4973-a2ac-8aa3e197d6a3\",\"Name\":\"ulei\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":7}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"4b3eaee8-f850-48ea-a9bb-ee023f97c8c1\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"1 varza * 500 gr carne tocata \\u002B slanina (sau carne afumata) * 60-75gr orez cu bob rotund * 1 ceapa * cimbru * sare, piper, boia * ulei\"},{\"Id\":\"be7e9512-143e-41cb-96c4-211c80e5e16e\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Ceapa se caleste in putin ulei, dupda care se adauga orezul spalat si zvantat.\"},{\"Id\":\"063f6675-7d82-4c83-a47c-7fe01d830a7f\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Dupa ce s-a racit se adauga peste carne, se pun si condimentele si se amesteca bine.\"},{\"Id\":\"3218f2c8-d8f7-4da3-8145-2d9ded97d296\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Se invart sarmalele si se pun in oala cu carne afumata si suc de rosii, crengute de cimbru si marar la fiert, sau se pun in punga la congelator.\"},{\"Id\":\"76e68588-cadb-4c3d-a91c-68bd6f263fb6\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"Din cotoarele si frunzeloe mici de varza se toaca si se folosesc pe fundul oalei sau deasupra.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2232052",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2232052"
  },
  {
    "Id": "A41B559F-1712-4219-8F47-380215C8FAED",
    "Title": "Budinca Yorkshire",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Budinca_Yorkshire.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"e3981b7b-d5b6-4b0e-99ad-b87f6b2d5d84\",\"Name\":\"ou\\u0103\",\"Amount\":3,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"722f0780-f91b-48f8-a1fa-7641948fa0e4\",\"Name\":\"lapte\",\"Amount\":250,\"Unit\":\"ml\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"f285cf3e-1949-4e5e-b147-e45c5087b04c\",\"Name\":\"unt\",\"Amount\":40,\"Unit\":\"grame\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"d5d6ab34-44e4-4514-b26b-0b155a23bbc3\",\"Name\":\"f\\u0103in\\u0103\",\"Amount\":100,\"Unit\":\"grame\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"b807ab06-82d4-4c98-90ee-183ab444f6c3\",\"Name\":\"sare\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"d07c5818-95a9-4373-a1d8-d138699213cf\",\"Name\":\"ierburi aromatice\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"b352b574-7dbe-4105-95bb-cfdbeac823fb\",\"Name\":\"bacon\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"184a3d91-2d04-4231-b72f-e99c68cf7ab3\",\"Name\":\"mozzarella ras\\u0103\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":8},{\"Id\":\"a9bed5e1-5544-4e13-a00a-0f0cc3af5425\",\"Name\":\"felii de br\\u00E2nz\\u0103 brie\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":9},{\"Id\":\"42812a2d-72c0-475f-aa98-b12bafee7cda\",\"Name\":\"ceap\\u0103 verde\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":10}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"ee5a6ba9-c18c-4ac4-831a-f1e187a1a7cb\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"3 ou\\u0103 * 250 ml lapte * 40 grame unt * 100 grame f\\u0103in\\u0103 * sare * ierburi aromatice * bacon * mozzarella ras\\u0103 * felii de br\\u00E2nz\\u0103 brie * ceap\\u0103 verde\"},{\"Id\":\"ac42a3b9-58ad-4b00-aab3-ef73658fb894\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Am \\u00EEnceput prin a porni cuptorul la 180 de grade \\u0219i am b\\u0103gat \\u00EEn cuptor \\u0219i tigaia \\u00EEn care urma s\\u0103 preg\\u0103tesc budinca, pentru a fi \\u00EEncins\\u0103 \\u0219i aceasta.\"},{\"Id\":\"a6891217-c2ee-48be-a4ca-c10d8dc40f10\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Apoi am amestecat laptele cu ou\\u0103le, p\\u00E2n\\u0103 am omogenizat, iar dup\\u0103 am ad\\u0103ugat sarea \\u0219i ierburile aromatice, iar apoi faina \\u0219i am amestecat cu un tel p\\u00E2n\\u0103 am ob\\u021Binut o compozi\\u021Bie fin\\u0103.\"},{\"Id\":\"939d21b4-730a-4420-8f9b-5925eca28d5c\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Dup\\u0103 ce tigaia s-a \\u00EEncins, am ad\\u0103ugat cubul de unt \\u0219i am l\\u0103sat s\\u0103 se topeasc\\u0103.\"},{\"Id\":\"70a841c4-ff62-4389-a624-b7bb8961445e\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"Dupa ce untul s-a topit, am turnat compozi\\u021Bia \\u00EEn tigaia \\u00EEncins\\u0103, am ad\\u0103ugat buc\\u0103\\u021Bele de bacon pr\\u0103jit, mozzarella ras\\u0103 \\u0219i am b\\u0103gat \\u00EEnapoi la cuptor timp de 30 de minute.\"},{\"Id\":\"0c1f5456-6c68-4343-9770-3d5907d5583e\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"Dup\\u0103 ce am scos budinca din cuptor, am ad\\u0103ugat ceap\\u0103 verde \\u0219i felii de br\\u00E2nz\\u0103 brie.\"},{\"Id\":\"553b9eb8-abdb-4d8d-8b8b-c9a26fe51483\",\"StepNumber\":7,\"Text\":\"Este un preparat super simplu \\u0219i delicios, care merge de minune l\\u00E2ng\\u0103 o salat\\u0103.\"},{\"Id\":\"0cee6ab5-965f-4194-9261-a4d437297e86\",\"StepNumber\":8,\"Text\":\"Daca vre\\u021Bi s\\u0103 preg\\u0103ti\\u021Bi varianta dulce, pur \\u0219i simplu omite\\u021Bi condimentele \\u0219i ingredientele s\\u0103rate \\u0219i la final adauga\\u021Bi zah\\u0103r pudr\\u0103 \\u0219i dulcea\\u021B\\u0103 sau fructe proaspete.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2232432",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2232432"
  },
  {
    "Id": "A567A9EA-7E0B-4297-AE53-75EAB0D091C9",
    "Title": "Orez cu lapte egiptean",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Orez_cu_lapte_egiptean.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"81b4c599-7d12-4d6e-b1bb-43c2e5d42fbc\",\"Name\":\"(**100**) gr orez cu bob rotund ( sau 35 gr mai mult ) * 50 (**25-30**) gr unt * 1\",\"Amount\":250,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"e72da5ab-8152-4fd3-a1de-fd334d8cdd17\",\"Name\":\"(**600ml**) lapte * 120 (**50**) ml smantana pentru frisca * 130 (**40-45**) gr zahar * Vanilie\",\"Amount\":5,\"Unit\":\"l\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"19451622-0164-4b3f-8c1e-71a2e3b93b3d\",\"Name\":\"cel mai bine pastaie * 30 gr cocos * Decor : fructe uscate\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"f1dc19fd-828a-4076-9019-4b4d8ba52138\",\"Name\":\"stafide\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"7db717fc-f128-4e57-a396-d2a5b2e76a3c\",\"Name\":\"cocos\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"dfc9b025-fc5a-4bc3-826f-1ba8f6747a28\",\"Name\":\"coaja de lamaie !\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":6}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"6ddf35a7-fec9-41b7-9401-a6f976c3a93f\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"250 (**100**) gr orez cu bob rotund ( sau 35 gr mai mult )\"},{\"Id\":\"7808ff18-ed1e-4ba2-a066-131ca55b62b4\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"50 (**25-30**) gr unt\"},{\"Id\":\"4a6e631c-636a-4bbb-a7a4-b3d153b82346\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"1 , 5l (**600ml**) lapte\"},{\"Id\":\"285fd040-6097-44e4-a994-3227277aefa3\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"120 (**50**) ml smantana pentru frisca\"},{\"Id\":\"1b063c5c-1e9b-4eab-96b0-73f7379f0394\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"130 (**40-45**) gr zahar\"},{\"Id\":\"57f75953-937c-4b12-bc3c-deba4039c40c\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"Vanilie , cel mai bine pastaie\"},{\"Id\":\"e64ca433-a9b1-4a6a-affe-482c4bd8267a\",\"StepNumber\":7,\"Text\":\"Decor : fructe uscate , stafide , cocos , coaja de lamaie !\"},{\"Id\":\"d2710564-2a13-4bfe-87f3-42109eab42f8\",\"StepNumber\":8,\"Text\":\"1 - inmuiat orezul 15 min in apa si scurs\"},{\"Id\":\"13e120c0-f62a-4b3b-90d1-a1e2488941c3\",\"StepNumber\":9,\"Text\":\"2 - incalzit untul **5 min / 100 \\u00B0 vit lingura**\"},{\"Id\":\"c4680dbf-1d6f-404c-9ec8-9fce19f8fded\",\"StepNumber\":10,\"Text\":\"3 - montat fluturasul , se adauga laptele , orezul scurs bine ,smantana , zaharul , cocosul , vanilia ( eu am pus zaharul si vanilia spre final cu 10 min inainte de a se termina ) **30 min / 90 \\u00B0 / vit 1** ( in reteta sunt 50 min , este prea mult )\"},{\"Id\":\"1074dd24-232a-4dd6-a8e6-98f06d786144\",\"StepNumber\":11,\"Text\":\"4.Se lasa 20 min la in vasul thermomix\"},{\"Id\":\"82c7ada6-4a5c-48f5-af0b-964479937399\",\"StepNumber\":12,\"Text\":\"5 . Se serveste un cupe sau boluri decorate cu fructe uscate , dupa gustul fiecaruia .\"},{\"Id\":\"3bfbad6b-0a0b-4ab8-8dbd-588393a9af86\",\"StepNumber\":13,\"Text\":\"Se poate folosi orice lapte si smantana de origine vegetala\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2232762",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2232762"
  },
  {
    "Id": "A863851F-1ED5-46B8-B985-1561223A51CA",
    "Title": "Saratele cu leurda si branza de vaci (gogosi)",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Saratele_cu_leurda_si_branza_de_vaci_(gogosi",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"f97e1785-9e1c-4c4a-a5ee-196153a7090b\",\"Name\":\"frunze leurda\",\"Amount\":50,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"669e242c-f022-4916-84aa-f91aed3270f7\",\"Name\":\"branza vaci, bine stoarsa\",\"Amount\":500,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"a230d627-4d40-4189-9985-fa2fd6ab432f\",\"Name\":\"oua\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"f8a4b862-ecd4-4220-bde2-3961476969f7\",\"Name\":\"unt (gras 80%)\",\"Amount\":125,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"4d2f99b0-67cd-48b6-9aa9-b2efcb773262\",\"Name\":\"apa (optional, daca branza e mai umeda, nu puneti)\",\"Amount\":100,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"77cc9847-61a9-442a-92f9-b6205da7783c\",\"Name\":\"400-450 g faina\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"047e2d0c-319e-4724-a619-a59fd2633719\",\"Name\":\"sare\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"tsp\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"cf1e2551-557d-42ab-8083-ec28b497fccf\",\"Name\":\"zahar\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"priza\",\"Order\":8},{\"Id\":\"dc4b3538-82ae-400a-b6c8-807caba8491a\",\"Name\":\"(optional 1 lingurita praf de copt)\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":9}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"f8ad4921-a1e0-473d-83cc-422d31aae077\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"Pun leurda, toc 10 sec, vit 6, adaug restul de ingrediente.\"},{\"Id\":\"010447b6-4b23-423b-bb82-8d2bea58d981\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Setez Framantare, 1 minut. Curat peretii bolului\"},{\"Id\":\"01d60a01-fa11-4d6a-9007-5527542ab016\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Setez iar Framantare 1 min.\"},{\"Id\":\"5aeb3880-d554-42a6-90e8-e4b9a9d44224\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Aluatul va fi lipicios, dar infainam mana si blatul si poate fi lucrat.\"},{\"Id\":\"2e5b1cac-e013-4d1d-a542-323d7b997901\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"Intind cu mana in strat gros (cca 2 - 3 cm)\"},{\"Id\":\"71a497c3-6bdc-4a00-8b5f-f55e499e1741\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"Tai cu o canuta forme rotunde.\"},{\"Id\":\"460d0133-09f3-4154-8262-1689c5d4e051\",\"StepNumber\":7,\"Text\":\"Coc cca 30 min, 180 grade, pana se rumenesc usor.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-13 14:54:56.9200489",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-13 14:54:56.9200489"
  },
  {
    "Id": "ADD76C59-415E-445C-BEDD-EC3ABA990042",
    "Title": "Lasagna cu dovlecei",
    "Description": "Un clasic italian autentic, plin de gust \u0219i tradi\u021bie culinar\u0103. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Lasagna_cu_dovlecei.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "Italian\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"0935faa6-01d3-4b13-aaba-36e074a50016\",\"Name\":\"[sos de rosii](https://jamilacuisine.ro/sos-de-rosii-reteta-video/)\",\"Amount\":500,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"0ddc520e-033a-4b43-8008-bca50ddf3005\",\"Name\":\"branza dulce de vaci dietetica\",\"Amount\":500,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"808013f5-84c7-4090-bc83-87d07b8da93e\",\"Name\":\"mozzarella rasa\",\"Amount\":200,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"1ad095f2-bc9a-4917-b2c9-073ff748820f\",\"Name\":\"branza de burduf\",\"Amount\":50,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"97fba77c-2dcc-49ed-b115-1fa614514ab1\",\"Name\":\"dovlecei\",\"Amount\":4,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"f99cfcf2-3226-461c-a354-2c0b4edce2ff\",\"Name\":\"oua\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"12bc0a47-0b61-41fe-8d31-e43042a2d186\",\"Name\":\"ulei\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"tbsp\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"1c9a787f-e0a6-4738-889c-2e3fc0116735\",\"Name\":\"piept de pui tocat\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"kg\",\"Order\":8},{\"Id\":\"ef157108-2365-4cb5-9b59-9e6e073f0dd7\",\"Name\":\"mare tocata marut\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"ceapa\",\"Order\":9},{\"Id\":\"54347fba-3981-4cb1-bb8c-6d935ae72b73\",\"Name\":\"putin oregano\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":10},{\"Id\":\"9bec57f6-3d56-411a-84fb-8794f2fc0334\",\"Name\":\"sare\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":11},{\"Id\":\"bcde4995-024d-4bb0-93d6-86b14a65293c\",\"Name\":\"piper\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":12}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"29029032-99e7-4670-9f6c-381b41b81525\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"500 g [sos de rosii](https://jamilacuisine.ro/sos-de-rosii-reteta-video/) * 500 g branza dulce de vaci dietetica * 200 g mozzarella rasa * 50 g branza de burduf * 4 dovlecei * 2 oua * 2 linguri ulei * 1 kg piept de pui tocat * 1 ceapa mare tocata marut * putin oregano * sare * piper\"},{\"Id\":\"dd128279-c46c-49ab-a2b2-875c1da96141\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Taiem dovleceii pe lungime in felii subtiri si se dau la gratar pentru 3-4 minute.\"},{\"Id\":\"fe688ad0-561d-4da5-8bfc-2d76b33a614e\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Se scot si se lasa la racit.\"},{\"Id\":\"1227e7d0-777b-456d-8aa1-237692c19dcf\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Intr-o tigaie se pune uleiukl, ceapa si sarea. Cand ceapa este inmuiata se adauga carnea de pui, sare,piper si oregano. Lasam pana se caleste puiul, apoi se adauga sosul de rosii. Le lasam sa mai fiarba pentru 10 min.\"},{\"Id\":\"2f55ca39-3928-47e4-a032-50195ee9969d\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"Branza dulce se amesteca cu ouale, sare, branza de burduf, si un pic de mozzarella.\"},{\"Id\":\"ee0c1329-41b7-422b-8e2a-ed7915fb8dfe\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"Se ansambleaza . Se pune un strat de dovlecei, apoi sos de branza, apoi carne, si o luam de la capat. Terminam cu sos de branza, peste care se adauga mozzarella rasa.\"},{\"Id\":\"d08f4793-bf06-4dd9-b82b-33905d47c92c\",\"StepNumber\":7,\"Text\":\"Se da la cuptor la 180 grade, vreo 40-50 min pana se rumeneste deasupra. Se poate taia mai bine cand e rece\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2233509",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2233509"
  },
  {
    "Id": "B31E965F-7177-4912-A61A-62EC24DC053D",
