    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"1033b91e-f687-4860-b367-8b764c44442e\",\"Name\":\"ou\\u0103\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"cf978338-b27e-4d57-afd2-7c05afdd824b\",\"Name\":\"iaurt grecesc\",\"Amount\":140,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"fb541dc4-e5ce-4823-a335-50bb3fc32b68\",\"Name\":\"lapte\",\"Amount\":200,\"Unit\":\"ml\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"8a70499f-32da-4558-8568-ab3217074241\",\"Name\":\"ulei\",\"Amount\":50,\"Unit\":\"ml\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"f3d7625b-8624-4145-b85e-0067cd285d6b\",\"Name\":\"f\\u0103in\\u0103 650\",\"Amount\":200,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"6c3cee48-c3f4-4e12-88a7-2108a49942c4\",\"Name\":\"f\\u0103in\\u0103 de ov\\u0103z sau fulgi de ov\\u0103z m\\u0103run\\u021Bi\\u021Bi\",\"Amount\":50,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"3f325df3-be28-4621-b4d2-87738e740b17\",\"Name\":\"mere\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"d6755f9f-8ee6-4fa9-8941-b31575643694\",\"Name\":\"Scor\\u021Bi\\u0219oar\\u0103 ceylon\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":8},{\"Id\":\"769e53b7-ec50-47cb-a12d-cce70d23fa16\",\"Name\":\"1/2 linguri\\u021B\\u0103 bicarbonat\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":9}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"1e30f094-b891-489c-9014-503ad71d97c4\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"2 ou\\u0103 * 140 g iaurt grecesc * 200 ml lapte * 50 ml ulei * 200 g f\\u0103in\\u0103 650 * 50 g f\\u0103in\\u0103 de ov\\u0103z sau fulgi de ov\\u0103z m\\u0103run\\u021Bi\\u021Bi * 2 mere * Scor\\u021Bi\\u0219oar\\u0103 ceylon * 1/2 linguri\\u021B\\u0103 bicarbonat\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.223388",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.223388"
  },
  {
    "Id": "B4B15BD4-AD28-4267-A9F6-4ADF87FDBC7F",
    "Title": "Tort de toamna",
    "Description": "Un desert delicios care combin\u0103 savoarea unic\u0103 a ingredientelor \u00eentr-o re\u021bet\u0103 rafinat\u0103. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Tort_de_toamna.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "Desert",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"2d820c0b-1439-45bf-8ba0-3d909046b221\",\"Name\":\"faina 000\",\"Amount\":320,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"367161cf-c2ec-4cc6-9119-3d4da5d40c1b\",\"Name\":\"praf de copt\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"pliculet\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"2758c76c-30a0-47ce-bae6-be33e5d6fcb3\",\"Name\":\"mix de condimente pentru tarte\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"tsp\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"29635b9f-4c0a-4af5-a8e1-d893bbba7a66\",\"Name\":\"zahar brun\",\"Amount\":250,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"8f595537-b932-41a5-bb87-ae703f6483ec\",\"Name\":\"ulei de floarea soarelui\",\"Amount\":180,\"Unit\":\"ml\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"4c302e65-01c3-48bf-a38d-ca19cba62696\",\"Name\":\"piure de mar (piure de dovleac)\",\"Amount\":200,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"548ed2bd-3e99-439e-9e82-66ad1d6a4a21\",\"Name\":\"mari\",\"Amount\":4,\"Unit\":\"oua\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"683f87d3-8502-4bdb-8e20-778a9d789f78\",\"Name\":\"extract de vanilie\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"tsp\",\"Order\":8},{\"Id\":\"3e20036e-eb40-478d-ba0f-a66e7c4ff4a5\",\"Name\":\"lapte batut (am pus iaurt)\",\"Amount\":250,\"Unit\":\"ml\",\"Order\":9},{\"Id\":\"d32d6638-4e10-4e78-81d4-d34f3139e042\",\"Name\":\"nuci (alune)\",\"Amount\":200,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":10},{\"Id\":\"b86483d0-669d-48d3-9587-c3cdf95be4a5\",\"Name\":\"crema de branza natur (eu am folosit philadelphia)\",\"Amount\":350,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":11},{\"Id\":\"e51b176c-99a2-43ed-bf67-bab87bafe368\",\"Name\":\"unt moale, la t camerei\",\"Amount\":100,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":12},{\"Id\":\"6600c50a-22a3-481e-85a0-eadb8939e1e0\",\"Name\":\"zahr pudra vanilat\",\"Amount\":300,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":13}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"d1524cfc-bbf2-49db-aa97-64e08a2a0d54\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"Ingrediente blat * 320g faina 000 * 1 pliculet praf de copt * 2 lingurite mix de condimente pentru tarte * 250g zahar brun * 180ml ulei de floarea soarelui * 200g piure de mar (piure de dovleac) * 4 oua mari * 1 lingurita extract de vanilie * 250ml lapte batut (am pus iaurt) * 200g nuci (alune) Ingrediente crema * 350g crema de branza natur (eu am folosit philadelphia) * 100g unt moale, la t camerei * 300g zahr pudra vanilat\"},{\"Id\":\"ecf48914-ebb2-4a93-9699-7abc8099c1dc\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Faina impreuna cu condimentele si praful de copt se cern. In mixer se pun oule, zaharul, uleiul, laptele batut, vanilia si piureul si se amesteca. Se adauga apoi faina cernuta. La final se incorporeaza si nucile taiate grosier. Se imparte in 3 si se dau la cuptor.\"},{\"Id\":\"a9075c4b-3882-498f-a5f5-4a4e631247b6\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Pentru crema, se adauga toate ingredientele in robot si se mixeaza (eu as face crema mai mula, plusand la crema de branza si la unt - 150unt/450branza)\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2234397",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2234397"
  },
  {
    "Id": "B74739BA-ADCE-4AFF-B6ED-94CEF8BB056D",
    "Title": "Clatite banatene - Ana Lugojana",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Clatite_banatene_-_Ana_Lugojana.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"1174a2f3-be1f-4c10-bbab-c3326303519e\",\"Name\":\"cl\\u0103tite sub\\u021Biri (aici [re\\u021Beta de cl\\u0103tite](https://www.lauralaurentiu.ro/diverse/o-reteta-simpla-de-clatite.html))\",\"Amount\":8,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"55909f3b-fd27-44fe-8b92-2d551099a461\",\"Name\":\"grame de branza de vaci\",\"Amount\":250,\"Unit\":\"de\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"1b2340a9-b91b-4c26-9752-bdd3ccbf9535\",\"Name\":\"ou\\u0103 mari (6 medii)\",\"Amount\":5,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"f7c7c5e6-5c02-4c62-94a2-8d5e177caf07\",\"Name\":\"de zah\\u0103r vanilat\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"plicuri\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"4043b27f-c58a-4524-9f2e-8f1f349e7a5d\",\"Name\":\"de sm\\u00E2nt\\u00E2n\\u0103 pentru fri\\u0219c\\u0103 cu 30% gr\\u0103sime\",\"Amount\":200,\"Unit\":\"grame\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"755a1e2f-5ac4-4562-96fd-013a2dc60beb\",\"Name\":\"grame de zah\\u0103r\",\"Amount\":250,\"Unit\":\"de\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"2abde54f-d6d2-46c1-ae6b-43b18fc5d15e\",\"Name\":\"op\\u021Bional: coaja ras\\u0103 de la 1 portocal\\u0103\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"ff04e351-cbb7-460e-b568-9e928d6965d6\",\"Name\":\"stafide\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":8},{\"Id\":\"d7103985-0f89-444a-995a-6cead11cab03\",\"Name\":\"unt pentru uns vasul gratinabil\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":9}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"357d450a-e90a-4f99-8639-ecc7a3b53aac\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"8 cl\\u0103tite sub\\u021Biri (aici [re\\u021Beta de cl\\u0103tite](https://www.lauralaurentiu.ro/diverse/o-reteta-simpla-de-clatite.html)) * 250 de grame de branza de vaci * 5 ou\\u0103 mari (6 medii) * 2 plicuri de zah\\u0103r vanilat * 200 grame de sm\\u00E2nt\\u00E2n\\u0103 pentru fri\\u0219c\\u0103 cu 30% gr\\u0103sime * 250 de grame de zah\\u0103r * op\\u021Bional: coaja ras\\u0103 de la 1 portocal\\u0103 * stafide * unt pentru uns vasul gratinabil\"},{\"Id\":\"e7121587-7141-4e12-babd-a97ceb53c491\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Branza se amesteca cu un ou intreh. 50gr zahr, stafidele, putina coaja rasa de portocala, 1 lg esenta vanilie.\"},{\"Id\":\"181b6049-3c43-447f-829d-6a7ffa7127ec\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Se separata ouale, galbenusurile se mixeaza cu 1 lg esenta vanilie si 80gr zahar si smantana.\"},{\"Id\":\"f8aa3ee3-a5ea-4398-80fc-c17d03e26ceb\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Clatitele se umplu cu amestecul de branza si se impacheteaza ca sarmalele.\"},{\"Id\":\"64959dcf-c0e8-4377-8335-411395e791a1\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"Se toarna amestecul de galbenusuri. Se dau la cuptor la 180 de grade.\"},{\"Id\":\"1894f292-d878-4e84-96d6-f99fb62431d3\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"Se bat albusurile cu zaharul ramas (120) pana se obtine o bezea lucioasa. Dupa 10 min la cuptor se scot si se pune si bezeaua peste.\"},{\"Id\":\"44eff807-17cd-436c-ae0e-bd12f006690f\",\"StepNumber\":7,\"Text\":\"Se lasa pana se caramelizeaza si se servesc imediat.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2234765",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2234765"
  },
  {
    "Id": "B8E96D1A-D38B-42DC-9D0B-4D8E3FA4AA64",
    "Title": "Biscuiti cu seminte",
    "Description": "Un desert delicios care combin\u0103 savoarea unic\u0103 a ingredientelor \u00eentr-o re\u021bet\u0103 rafinat\u0103. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Biscuiti_cu_seminte.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 0,
    "CuisineType": "Desert",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"9202b790-9806-44df-b6a6-bd4262d58181\",\"Name\":\"faina de ovaz;\",\"Amount\":100,\"Unit\":\"grame\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"1f5f9f5b-77a2-4f12-a815-462908952156\",\"Name\":\"mix de seminte (chia, seminte de dovleac, seminte de pin, canepa);\",\"Amount\":100,\"Unit\":\"grame\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"046593d6-149c-4655-bac7-3ff3f8a7b201\",\"Name\":\"ulei de masline;\",\"Amount\":30,\"Unit\":\"grame\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"4a3e4b66-9bfa-4726-9db6-7dd1aafc3b41\",\"Name\":\"de apa;\",\"Amount\":100,\"Unit\":\"grame\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"a7df223f-3d6b-47c5-9624-4a1554380a22\",\"Name\":\"Sare.\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":5}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"b475aa59-68de-469e-a785-deac42cca3c7\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"100 grame faina de ovaz; 100 grame mix de seminte (chia, seminte de dovleac, seminte de pin, canepa); 30 grame ulei de masline; 100 grame de apa; Sare.\"},{\"Id\":\"69f39ebf-3304-4801-826b-7cb2ee227f47\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Am pus toate ingredientele intr-un bol si le-am amestecat pana am obtinut un aluat moale si putin lipicios. Am pus aluatul intre doua hartii de copt si am incercat sa il intind cat de subtire. Dupa ce am asezat aluatul in tava, l-am taiat in patratele si l-am bagat la cuptor. L-am tinut aproximativ 25 de minute la 170 grade C. Este bine sa mai verificati din cand in can sa nu se arda.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2235181",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2235181"
  },
  {
    "Id": "BAB4E389-23A6-46AE-9EF7-8DBBD67DAE20",
    "Title": "Batoane cu mac",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Batoane_cu_mac.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"dea249c5-1508-471b-af28-466af8d673fd\",\"Name\":\"apa c\\u0103ldu\\u021B\\u0103\",\"Amount\":250,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"20833af1-b20c-4fce-a94f-3ed9e3252c48\",\"Name\":\"zahar\",\"Amount\":50,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"515ec7ed-1fdc-448d-b7f5-7b6a6b8522db\",\"Name\":\"ulei\",\"Amount\":80,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"11e85454-a607-40ba-8c66-b820b76ff662\",\"Name\":\"1/2\\u00A0 \\u00A0\\u00A0 lingurita sare\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"897bd82f-d3ab-4943-bd31-761c809fbf19\",\"Name\":\"drojdie proaspata\",\"Amount\":20,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"1189fe6c-fc1b-48b0-9f84-7034a5c5fef4\",\"Name\":\"faina\",\"Amount\":500,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"db7fb325-da71-48e2-a24a-f988e1f945f9\",\"Name\":\"Topping 1 (dupa dospire, inainte de coacere):\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"d07fc55d-af4f-46bd-9ec8-0d1356ca2b1c\",\"Name\":\"apa\",\"Amount\":80,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":8},{\"Id\":\"e3685c61-b432-468c-a24b-802947bd0822\",\"Name\":\"faina\",\"Amount\":20,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":9},{\"Id\":\"d58b93a2-ae0b-4074-8938-caa7ee511415\",\"Name\":\"Seminte mac pt presarat\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"tsp\",\"Order\":10},{\"Id\":\"e777788f-75c8-4bcf-8c79-abedab7d20b1\",\"Name\":\"Topping 2 (dupa coacere, pe cornurile fierbinti):\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":11},{\"Id\":\"aaac5b85-8944-4515-a2a7-94cd66eaac6c\",\"Name\":\"apa\",\"Amount\":80,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":12},{\"Id\":\"16604155-84c0-4856-afd1-1781950c0f08\",\"Name\":\"zahar sau miere\",\"Amount\":20,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":13}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"fd076275-0446-4c29-9fbb-6c1cda5935cc\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"Ingrediente:** 250 g apa c\\u0103ldu\\u021B\\u0103 50 g zahar 80 g ulei 1/2 lingurita sare 20 g drojdie proaspata 500 g faina **Topping 1 (dupa dospire, inainte de coacere):** 80 g apa 20 g faina 1 lingurita Seminte mac pt presarat **Topping 2 (dupa coacere, pe cornurile fierbinti):** 80 g apa 20 g zahar sau miere\"},{\"Id\":\"b0dbe2b4-0bf7-4a88-84a8-3bda048ab3aa\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Adaugam apa, zahar, drojdie, **3 min, 37 grade, vit 2.** Adaugam faina, **framantare, 3 minute.**\"},{\"Id\":\"7a36053b-4fba-447d-946d-f53635aba1b0\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Lasam sa dospeasca in bol pana se umple bolul.\"},{\"Id\":\"f06091c3-418f-4c6f-a060-6d0d0809aa5b\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"2 . Formam batoanele cu blatul uns usor cu ulei:\"},{\"Id\":\"b873584a-0974-4992-8df2-463da97846ff\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"Scot aluatul (fara sa il framant), impart in 8 parti egale.\"},{\"Id\":\"635564a8-cbd7-46c4-96dc-ad795d8d66b3\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"Intind fiecare bucata in strat subtire in forma de dreptunghi, rulez, pun in tava mare de cuptor tapetata cu o foaie de copt.\"},{\"Id\":\"c7cf61f8-1b7a-4794-85d4-c53994977d8d\",\"StepNumber\":7,\"Text\":\"Le las la dospit 30 min.\"},{\"Id\":\"ceee654e-fa20-421b-bab3-061233e21b74\",\"StepNumber\":8,\"Text\":\"3 . Fara sa spal bolul fac Topping 1, golesc intr-un bol deoparte.\"},{\"Id\":\"b8e77cc7-a4ac-482d-a07b-3af0478fc51b\",\"StepNumber\":9,\"Text\":\"4 . Cu pensula aplic Topping 1 pe toate batoanele, presar mac.\"},{\"Id\":\"16dc1070-e193-458d-b39c-818023317be7\",\"StepNumber\":10,\"Text\":\"5 . Coacem batoanele (**15 - 20 min, 200 grade**, pana se rumenesc.)\"},{\"Id\":\"988cd379-8595-4fb6-aa12-f0067b8bec8a\",\"StepNumber\":11,\"Text\":\"7 . Pregatesc Toppin2\"},{\"Id\":\"5c4daf50-5078-4fec-96db-6f13442158a3\",\"StepNumber\":12,\"Text\":\"8 . Aplic generos Topping 2 pe cornurile fierbinti si las sa se raceasca.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2235699",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2235699"
  },
  {
    "Id": "BB535155-6AF1-4EF6-9CEB-E30A81338127",
    "Title": "Paine la airfryer",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Paine_la_airfryer.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"d1b3176c-9000-4173-97a1-4d77fc4661e0\",\"Name\":\"250g/500g faina\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"8ab8839a-9944-4fda-8e09-79e195f6e59a\",\"Name\":\"200ml/400ml apa calduta\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"84f05f22-421b-4bcf-8af3-b896b9b21404\",\"Name\":\"5g/10g drojdie uscata sau 12/25g drojdie proaspata\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"7b583446-1d14-4e01-bc16-1e8f00e01f75\",\"Name\":\"rasa/1 lingurita cu varf de sare\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"tsp\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"2fff3ec8-d4d0-4c07-9270-8fee85d831c3\",\"Name\":\"lingurita/2 lingurite ulei de masline\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":5}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"c7003531-f9a8-4144-bf6c-da2bbc7bd993\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"250g/500g faina * 200ml/400ml apa calduta * 5g/10g drojdie uscata sau 12/25g drojdie proaspata * 1 lingurita rasa/1 lingurita cu varf de sare * 1 lingurita/2 lingurite ulei de masline\"},{\"Id\":\"47db7609-3b4c-43b6-aacd-ae52fd3b263b\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"1. Amestecam apa calduta cu drojdia. Lasam deoparte 15 minute.\"},{\"Id\":\"8b5ed867-1eb7-4556-aecb-be19a84ca25e\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"2. Punem faina intr-un bol incapator, facem o gaura in mijloc, adaugam apa cu drojdie.\"},{\"Id\":\"7c0d8773-4597-4bc0-8be4-52fdb9270e59\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"3. Punem si uleiul de masline. Amestecam bine cu o spatula.\"},{\"Id\":\"14db171c-d71c-4dab-ad71-51720ed97d2f\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"4. Adaugam si sarea, continuam sa amestecam cu spatula pana aluatul e bine legat.\"},{\"Id\":\"a8b412fb-a67a-4bef-9b3a-219e17a9763d\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"5. Cu mainile usor unse cu ulei, tragem marginile aluatului spre centrul vasului, astfel incat sa avem o bila. Ungem cu ulei si marginile vasului.\"},{\"Id\":\"fd224249-428d-4bf1-bdcf-a2330bdfc02d\",\"StepNumber\":7,\"Text\":\"6. Acoperim cu folie alimentara si lasam la dospit 1.5-2 ore sau pana isi dubleaza volumul.\"},{\"Id\":\"b2a6fa71-73d3-4463-874d-e174aa29d9bf\",\"StepNumber\":8,\"Text\":\"7. Pregatim vasul de copt, uns cu putin ulei si tapetat cu hartie de copt.\"},{\"Id\":\"8d1c7139-1b56-4c6b-b83c-31c077e9e53c\",\"StepNumber\":9,\"Text\":\"8. Cand aluatul si-a dublat volumul, il mutam in vasul de copt si il asezam in airfryer-ul oprit. Lasam din nou la dospit pana isi dubleaza volumul din nou.\"},{\"Id\":\"bc484b40-8bc8-4c1b-9530-4cf8ab80e46e\",\"StepNumber\":10,\"Text\":\"9. Presaram deasupra putina faina si folosim un cutit ascutit sau o lama pentru a cresta painea.\"},{\"Id\":\"431e652d-dbe4-4172-94ed-db07ed5e9e8f\",\"StepNumber\":11,\"Text\":\"10. Coacem pe functia bake, la 180\\u00B0C timp de 25-30 min sau pana e rumenita dupa gustul vostru. Lasam sa se racoreasca (daca ne putem abtine) si o putem taia.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2236161",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2236161"
  },
  {
    "Id": "BBC5A4C5-1460-4BE2-9AA1-62303853E148",
    "Title": "Muschiulet fraged de porc cu sos de mere si pere",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
