    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"ff4c8cdb-2d91-4e5c-824a-b644a4f8a8fa\",\"Name\":\"muschiulet de porc\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"bucati\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"8154f8e9-a26a-48ed-bfca-a6053e1da68a\",\"Name\":\"pere\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"71d2a113-b410-4b35-abcc-56a19756b0ae\",\"Name\":\"mere\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"228dee45-07bf-4ea8-ae73-4946504e1590\",\"Name\":\"ceapa\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"319cf7bc-484f-4c3b-a81e-fc04b1034481\",\"Name\":\"Adio Sare Mediteraneean (sau mix de ierburi aromatice),1 lgt piper, 1 lgt pudra de usturoi\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"lgt\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"ce0dc779-8117-4181-ae4d-7869ab34de41\",\"Name\":\"Zeama de la 1/2 lamaie\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"c9dd014f-5b4a-476c-ac2e-2a3f2910bdfb\",\"Name\":\"ulei de masline\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"tbsp\",\"Order\":7}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"7ee5b21b-40c3-4477-b212-c5391e138626\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Taiem ceapa solzisori si o calim in putin ulei cu apa.\"},{\"Id\":\"6c084e4e-5b14-40f0-9158-038bc9cf011c\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Intre timp curatam si taiem fructele si le amestecam cu ceapa dar nu le calim)\"},{\"Id\":\"11e5b953-18dd-46dd-a3d9-0d21e208fa9d\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"punem ceapa si fructele intr-o tava mai adanca si asezam bucatile de muschi peste ele.\"},{\"Id\":\"c11c8d92-5bee-46a5-8444-b7517785123d\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"Intindem amestecul de condimente peste bucatile de carne (pe toate partile)\"},{\"Id\":\"aac2658d-b470-4a04-ad0e-5c0890f875f8\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"Acoperim cu hartie de copt, apoi cu folie de aluminiu)\"},{\"Id\":\"a47b6708-3bcc-44dd-ad48-927a5a000d19\",\"StepNumber\":7,\"Text\":\"Dam la cuptor la 160 grade 1,5 ore apoi 10 minute la 190 grade fara folie deasupra.\"},{\"Id\":\"687937aa-fa6f-4421-a229-3a6ca9c26253\",\"StepNumber\":8,\"Text\":\"In blender transferam fructele cu ceapa si zeama lasata si blenduim fin. Voila le sos.\"},{\"Id\":\"6291db0e-416d-47f5-b847-4fd1c82b9c2f\",\"StepNumber\":9,\"Text\":\"Langa fragezimea asta de muschiulet am ales o garnitura basic dar cu care nu dai gres niciodata: cartofi piure.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2236694",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2236694"
  },
  {
    "Id": "BD6B52C0-ABEF-4AFE-B22D-75DD1961ED6C",
    "Title": "Papanasi fierti",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 tradi\u021bional\u0103 rom\u00e2neasc\u0103, preg\u0103tit\u0103 dup\u0103 re\u021beta clasic\u0103. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Papanasi_fierti.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "Rom\u00e2neasc\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"3f665b88-498f-4608-bfd1-ca049d29d2ec\",\"Name\":\"de vaci dulce\",\"Amount\":250,\"Unit\":\"branza\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"ee07fce8-1008-4698-b882-706068332b73\",\"Name\":\"gris\",\"Amount\":100,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"2ce511e6-fd61-4dd0-aeff-f43a4dfa1373\",\"Name\":\"zahar pudra\",\"Amount\":15,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"8727e120-e41f-41c8-8840-d9c1f5806dc4\",\"Name\":\"zahar vanilat\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"plic\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"def6ee3f-4cff-4221-9a26-3b369e1349cb\",\"Name\":\"ou\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"e57d6dad-56b9-4cee-baa5-3b65f59ba393\",\"Name\":\"coaja de lamaie\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"dc05ada8-b9bc-4111-836f-9c6ae63ea6b3\",\"Name\":\"Pesmet:\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"9adaaa8f-1b43-4f8f-bac0-eff2ee707fe4\",\"Name\":\"pesmet\",\"Amount\":80,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":8},{\"Id\":\"a2c1d11d-41d1-4ff0-97d3-d8836dc12a63\",\"Name\":\"zahar tos\",\"Amount\":5,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":9},{\"Id\":\"1aa7d585-71fa-4ae1-be93-cf7ff3cd7381\",\"Name\":\"unt\",\"Amount\":20,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":10}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"a99df3c8-6f24-452b-8fc2-fed5581762bd\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"250 branza de vaci dulce * 100 gris * 15g zahar pudra * 1 plic zahar vanilat * 1 ou * coaja de lamaie Pesmet: * 80gr pesmet * 5g zahar tos * 20g unt\"},{\"Id\":\"1a3430d8-c9e9-41f7-821a-9c8a513b4ecf\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Se pune untul si se topeste in tigaie. Se adauga pesmetul si se amesteca sa nu se prinda. Dupa ce s-a rumenit, se ia de pe foc si se adauga o lingura de zahar\"},{\"Id\":\"55fe735e-2296-40a3-9329-a74f6e59c168\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Se pune o oala cu apa cu sare la fiert.\"},{\"Id\":\"b87ca913-1eec-48df-94f6-36b9ffd181ef\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Din branza, gris, oua, si zahar se face un aluat omogen si se lasa sa se odihneasca vreo 20-30 min. Cu mana uda se formeaza bilele. Se pun intr-o oala cu apa la fiert.\"},{\"Id\":\"7c37422f-63bf-4ad9-a293-ecef6114d4ae\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"Dupa ce au fiert se pun si se tavalesc prin pesmet.\"},{\"Id\":\"1959ee33-c78a-4f80-ae53-154843522eb0\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"Se servesc asa sau cu smantana si dulceata.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2237218",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2237218"
  },
  {
    "Id": "C097B640-2B16-4974-BCBE-711A9F858902",
    "Title": "Supa crema de ciuperci",
    "Description": "O sup\u0103 aromat\u0103 \u0219i reconfortant\u0103, perfect\u0103 pentru orice mas\u0103. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Supa_crema_de_ciuperci.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 1,
    "CuisineType": "Sup\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 1,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"91371805-a4f7-4296-8d7b-7a0305698943\",\"Name\":\"400-500 g ciuperci proaspete tip champignon\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"9db7aea5-c7de-4d20-906b-ce01bfb8b1f2\",\"Name\":\"de cartofi (2-3 cartofi sunt suficienti)\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"kg\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"fa644202-b50a-46dd-87c7-a8b2fd771261\",\"Name\":\"medii\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"cepe\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"2b44d98b-08b1-4be1-9504-ea2a1c70f511\",\"Name\":\"4-5 c\\u0103\\u021Bei de usturoi\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"cdf0a1e8-bb30-4222-8bca-8cde90153a49\",\"Name\":\"de ulei\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"tbsp\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"4c9ad120-57e3-4b87-8bc7-3c8542a54ce0\",\"Name\":\"unt\",\"Amount\":30,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"a50327e6-f608-4886-ab64-6d726f01ecfa\",\"Name\":\"sare, piper\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"cdccd0ef-300d-423b-8ba1-92ed87443933\",\"Name\":\"sm\\u00E2nt\\u00E2n\\u0103 sau mix din 50 g sm\\u00E2nt\\u00E2n\\u0103\\u002B 100 ml lapte rece\",\"Amount\":100,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":8},{\"Id\":\"339dcff3-2013-43fb-8863-d3a359a7e826\",\"Name\":\"verdea\\u021B\\u0103 tocat\\u0103 proasp\\u0103t\\u0103 sau uscat\\u0103 (cep\\u0219oar\\u0103, p\\u0103trunjel verde)\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":9},{\"Id\":\"c81b935a-b151-4b2d-b664-d8f008da7bc4\",\"Name\":\"crutoane de p\\u00E2ine\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":10}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"e5b069e8-3461-4a3a-8526-02285fb33118\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"400-500 g ciuperci proaspete tip champignon * 1 kg de cartofi (2-3 cartofi sunt suficienti) * 2 cepe medii * 4-5 c\\u0103\\u021Bei de usturoi * 2 linguri de ulei * 30 g unt * sare, piper * 100 g sm\\u00E2nt\\u00E2n\\u0103 sau mix din 50 g sm\\u00E2nt\\u00E2n\\u0103\\u002B 100 ml lapte rece * verdea\\u021B\\u0103 tocat\\u0103 proasp\\u0103t\\u0103 sau uscat\\u0103 (cep\\u0219oar\\u0103, p\\u0103trunjel verde) * crutoane de p\\u00E2ine\"},{\"Id\":\"4e001302-227f-4081-9b68-0a8801a1ea7f\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Se coteaza usor ceapa, apoi ciupercile vreo 4-5min, usturoiul si la final cartofii.\"},{\"Id\":\"40e11a51-65a6-4dbf-9533-5992d02877b8\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Se condimenteaza si se adauga apa. Se da la fiert vreo 20-30 min.\"},{\"Id\":\"391c133d-10af-4f11-911e-045aa01d17b2\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Cand sunt gata fierti cartofii, se blendeaza supa bine. Acum se adauga si smantana.\"},{\"Id\":\"23f21cd3-ef49-46cb-99de-9d342c622997\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"Se presara de-asupra verdeata proaspata.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2237695",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2237695"
  },
  {
    "Id": "C38AAE8E-3A80-4DE3-8FA7-69F0C404DB05",
