    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"239db5e4-3021-4c52-a225-266b0f97351a\",\"Name\":\"Rulada\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"bf301d39-c3d3-4a9c-aa7c-cb993e4af52c\",\"Name\":\"buc\\u0103\\u021Bi de mu\\u0219chiule\\u021B de porc\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"6f01ef02-72d9-406b-b90a-a7b276074aeb\",\"Name\":\"de g\\u0103lbiori\",\"Amount\":300,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"435bf84f-da0a-4e49-9dae-6a179b8cb9d0\",\"Name\":\"\\u0219alote potrivite (sau orice alt\\u0103 ceap\\u0103)\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"bac4b531-edef-42ce-ac9b-2bb2b65dce27\",\"Name\":\"o leg\\u0103tur\\u0103 de p\\u0103trunjel\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"5d3bae4b-211c-4a10-b0a0-5a4e1024403a\",\"Name\":\"\\u2013 3 linguri de ulei\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"390c5631-af91-4f9c-96c8-af2c1c3236cf\",\"Name\":\"de unt\",\"Amount\":100,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"24a9670c-9984-489a-8edb-9775e529d5bb\",\"Name\":\"sare \\u0219i piper\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":8},{\"Id\":\"d0a077c5-ed2f-4604-9c08-3263b9f4e446\",\"Name\":\"Sos\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":9},{\"Id\":\"72b91cf3-8b7a-4b85-b44d-3fd1196ea5ff\",\"Name\":\"de g\\u0103lbiori\",\"Amount\":100,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":10},{\"Id\":\"2cdcb4c6-4110-429b-a90f-8130322f1af4\",\"Name\":\"unt\",\"Amount\":50,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":11},{\"Id\":\"9fab4d18-47cb-45a4-8bdf-7ee8ef13fca6\",\"Name\":\"de fond de legume (sau ap\\u0103)\",\"Amount\":200,\"Unit\":\"ml\",\"Order\":12},{\"Id\":\"bc320db6-50cb-455a-919b-6dd66d8fb01d\",\"Name\":\"sare \\u0219i piper\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":13}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"e515bb97-decd-430b-bced-2ede5ed146cd\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"Rulada * 2 buc\\u0103\\u021Bi de mu\\u0219chiule\\u021B de porc * 300 g de g\\u0103lbiori * 2 \\u0219alote potrivite (sau orice alt\\u0103 ceap\\u0103) * o leg\\u0103tur\\u0103 de p\\u0103trunjel * 2 \\u2013 3 linguri de ulei * 100 g de unt * sare \\u0219i piper Sos * 100 g de g\\u0103lbiori * 50 g unt * 200 ml de fond de legume (sau ap\\u0103) * sare \\u0219i piper\"},{\"Id\":\"c73a0a75-8ee0-4b0d-a208-68037dd57c8d\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Galbiorii se spala si se taie marunt la fel si salotele. Se calesc intr-o tigaie cu uleiul si 50 gr unt si putina sare. Cand sunt gata se adauga patrunjel tocat si se potriveste de sare si piper.\"},{\"Id\":\"67b10299-c8dc-4dab-9a86-55f5888ecbb6\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Muschiuletul se curata de grasime si se desface pe lungime. Se umple cu muschiuletul cu galbiori, se ruleaza si se leaga cu ata de bucatarie. Se ung bucatile cu unt topit, se presara sare si piper din belsug. Se pun pe un gratar in cuptorul incins la **200 C** pentru **35-45 minute**\"},{\"Id\":\"3dc6124f-69a1-4813-869b-bddf5585e382\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Pentru sos, se calesc galbiorii intr-o carticioara cu unt, dupa care se adauga fondul de legume. Se lasa sa fiarba la foc mic vreo 10 minute, dupa care se paseaza cu blenderul. Se potriveste de sare si piper.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2268961",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2268961"
  },
  {
    "Id": "F11008B9-1B71-41F4-BF87-A98762E58972",
    "Title": "Bavarois de capsuni",
    "Description": "Un desert delicios care combin\u0103 savoarea unic\u0103 a ingredientelor \u00eentr-o re\u021bet\u0103 rafinat\u0103. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Bavarois_de_capsuni.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "Desert",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"369b82b5-c4b6-43bc-a535-dfe11d7ffe11\",\"Name\":\"#### Sponge\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"8c85900d-a484-4df5-9cd5-092584500c36\",\"Name\":\"unsalted butter, soft, plus extra for greasing\",\"Amount\":60,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"3a9f8728-f86f-470d-a9e4-fda674fd107f\",\"Name\":\"caster sugar\",\"Amount\":60,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"fd65ab6c-c4c6-41c6-9005-908853a84d2d\",\"Name\":\"self-raising flour\",\"Amount\":60,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"ba14c9e8-ef9b-4852-9b2e-842c000322c2\",\"Name\":\"egg\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"medium\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"2ca9bc79-c3a3-4554-8a68-0168cedb7b5c\",\"Name\":\"1/2raising powder\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"1d0d9213-0d7b-4380-ad29-4027a0e86649\",\"Name\":\"#### Strawberry Mousse\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"cece37cc-9c0d-42ea-ba37-88c811a31e1a\",\"Name\":\"mascarpone\",\"Amount\":500,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":8},{\"Id\":\"b5214d15-f79a-44d8-9c46-bd4d2cde998a\",\"Name\":\"strawberries, halved if large, plus extra for garnishing\",\"Amount\":500,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":9},{\"Id\":\"15ca79d9-6a6b-415e-8c26-641e0daedb0b\",\"Name\":\"caster sugar\",\"Amount\":200,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":10},{\"Id\":\"0c1172c0-8124-4b57-841d-9b24ccadfe3f\",\"Name\":\"lemon juice\",\"Amount\":20,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":11},{\"Id\":\"4e594741-9f6f-4a5c-b12b-01cb35f71bf5\",\"Name\":\"gelatine\",\"Amount\":30,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":12},{\"Id\":\"9a0e7ffd-29a9-48fd-82ad-23c7fad1af15\",\"Name\":\"whipped cream (frisca hulala indulcita)\",\"Amount\":200,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":13}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"abff6fdb-667c-4517-8b49-77c01d637260\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"#### Sponge * 60 g unsalted butter, soft, plus extra for greasing * 60 g caster sugar * 60 g self-raising flour * 1 medium egg * 1/2raising powder #### Strawberry Mousse * 500 g mascarpone * 500 g strawberries, halved if large, plus extra for garnishing * 200 g caster sugar * 20 g lemon juice * 30 g gelatine * 200 g whipped cream (frisca hulala indulcita)\"},{\"Id\":\"c527ff52-1ea1-46cc-bcc2-5d9bc38b58f0\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Sponge** * cuptorul la 170o * Se pun ingredinetele in bol **15sec/vit5** de doua ori. Se toarna in forma si se coace 15-20 min **Mousse** * Capsunii curatati in bol cu zaharul **5 sec/vit 4.** Apoi se gatesc **8:30min/vit3/100o**. Se blendeaza pana cand sunt fini. Se lasa sa ajunga la temperatura camerei. * In KitchenAid se pune mascarponele si se bate un pic sa se inmoaie. Se adauga frisca si se bate pana se intareste. * Se dizolva plicurile de gelatina in apa calduta si se adauga in siropul...\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2269567",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2269567"
  },
  {
    "Id": "F11EE348-2809-4660-B8E9-0C7FC34558C5",
    "Title": "Supa de salata verde",
    "Description": "O sup\u0103 aromat\u0103 \u0219i reconfortant\u0103, perfect\u0103 pentru orice mas\u0103. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Supa_de_salata_verde.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 1,
    "CuisineType": "Sup\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"55d194d5-7cd7-4693-a4d2-2f23939ea284\",\"Name\":\"salata\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"capatani\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"3a32a31f-9dc3-4b4a-961b-02714e1fb74d\",\"Name\":\"2-3 cepe verzi\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"0d823b68-2f07-4be7-8036-959e16563d26\",\"Name\":\"3-4 catei usturoi\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"17ba0483-032c-41c7-9e55-b454e2b127a7\",\"Name\":\"ulei\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"b88627a8-8cff-4fd6-bb92-b0f0a8d5d5f9\",\"Name\":\"zer sau lapte\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"litru\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"15823a86-be68-42b8-9423-c1bdeb9f314a\",\"Name\":\"boia dulce, sare, piper\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"e3c497a6-09cf-4273-9f39-f36ee410e612\",\"Name\":\"marar\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"4174058a-ab4e-46a0-bea4-3f80939cfdd6\",\"Name\":\"galbenuse\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":8},{\"Id\":\"17543b7d-f3f8-471a-9ef5-423032a2100f\",\"Name\":\"iaurt\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":9}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"4e1dcf39-d316-456a-8700-a547ff5f0cfe\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"2 capatani salata * 2-3 cepe verzi * 3-4 catei usturoi * ulei * 1 litru zer sau lapte * boia dulce, sare, piper * marar * 2 galbenuse * iaurt\"},{\"Id\":\"2c59c540-d06d-4279-9769-c16b9b02452a\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Se caleste ceapa si o parte din usturoi. Se adauga zerul si se da in clocot. Cand clocoteste se adauga salata curatata si se condimenteaza cu boia.\"},{\"Id\":\"9515ce59-2b49-4095-bc43-8414e04cbfe5\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Se amesteca galbenusele cu iaurtul si usturoiul ramas. Se toarna peste zeama fierbinte dupa ce se stinge focul si se omogenizeaza.\"},{\"Id\":\"ba9f4f4e-773a-4513-83d0-c87ca399e03a\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Se poate adauga slanina sau carnati care se prajesc inainte iar in uleiul ramas se calesc legumele.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2269567",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2269567"
  },
  {
    "Id": "F37FB27D-2075-401A-B9B0-84167859F6A2",
    "Title": "Pizza cu iaurt",
    "Description": "Un clasic italian autentic, plin de gust \u0219i tradi\u021bie culinar\u0103. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
