  {
    "Id": "F8F5A894-C12B-4CD7-8803-F7042A3C3632",
    "Title": "Somon cu salsa de mango \u0219i orez",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Somon_cu_salsa_de_mango_\u0219i_orez.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"a58d51fb-de64-4bae-8c6a-16cd39f99322\",\"Name\":\"uri de somon\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"file\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"8bd2d692-bd4f-4db8-9093-a7a22bf6d27e\",\"Name\":\"linguri\\u021B\\u0103 mu\\u0219tar\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"a987cf50-4c86-4b27-8691-925233e92cc2\",\"Name\":\"linguri\\u021B\\u0103 miere\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"c43afa54-560c-4937-a33a-78a628ccb4b9\",\"Name\":\"sos de soia\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"a1512e7a-29f1-4238-a177-7d21bacaccb6\",\"Name\":\"mix de susan\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"b679d5d8-7143-4d5b-843e-1d9f85b8c0ed\",\"Name\":\"jum\\u0103tate de mango\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"1b84c549-7c42-440e-ac33-dcd1f963d8d5\",\"Name\":\"jum\\u0103tate de avocado\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"8a2b6ed0-fe00-4cfc-8253-458942bdc6ae\",\"Name\":\"ro\\u0219ie\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":8},{\"Id\":\"74061874-42d7-4e13-b4f2-429a7b096408\",\"Name\":\"jum\\u0103tate ceap\\u0103 ro\\u0219ie\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":9},{\"Id\":\"3a5727f6-7371-475a-980e-ecc4b6f6c0f5\",\"Name\":\"ceap\\u0103 verde\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"fir\",\"Order\":10},{\"Id\":\"de07f255-1eb4-4531-9c52-b8cc278db4be\",\"Name\":\"p\\u0103trunjel\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":11},{\"Id\":\"16c70e31-2835-4a35-871f-91fc02d208ba\",\"Name\":\"coaj\\u0103 \\u0219i zeam\\u0103 de la lime\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":12},{\"Id\":\"33d91b5c-2503-4f38-9fda-e3139af63593\",\"Name\":\"orez brun\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":13},{\"Id\":\"239e9fb4-50c7-4f18-9f26-dee31ec954d2\",\"Name\":\"jum\\u0103tate ardei iute\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":14}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"61789586-637d-489a-b928-b47cde199eae\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"2 file uri de somon * 1 linguri\\u021B\\u0103 mu\\u0219tar * 1 linguri\\u021B\\u0103 miere * sos de soia * mix de susan * jum\\u0103tate de mango * jum\\u0103tate de avocado * 1 ro\\u0219ie * jum\\u0103tate ceap\\u0103 ro\\u0219ie * 1 fir ceap\\u0103 verde * p\\u0103trunjel * coaj\\u0103 \\u0219i zeam\\u0103 de la lime * orez brun * jum\\u0103tate ardei iute\"},{\"Id\":\"911d8a99-c416-4c86-b9eb-36345d16798a\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Am \\u00EEnceput prin a amesteca mierea cu mu\\u0219tar, dup\\u0103 care am uns buc\\u0103\\u021Bile de somon cu acest sos \\u0219i am pres\\u0103rat semin\\u021Bele de susan.\"},{\"Id\":\"0b6c06b6-edb1-4e3a-8cdd-315459004766\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Am b\\u0103gat tava la cuptorul pre\\u00EEnc\\u0103lzit la 180 de grade timp de 20 de minute, timp \\u00EEn care am pus orezul la fiert \\u0219i am preg\\u0103tit salsa de mango.\"},{\"Id\":\"0caf453b-3a18-4f0b-a9b6-cb17563908c2\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Am t\\u0103iat \\u00EEn cubulete mici toate legumele, am tocat m\\u0103runt \\u0219i p\\u0103trunjelul, am ras coaja de lime \\u0219i am ad\\u0103ugat \\u0219i pu\\u021Bin\\u0103 zeama de [lime.Am](http://lime.Am) asezonat cu sare \\u0219i piper .\"},{\"Id\":\"12cb3894-6caa-4a16-9bc6-2c4d49f6ff6f\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"\\u00CEn ultimele 5 minute, am scos somonul, l-am uns cu sosul de soia \\u0219i am b\\u0103gat din nou la cuptor.\"},{\"Id\":\"ad32c683-6977-4a02-a440-5e3a25b5fb16\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"Am a\\u0219ezat \\u00EEn farfurie orezul, somonul \\u0219i salsa de mango, iar l\\u00E2ng\\u0103 am mai a\\u0219ezat o bucat\\u0103 pe lime pentru asezonarea final\\u0103. E o re\\u021Bet\\u0103 super simpl\\u0103, u\\u0219oar\\u0103, dar \\u0219i cu o explozie de arome. Chiar sper s\\u0103 o \\u00EEncerca\\u021Bi.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2271883",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2271883"
  },
  {
    "Id": "F92C6359-717C-4F30-BF99-4F4E06672ADC",
    "Title": "Salata cu cartofi dulci",
