    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"6cbd8733-ef89-4a52-b959-2ec169d76c24\",\"Name\":\"Un cartof dulce\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"ce094f18-6264-4720-997f-5f8d7e6c034b\",\"Name\":\"Ridichi\",\"Amount\":3,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"ca3f871e-a471-465c-898f-d6356ba49cbc\",\"Name\":\"spanac baby\",\"Amount\":100,\"Unit\":\"grame\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"a3be9c2e-538c-47f5-98c5-bc6552924825\",\"Name\":\"quinoa\",\"Amount\":100,\"Unit\":\"grame\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"7f1f0796-bc24-488c-ba9a-b7aa3c96eb15\",\"Name\":\"O ceap\\u0103 ro\\u0219ie\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"445bcfc9-25fd-49e0-a62a-323cfd7499d6\",\"Name\":\"br\\u00E2nz\\u0103 feta\",\"Amount\":100,\"Unit\":\"grame\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"20198d23-03d8-4eab-a27a-b82b3342ab0d\",\"Name\":\"Ou\\u0103 de prepeli\\u021B\\u0103\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"8773e70e-77c3-428c-8fe0-93a8a056fb25\",\"Name\":\"Dressing\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":8},{\"Id\":\"73dfdedf-40f2-4f82-9d90-37ebf873107f\",\"Name\":\"linguri\\u021Be de mu\\u0219tar (eu am folosit mu\\u0219tar cu boabe)\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":9},{\"Id\":\"19a252e6-4d6e-4021-ad17-a24a2e897b79\",\"Name\":\"linguri\\u021Be de miere de albine\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":10},{\"Id\":\"04ca344f-1db1-430c-b283-018214f4ee7d\",\"Name\":\"linguri\\u021Be de iaurt grecesc/ sm\\u00E2nt\\u00E2n\\u0103\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":11},{\"Id\":\"6cfa2aa0-65a0-48c9-8782-fe8afe233224\",\"Name\":\"Sare\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":12},{\"Id\":\"b24a7842-c7f8-4dfa-bb45-c4f32ab5f712\",\"Name\":\"Piper\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":13},{\"Id\":\"393e89f8-b782-4f84-a846-cf65f53b8226\",\"Name\":\"linguri\\u021Be de zeam\\u0103 de l\\u0103m\\u00E2ie\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":14}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"dc61309d-a343-48d6-bd2e-6aaa82fb6477\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"Un cartof dulce * 3 Ridichi * 100 grame spanac baby * 100 grame quinoa * O ceap\\u0103 ro\\u0219ie * 100 grame br\\u00E2nz\\u0103 feta * Ou\\u0103 de prepeli\\u021B\\u0103 Dressing * 2 linguri\\u021Be de mu\\u0219tar (eu am folosit mu\\u0219tar cu boabe) * 2 linguri\\u021Be de miere de albine * 2 linguri\\u021Be de iaurt grecesc/ sm\\u00E2nt\\u00E2n\\u0103 * Sare * Piper * 2 linguri\\u021Be de zeam\\u0103 de l\\u0103m\\u00E2ie\"},{\"Id\":\"613bd5e5-ae2e-48c6-8ce8-e7dd2a412402\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"\\u00CEn priml r\\u00E2nd am preg\\u0103tit cartoful dulce. L-am cur\\u0103\\u021Bat, l-am t\\u0103iat cubule\\u021Be, l-am condimentat cu ulei de m\\u0103sline, sare, piper, boia dulce, oregano (sau orice alte condimente dup\\u0103 preferin\\u021Be) \\u0219i l-am pus la cuptor, la **200 grade C, pentru 40 de minute.**\"},{\"Id\":\"26c6d12e-57df-41f7-be4d-675e46afd933\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"\\u00CEn timp ce cartoful era la cuptor, am fiert quinoa dup\\u0103 instruc\\u021Biunile de pe ambalaj, \\u0219i apoi am l\\u0103sat 10 minute s\\u0103 se hidrateze. Se poate folosi si naut, cus-cus, orez etc.\"},{\"Id\":\"2e9b2bc1-101f-4424-98ba-33c7ee4b99c9\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"\\u00CEntre timp am pus \\u0219i ceapa ro\\u0219ie la murat. Am t\\u0103iat-o fidelu\\u021B\\u0103, i-am pus un pic de sare \\u0219i 2 linguri de o\\u021Bet, \\u0219i am amestecat. Am l\\u0103sat pe mas\\u0103, 30 de minute, p\\u00E2n\\u0103 a trebuit s\\u0103 o folosesc.\"},{\"Id\":\"994e62d8-40ea-4303-a1e6-32da54286bf0\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"Am sp\\u0103lat spanacul, l-am uscat, \\u0219i l-am pus \\u00EEntr-un castron \\u00EEnc\\u0103p\\u0103tor. Peste am feliat sub\\u021Bire ridichiile.\"},{\"Id\":\"37bbbe19-42b7-4455-b84a-cbe7ed3b0968\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"Ou\\u0103le de prepeli\\u021B\\u0103 le-am fiert \\u0219i pe ele c\\u00E2teva minute, p\\u00E2n\\u0103 s-au fiert tari.\"},{\"Id\":\"47344cac-c953-4627-9b22-c13aa07072ff\",\"StepNumber\":7,\"Text\":\"C\\u00E2nd cartofii au fost gata, i-am scos din cuptor, \\u0219i i-am pus peste spanac. Apoi am pus \\u0219i restul ingredientelor: quinoa, ceapa murat\\u0103, br\\u00E2nza feta \\u0219i ou\\u0103le de prepeli\\u021B\\u0103. Pentru textur\\u0103, \\u0219i un gust complementar, am pus \\u0219i c\\u00E2teva boabe de rodie deasupra.\"},{\"Id\":\"2930e775-607d-46f5-a871-a79f5253391e\",\"StepNumber\":8,\"Text\":\"Am preg\\u0103tit un dressing pentru aceast\\u0103 salat\\u0103, care se potrive\\u0219te perfect \\u00EEn aceast\\u0103 combina\\u021Bie. \\u00CEntr-un castron am amestecat toate ingredientele pentru dressing, apoi l-am turnat peste, am amestecat bine \\u0219i am servit. Este foarte delicioas\\u0103 cald\\u0103, dar \\u0219i rece.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2273514",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2273514"
  },
  {
    "Id": "F96227C1-F5EA-4B9A-BF29-2F04FA31534F",
    "Title": "Supa pui cu leurda",
    "Description": "O sup\u0103 aromat\u0103 \u0219i reconfortant\u0103, perfect\u0103 pentru orice mas\u0103. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Supa_pui_cu_leurda.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 0,
    "CuisineType": "Sup\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"71e4dcee-2f18-49d4-93e0-63f90ab2e64d\",\"Name\":\"Supa:** am fiert carnea de pui, am spumat-o \\u0219i am ad\\u0103ugat r\\u0103d\\u0103cinoasele (morcovi, p\\u0103trunjel, p\\u0103st\\u00E2rnac, \\u021Belin\\u0103), boabe de ienibahar \\u0219i de piper. C\\u00E2nd au fiert am strecurat, am blendat legumele \\u00EEn sup\\u0103, carnea am tocat-o m\\u0103runt cu cu\\u021Bitul \\u0219i separat am c\\u0103lit o ceap\\u0103, am ad\\u0103ugat \\u00EEn supa care fierbea \\u002B salat\\u0103 \\u0219i leurd\\u0103 tocate m\\u0103runt. La final iaurt gras. Delicioas\\u0103\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"bbf20c5e-c24e-4de8-b6bb-95b5c42b76ad\",\"Name\":\"Pesto**: am ad\\u0103ugat \\u00EEn chopper leurda, nuci, migdale, caju, parmezan, ulei m\\u0103sline \\u0219i piper toate dup\\u0103 gust. Se poate p\\u0103stra ceva timp la frigider \\u00EEn borcan, sigilat bine cu ulei. Voi folosi pt paste, pe bruschete, cu crem\\u0103 de br\\u00E2nz\\u0103 pe p\\u00E2ine pr\\u0103jit\\u0103 \\u0219i voi sigila cu ulei dup\\u0103 fiecare \\u00EEntrebuin\\u021Bare.\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"bcae23bf-e2d1-4727-87e8-b025166bdc67\",\"Name\":\"Unt aromatizat:** Untul moale l-am amestecat cu leurda tocat\\u0103 m\\u0103runt, \\u00EEn folie am f\\u0103cut sub form\\u0103 de sul \\u0219i la congelator. Voi folosi pt cartofi fier\\u021Bi, legume,\\u00A0 fripturi, etc\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":3}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"1afe5337-9657-4e45-ad10-e65151cd0115\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"Supa:** am fiert carnea de pui, am spumat-o \\u0219i am ad\\u0103ugat r\\u0103d\\u0103cinoasele (morcovi, p\\u0103trunjel, p\\u0103st\\u00E2rnac, \\u021Belin\\u0103), boabe de ienibahar \\u0219i de piper. C\\u00E2nd au fiert am strecurat, am blendat legumele \\u00EEn sup\\u0103, carnea am tocat-o m\\u0103runt cu cu\\u021Bitul \\u0219i separat am c\\u0103lit o ceap\\u0103, am ad\\u0103ugat \\u00EEn supa care fierbea \\u002B salat\\u0103 \\u0219i leurd\\u0103 tocate m\\u0103runt. La final iaurt gras. Delicioas\\u0103 **Pesto**: am ad\\u0103ugat \\u00EEn chopper leurda, nuci, migdale, caju, parmezan, ulei m\\u0103sline \\u0219i piper toate dup\\u0103 gust. Se poate p\\u0103stra ceva ...\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2274716",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2274716"
  },
  {
    "Id": "F9B09329-144E-45F3-8BD7-1F7286674EF5",
    "Title": "Snikers",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/placeholder.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"2df0dcc6-c95f-4ea6-a7ad-8cada189953f\",\"Name\":\"/ 8 oua\",\"Amount\":6,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"02fa12da-d4f8-4325-9089-42e66cb9d187\",\"Name\":\"zahar pudra\",\"Amount\":200,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":2}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"4ae78de5-fe6b-448b-878d-2807b9011372\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"** 200 gr zahar tos\"},{\"Id\":\"c46958a9-f074-4e2d-88ff-2a7c530a322b\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"1 pachet margarina/ unt\"},{\"Id\":\"bc73891a-7974-4b5d-b55a-9b3b649d45a6\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"200 gr ciocolata alba\"},{\"Id\":\"45720a4b-90a4-4650-945f-6b6984699399\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"200 gr ciocolata neagra\"},{\"Id\":\"44ddd327-c7a0-435a-981b-d2442f192459\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"Albusurile se amesteca cu zaharul pudra si se bat pana se obtine o spuma. Se adauga faina, praful de copt si nuca macinata. Compozitia obtinuta se da la cuptor.\"},{\"Id\":\"a108099a-3361-49a6-990b-138185f5a9b1\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"Nuca intreaga se prajeste si se taie in bucati mai mici.\"},{\"Id\":\"6b6a07f9-7b86-478d-a244-99096ecfc441\",\"StepNumber\":7,\"Text\":\"Zaharul tos se caramelizeaza la foc mic. Se stinge cu putina apa si se adauga nuca prajita.\"},{\"Id\":\"85aec847-4998-409c-a42b-3f2072cced10\",\"StepNumber\":8,\"Text\":\"Margarina impreuna cu galbenusurile se fierb pe aburi pana se ingroasa. Se amesteca cu zaharul caramelizat si nuca.\"},{\"Id\":\"869a64e4-9e83-4ad5-9f94-7ce88606e416\",\"StepNumber\":9,\"Text\":\"Cand blatul este gata de copt, se scoate si se rade ciocolata neagra pe deasupra. Apoi se pune amestecul de zahar, nuca si crema de galbenusuri, iar pe deasupra se rade ciocolata alba.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2274716",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2274716"
  },
  {
    "Id": "F9D67769-2122-40B8-B6F6-8F68C6E31D6B",
    "Title": "Paste cremoase cu sos alb",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Paste_cremoase_cu_sos_alb.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"6786ccf2-fa47-4bd1-8639-ea6d2efbbf7e\",\"Name\":\"pastele scurte preferate\",\"Amount\":250,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"5ef774a7-720d-4426-9d19-33ba1f40d2dc\",\"Name\":\"O lingura ulei masline\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"d1de95ad-baae-4dfa-b84d-fff8662b07d8\",\"Name\":\"cubulete bacon\",\"Amount\":200,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"828c399c-99fe-45d3-bc4f-19d7d6924cd5\",\"Name\":\"capere\",\"Amount\":3,\"Unit\":\"tbsp\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"7b19671e-efc8-41f0-ba91-51add0dd1b25\",\"Name\":\"4-5 linguri masline fara samburi\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"bbd8ea17-2826-4055-aed4-a3a4db471825\",\"Name\":\"smantana pentru gatit\",\"Amount\":500,\"Unit\":\"ml\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"dc177af8-3815-4f8a-8d08-97b278b8e8b8\",\"Name\":\"Sare si piper dupa gust\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"149fa26e-6908-4bc8-bec3-0a91fb81e0ca\",\"Name\":\"parmezan razuit (sau cascaval/mozzarella)\",\"Amount\":80,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":8}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"19ee53f6-ba66-4ba8-a3c2-4d14f6a9f962\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"250g pastele scurte preferate * O lingura ulei masline * 200g cubulete bacon * 3 linguri capere * 4-5 linguri masline fara samburi * 500ml smantana pentru gatit * Sare si piper dupa gust * 80g parmezan razuit (sau cascaval/mozzarella)\"},{\"Id\":\"cf4c86f5-da7f-4273-8b08-165c6fcf7072\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"1. Punem la fiert 3-4 litri de apa. Cand clocoteste, adaugam putina sare si pastele. Fierbem pastele conform timpului indicat pe ambalaj, pentru a fi al dente. Cat timp fierb pastele, ne ocupam de sos.\"},{\"Id\":\"c036d526-a65e-4b87-ba59-c4f531b59e51\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"2. Intr-o tigaie incapatoare punem uleiul de masline si baconul. Sotam la foc mica pana baconul e rumenit.\"},{\"Id\":\"b22e862f-0cf9-49df-bf5f-98bc948b9f4d\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"3. Adaugam maslinele si caperele, le sotam impreuna 1-2 minute la foc mare.\"},{\"Id\":\"c8ebb56f-a6b0-437c-8412-d7e7696eb752\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"4. Adugam Meggle Sm\\u00E2nt\\u00E2na pentru G\\u0103tit 20% si parmezanul. Condimentam dupa gust cu sare si piper.\"},{\"Id\":\"04788599-2520-47b4-9ca0-90f3b2e10b6b\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"5. Amestecam foarte bine sosul si lasam la foc mic, amestecan des, pana parmezanul este topit.\"},{\"Id\":\"b56230fa-dbc3-4244-8078-d2dd67a4aefe\",\"StepNumber\":7,\"Text\":\"6. Punem deasupra pastele fierbinti, pe care le scurgem din oala, fara a le trece pe sub jet de apa rece.\"},{\"Id\":\"5ce0096e-a38c-42f4-bcad-5e33c7201916\",\"StepNumber\":8,\"Text\":\"7. Amestecam si servim cu patrunjel/busuioc tocat marunt si extra parmezan.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2278291",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2278291"
  },
  {
    "Id": "FA23C126-C6AD-4888-BAF3-2A1560F6EF89",
    "Title": "Dressing mustar dijon",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Dressing_mustar_dijon.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 1,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"23225035-59e3-4d5b-8897-7e94e9df5f10\",\"Name\":\"ulei de masline\",\"Amount\":120,\"Unit\":\"ml\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"d8fae584-4d66-433a-b419-5838e6690045\",\"Name\":\"miere\",\"Amount\":120,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"a01d6ad9-4ad2-4d2b-96f7-7c3415c94e27\",\"Name\":\"otet de mere (va recomandam versiunea cu miere)\",\"Amount\":30,\"Unit\":\"ml\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"7db025a7-6822-40c1-972f-3d96b4b2ad10\",\"Name\":\"[linguri mustar de Dijon](https://l.profitshare.ro/l/8497797)\",\"Amount\":4,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"a4503ff4-100b-4c97-b857-27b714bb6552\",\"Name\":\"suc de lamaie\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"tbsp\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"f58aec45-2622-4a66-9187-db78da55c9f7\",\"Name\":\"seminte de mustar (Optional, doar daca mustarul nu contine deja bobitele)\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"tbsp\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"966da176-ad98-46b9-8706-780900eef523\",\"Name\":\"sare si piper (dupa gust)\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"1de39ea3-d134-401a-8596-79d43556cbcf\",\"Name\":\"Eu am facut jumatate si tot a ajuns pentru 2 ture de salata.\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":8}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"078616d8-bbb8-487c-8722-e8f865d40acf\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"120 ml ulei de masline * 120 g miere * 30 ml otet de mere (va recomandam versiunea cu miere) * 4 [linguri mustar de Dijon](https://l.profitshare.ro/l/8497797) * 2 linguri suc de lamaie * 2 linguri seminte de mustar (Optional, doar daca mustarul nu contine deja bobitele) * sare si piper (dupa gust) Eu am facut jumatate si tot a ajuns pentru 2 ture de salata.\"},{\"Id\":\"6b8d88f9-99da-4e1e-926f-45e4f1027693\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Se pune miera, mustarul, uleiul si zeama de lamaie intr-un bol sau intr-un borcan si se amesteca pana se emulsifica..\"},{\"Id\":\"0f3a9d2f-de3e-47e5-a9b7-1b7b2203ecca\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Se adauga otetul si se amesteca. Se asezeoneaza cu sare si piper.\"},{\"Id\":\"8d1929dd-ed64-4809-b09a-345fb5a01da0\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Poate fi tinut cateva zile la frigider\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2278291",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2278291"
  },
  {
    "Id": "FA2484C1-58AE-45F7-AC69-48BB623250BD",
    "Title": "Ardei copti cu smantana",
    "Description": "O re\u021bet\u0103 delicioas\u0103 \u0219i u\u0219or de preparat, perfect\u0103 pentru orice ocazie. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Ardei_copti_cu_smantana.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 1,
    "CuisineType": "General\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"82bf045e-094c-405a-85af-b86388875f31\",\"Name\":\"tocata marunt\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"ceapa\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"da63a657-b538-4738-b389-8eaad720c890\",\"Name\":\"3-4 rosii medii taiate cuburi sau felii (le puteti decoji daca va deranjeaza la final coaja)\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"519d88c7-b762-46b1-9c56-e8c59943d658\",\"Name\":\"mari de usturoi zdrobiti\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"catei\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"43bc857b-6ffc-4d22-af6d-064ba8667acd\",\"Name\":\"4-5 ardei grasi rosiicopti sau ardei kapia copti, curatati si taiati\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"ce3d5f52-8bef-4438-86e6-51f9af3f95db\",\"Name\":\"smanatana pt gatit\",\"Amount\":250,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"65cb3658-f457-4b77-a268-cb08c4681e84\",\"Name\":\"Marar tocat marunt (optional)\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":6}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"2bf8dfb1-8d80-4ef3-8226-1e74bababa06\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Se caleste ceapa in putin ulei amestecat cu apa dupa care se adauga rosiile si usturoiul si se lasa la gatit pana rosiile devin pasta (sos)\"},{\"Id\":\"efcd4519-98c2-47a6-b42a-27cb554ea801\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Se adauga ardeii, se mai lasa pe foc cateva minute dupa care se adauga smanatana pt gatit si se mareste focul ca sa se ingroase smantana. In cateva minute ar trebui sa fie gata.\"},{\"Id\":\"662df562-dc37-4eca-80d0-80788e32f7d4\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"La final se adauga mararul tocat.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2281593",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2281593"
  },
  {
    "Id": "FA60B5B2-0DC1-4D88-A9AB-475D89D28A89",
    "Title": "Butter chicken",
    "Description": "Un preparat indian aromat cu condimente tradi\u021bionale \u0219i savori intense. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Butter_chicken.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "Indian\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"2b6e08c2-fb77-49b0-83ac-c7c166a02436\",\"Name\":\"Marinada\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"a98144be-fa67-47d1-943d-ad1437f3abae\",\"Name\":\"pulpe de pui dezosate\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"kg\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"eb4f38bc-c21c-42d8-8917-c1d8ca4313e5\",\"Name\":\"gr\\u0103un\\u021Bi de usturoi\",\"Amount\":3,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"d41a03db-e1a6-437e-abf9-066946c565c0\",\"Name\":\"O buc\\u0103\\u021Bic\\u0103 de ghimbir\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"4b3eddbf-ddd5-4203-8aab-eb0fbc5202d0\",\"Name\":\"Sare\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"8a91eedd-0f13-4c9b-b3d2-f37c64a55399\",\"Name\":\"iaurt grecesc\",\"Amount\":250,\"Unit\":\"grame\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"7ebb8a98-c040-4051-a48f-ae513e1e5e62\",\"Name\":\"O linguri\\u021B\\u0103 turmeric\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"ac71f42f-3bd7-4205-9c69-bad20682109d\",\"Name\":\"O linguri\\u021B\\u0103 de chimen m\\u0103cinat\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":8},{\"Id\":\"f2136cf6-68e4-4a4d-8765-5f562941f777\",\"Name\":\"linguri\\u021Be condiment garam-masala\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":9},{\"Id\":\"a20c7ce1-ea6d-4874-ae0e-c4661ec89d85\",\"Name\":\"Jum\\u0103tate de linguri\\u021B\\u0103 de chilli m\\u0103cinat\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":10},{\"Id\":\"559f8c03-330e-407d-80b3-ed91ae3a598d\",\"Name\":\"Sos\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":11},{\"Id\":\"771ebfc8-a0f7-45b7-8c7e-db96da324f92\",\"Name\":\"ceap\\u0103 ro\\u0219ie\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":12},{\"Id\":\"903b23b5-a56d-40b9-91e7-d80032681cfc\",\"Name\":\"ro\\u0219ii proaspete (sau la conserv\\u0103)\",\"Amount\":400,\"Unit\":\"grame\",\"Order\":13},{\"Id\":\"4041da35-f451-4fd5-9ac1-42d434760058\",\"Name\":\"gr\\u0103un\\u021Bi de usturoi\",\"Amount\":5,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":14},{\"Id\":\"643e9f78-1ae1-4e45-9077-06c99ad4db81\",\"Name\":\"O bucat\\u0103 de ghimbir\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":15},{\"Id\":\"8927fc6b-a11f-4bf9-91f3-0b7f443ee264\",\"Name\":\"sm\\u00E2nt\\u00E2n\\u0103 lichid\\u0103\",\"Amount\":100,\"Unit\":\"ml\",\"Order\":16},{\"Id\":\"b59a8b89-bf2e-4dee-8c5c-92b9bbb0c9ab\",\"Name\":\"linguri\\u021Be de garam masala\",\"Amount\":3,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":17},{\"Id\":\"0eac7b5a-0c4c-40b1-86ea-f0b3f5750aa9\",\"Name\":\"linguri\\u021B\\u0103 de boabe de coriandru\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":18},{\"Id\":\"7f851acf-a7db-45ac-9576-efed6f31fc4d\",\"Name\":\"linguri\\u021B\\u0103 de chilli (sau boia dulce dac\\u0103 nu prefera\\u021Bi picant)\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":19},{\"Id\":\"f51512a4-cde4-4b08-9666-3efcb3fb7edb\",\"Name\":\"linguri\\u021B\\u0103 de turmeric\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":20}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"ec2fd0ef-88fd-4580-817d-5ed8733f4bfd\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"Marinada * 1 kg pulpe de pui dezosate * 3 gr\\u0103un\\u021Bi de usturoi * O buc\\u0103\\u021Bic\\u0103 de ghimbir * Sare * 250 grame iaurt grecesc * O linguri\\u021B\\u0103 turmeric * O linguri\\u021B\\u0103 de chimen m\\u0103cinat * 2 linguri\\u021Be condiment garam-masala * Jum\\u0103tate de linguri\\u021B\\u0103 de chilli m\\u0103cinat Sos * 1 ceap\\u0103 ro\\u0219ie * 400 grame ro\\u0219ii proaspete (sau la conserv\\u0103) * 5 gr\\u0103un\\u021Bi de usturoi * O bucat\\u0103 de ghimbir * 100 ml sm\\u00E2nt\\u00E2n\\u0103 lichid\\u0103 * 3 linguri\\u021Be de garam masala * 1 linguri\\u021B\\u0103 de boabe de coriandru * 1 linguri\\u021B\\u0103 de chilli (sau boia dulce da...\"},{\"Id\":\"b48f1947-7262-4911-9a3e-5b92c9929412\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Se taie pulpele cubulete si se condimneteaza. Se adauga iaurtul si se lasa la marinat intre o ora si peste noapte.\"},{\"Id\":\"02711be2-9590-4e2b-ad7c-fd78d493bc8e\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Puiul se caleste intr-o tigaie pe toate partile, pana prinde o culoare rumena (cam 3 min pe fiecare parte). Se scoate si se pastraza la cald.\"},{\"Id\":\"6f44753e-fcb7-4e5c-a77b-72427a779386\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"In aceeasi tigaie se mai adauga unt si ulei si se pune la calit ceapa tocata fideluta.\"},{\"Id\":\"a60060de-db96-4643-aef5-e8e96a4e3cab\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"Peste am pus usturoiul \\u0219i ghimbirul, amandou\\u0103 date pe r\\u0103z\\u0103toarea mic\\u0103. Dup\\u0103 un minut, am ad\\u0103ugat toate condimentele, \\u0219i am l\\u0103sat cam 30 de secunde s\\u0103-\\u0219i dezvolte aroma. Peste am pus ro\\u0219iile t\\u0103iate buc\\u0103\\u021Bi, si cam 100 ml ap\\u0103. Dup\\u0103 ce a fiert 5 minute, am pus sare \\u0219i linguri\\u021Ba de sare, \\u0219i am mai lasat 15 minute s\\u0103 fiarb\\u0103 la foc mic.\"},{\"Id\":\"6c52ca67-d2df-40f6-a532-dfdd6d589bbf\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"Acest amestec l-am pus la blender, \\u0219i l-am pasat foarte bine, p\\u00E2n\\u0103 a devenit fin ca \\u0219i catifeaua. L-am pus \\u00EEnapoi, \\u00EEn aceea\\u0219i tigaie\"},{\"Id\":\"4b9723f3-1aa7-4145-a4ec-2623744345e9\",\"StepNumber\":7,\"Text\":\"Dup\\u0103 ce a \\u00EEnceput s\\u0103 fiarb\\u0103, am pus puiul cu toate sucurile de \\u0219i le-a l\\u0103sat \\u00EEn castron, \\u0219i am l\\u0103sat s\\u0103 fiarb\\u0103 cam 25 de minute. Am gustat s\\u0103 v\\u0103d dac\\u0103 lipse\\u0219te ceva, apoi am pus sm\\u00E2nt\\u00E2na lichid\\u0103, am mai l\\u0103sat 5 minute pe foc \\u0219i gata.\"},{\"Id\":\"7cffa594-4d83-42ee-85f7-a4af355fb790\",\"StepNumber\":8,\"Text\":\"Se serveste fierbinte, al\\u0103turi de orez yasmine fiert, simplu, c\\u00E2teva felii de ghimbir t\\u0103iat \\u0219i sm\\u00E2nt\\u00E2n\\u0103 lichid\\u0103 pe deasupra. Se poate desigur \\u0219i cu orice fel de lipie naan cald\\u0103 \\u0219i ea.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2283421",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2283421"
  },
  {
    "Id": "FECBBCD3-55D0-40A2-92DE-3E3D7B8E718C",
    "Title": "Supa crema de usturoi",
    "Description": "O sup\u0103 aromat\u0103 \u0219i reconfortant\u0103, perfect\u0103 pentru orice mas\u0103. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Supa_crema_de_usturoi.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "Sup\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"742329ed-850b-4a9c-a634-8bee9c4d5815\",\"Name\":\"\\u202240 ml ulei de masline\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"77bdbf17-88a7-4b8d-9374-51e31ee20d4a\",\"Name\":\"\\u20228 - 10 graunti de usturoi\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"389fef27-19ec-429c-858d-bd120f386ba6\",\"Name\":\"\\u2022300 gr conopida desfacuta in buchetele\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"3770dba4-1293-4c7f-a465-ffce987d353c\",\"Name\":\"cartofi taiati cuburi\",\"Amount\":200,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"78fe0cbb-0c33-4798-9aab-0e58b226b091\",\"Name\":\"\\u2022 1l apa\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"f98a94e5-4658-4e7d-b7bc-1de59e22a0b9\",\"Name\":\"\\u20221/2 lingurita sare\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"2fc12a9f-d3b1-4831-8a9c-8cb8052575a4\",\"Name\":\"\\u2022Putin piper macinat\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"0aea1e48-a7f9-49c7-89c7-b0299804fa0b\",\"Name\":\"\\u202240 gr branza crema ( optional )\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":8}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"4782be04-6c66-41a3-922e-e5843dfbc858\",\"StepNumber\":1,\"Text\":\"Ingrediente** : \\u202240 ml ulei de masline \\u20228 - 10 graunti de usturoi \\u2022300 gr conopida desfacuta in buchetele 200 gr cartofi taiati cuburi \\u2022 1l apa \\u20221/2 lingurita sare \\u2022Putin piper macinat \\u202240 gr branza crema ( optional )\"},{\"Id\":\"81582e81-647b-47d8-87bb-f1b71d658691\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"\\u2022Usturoiul \\u002B uleiul **2 sec turbo**\"},{\"Id\":\"5b6239df-4e4d-4f76-ad82-56042739e5bb\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"\\u2022Programati **5 min / 120 \\u00B0 / vit 1**\"},{\"Id\":\"adec6336-816e-4564-a688-444a92c5af51\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"\\u2022Adaugati apa , cartofii , conopida , sare , piper **25 min / 100 \\u00B0 / vit 2**\"},{\"Id\":\"d558638b-3d02-485d-bdb6-0f0f8c050386\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"\\u2022Lasati sa scada temperatura la **90 \\u00B0** si adaugati crema de branza **2 min / vit 10**\"},{\"Id\":\"639b641b-1a2c-4b37-93cb-2bfe42567f45\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"\\u2022 Serviti cu paine prajita ca orice crema\"},{\"Id\":\"b861afb4-0936-404b-a026-05f5add4c4f1\",\"StepNumber\":7,\"Text\":\"Un cub generos de unt\"},{\"Id\":\"6b2ad31f-91d2-4aef-8710-4b77ad4a2dcc\",\"StepNumber\":8,\"Text\":\"700g cartofi cur\\u0103\\u021Ba\\u021Bi \\u0219i t\\u0103ia\\u021Bi cuburi\"},{\"Id\":\"94b028ed-3f10-4ac1-8c1b-b1a3de901734\",\"StepNumber\":9,\"Text\":\"Crutoane pt servit(eu am pus paine prajita fara sare)\"},{\"Id\":\"bc0238bc-0b8e-4795-a70a-33c49b6af3a6\",\"StepNumber\":10,\"Text\":\"Am feliat usturoiul \\u0219i l-am sotat 3-4 minute in unt p\\u00E2n\\u0103 s-a \\u00EEnmuiat. Am ad\\u0103ugat \\u00EEn oala peste usturoi cartofii, apa \\u0219i am l\\u0103sat la fiert p\\u00E2n\\u0103 s-au \\u00EEnmuiat cartofii ( undeva la 20 min).\"},{\"Id\":\"8806aa0f-7fef-40d6-adc4-cccb66fd6271\",\"StepNumber\":11,\"Text\":\"Am pasat supa cu un blender vertical, am ad\\u0103ugat sm\\u00E2nt\\u00E2na, piper dup\\u0103 gust \\u0219i am omogenizat.\"},{\"Id\":\"550467e0-7c77-42f5-a17b-a53dd352bcca\",\"StepNumber\":12,\"Text\":\"Servi\\u021Bi cu p\\u0103trunjel verde pres\\u0103rat deasupra \\u0219i crutoane\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2286331",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2286331"
  },
  {
    "Id": "FEE7372A-1B42-41D0-9F65-4BFC992A5837",
    "Title": "Supa de chimen",
    "Description": "O sup\u0103 aromat\u0103 \u0219i reconfortant\u0103, perfect\u0103 pentru orice mas\u0103. Recomandat\u0103 pentru 4 por\u021bii.",
    "ImageUrl": "images/recipes/Supa_de_chimen.png",
    "PrepTime": "00:20:00",
    "CookTime": "00:30:00",
    "Servings": 4,
    "Difficulty": 2,
    "CuisineType": "Sup\u0103",
    "IsFavorite": 0,
    "Ingredients": "[{\"Id\":\"0f593087-afa6-431c-b7f7-027d789172c2\",\"Name\":\"ceapa\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":1},{\"Id\":\"06642083-6753-48e9-b18d-5ee1fe771717\",\"Name\":\"morcovi\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":2},{\"Id\":\"b6a506c5-70c9-4159-bdf7-3834d52de071\",\"Name\":\"r\\u0103d\\u0103cina de p\\u0103trunjel\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":3},{\"Id\":\"21372700-6aad-4bd0-913d-69e0b84aec16\",\"Name\":\"ap\\u0103\",\"Amount\":2,\"Unit\":\"litri\",\"Order\":4},{\"Id\":\"159eceec-75ef-4a0c-b3e1-2de1f49f1b0c\",\"Name\":\"semin\\u021Be de chimen\",\"Amount\":10,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":5},{\"Id\":\"d795af08-9265-4439-b14f-659435a7cfba\",\"Name\":\"o linguri\\u021B\\u0103 boia dulce\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":6},{\"Id\":\"ef06347c-0347-48c1-9b35-d91334309451\",\"Name\":\"concentrat de legume\",\"Amount\":15,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":7},{\"Id\":\"7d50a2b4-f480-4766-abeb-d39e7dbca1c1\",\"Name\":\"ulei\",\"Amount\":10,\"Unit\":\"g\",\"Order\":8},{\"Id\":\"879ef859-e080-4a07-835b-70d4c31663e7\",\"Name\":\"linguri\\u021B\\u0103 sare\",\"Amount\":1,\"Unit\":\"buc\",\"Order\":9},{\"Id\":\"d37c8091-31b5-498d-858a-a84e2d7495b3\",\"Name\":\"f\\u0103in\\u0103 (op\\u021Bional)\",\"Amount\":3,\"Unit\":\"tbsp\",\"Order\":10}]",
    "Instructions": "[{\"Id\":\"ab742cfb-16a1-49a1-a5c6-442f2fae01e3\",\"StepNumber\":2,\"Text\":\"Punem \\u00EEn bolul de mixare ceapa, morcovul, p\\u0103trunjelul \\u0219i apa. Setam 30 min/100 grade/ sens invers/ viteza lingur\\u0103. La final strecur\\u0103m.\"},{\"Id\":\"6b34904f-e53e-4495-848d-d10ef5a12bbc\",\"StepNumber\":3,\"Text\":\"Punem in bol uleiul \\u0219i semin\\u021Be de chimen, setam 5 min/120 grade/viteza 1.\"},{\"Id\":\"b4fb11fc-d023-451e-a6b8-308a8a793659\",\"StepNumber\":4,\"Text\":\"Adaug\\u0103m faina,boiaua dulce \\u0219i setam 3 min/120 grade/viteza 1.\"},{\"Id\":\"01540745-e4b2-490c-a66d-8416029c3b95\",\"StepNumber\":5,\"Text\":\"Adaug\\u0103 supa de la punctul 1, concentratul de legume, sarea si fierbem 5 min/100 grade/viteza 1. Strecuram printr-o sit\\u0103 fin\\u0103.\"},{\"Id\":\"72944c3c-f3f1-4d03-b86b-46d04c34cca2\",\"StepNumber\":6,\"Text\":\"Potrivim gustul \\u0219i punem crutoane aromate cu usturoi.\"}]",
    "ExportedAt": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2286331",
    "LastModified": "2026-01-12 14:15:04.2286331"
  }
]
